hadiths[462]{hadithnumber,text}:
"2016","Humein Suwaid bin Saeed, Abdullah bin Amir bin Zurara aur Masruq bin al-Marzban ne kaha: Humein Yahya bin Zakariya bin Abi Zaida ne Saleh bin Saleh bin Hayy se riwayat kiya, unhon ne Salama bin Kuhail se, unhon ne Saeed bin Jubair se, unhon ne Ibn Abbas (RA) se, unhon ne Umar bin al-Khattab (RA) se riwayat kiya ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne Hafsah (RA) ko talaq di thi, phir unhein lauta liya (ruju kiya)."
"2017","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : logon ko kya ho gaya hai ke Allah ki hudood (aur uskey qanoon) ko khel bana letey hain. aadmi (apni biwi sey) kehta hai : mainey tujhey Talaq di, mainey tujh sey ruju kiya, mainey tujhey Talaq di."
"2018","Humein Katheer bin Ubaid al-Himsi ne Muhammad bin Khalid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne Ubaidullah bin al-Waleed al-Wassafi se, unhon ne Muharib bin Dithar se, unhon ne Abdullah bin Umar (RA) se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Allah ta'ala ke nazdeek sab se zyada nafrat karda halaal talaq hai.\"""""
"2019","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey apni aurat ko Talaq di jabke wo haiz ke dinon mein thi. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney ye baat Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko batai to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey hukm do ke us sey ruju kar ley (aur usey Talaq na dey) yahan tak key wo (haiz sey) pak ho jaey, phir usey haiz aaye, phir wo pak ho, phir agar chahey to us sey hum bistar honey sey pehley Talaq dey aur chahey to usey (nikah mein) rok ley. ye wo iddat hai jis ka Allah ney hukm diya hai."
"2020","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Talaaqe sunnat ye hai ke aurat ko tuhur (paaki) ki haalat mein aur jima (sambhog) kiye baghair Talaq dey."
"2021","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney masnoon Talaq key barey mein farmaya : aurat ko har tuhur (paaki) main eik Talaq dey, jab teesri baar tuhur (paaki) aa ley to usey (aakhiri) Talaq dey dey, iskey baad wo eik haiz iddat guzaarey."
"2022","Hazrat Abu-Ghilaab Yunus bin Juber Baahli (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey puchha ke agar mard apni aurat ko haiz ke dinon mein Talaq dey dey (to kya hukm hai)? unhoney kaha : aap Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) ko jantey hain? usney apni biwi ko Talaq dey di thi jabke wo dinon mein thi (main tumhen apna waqia sunata hun). phir Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar maamla arz kiya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ruju kar leney ka hukm diya. mainey kaha : wo Talaq shumar hogi ? unhoney farmaya : agar wo aajiz ho ya himaqat karey to?"
"2023","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney apni biwi ko haiz ke dinon mein Talaq dey di . Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney ye baat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko batai to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey hukm do ke ruju kar ley, phir usey us waqt Talaq dey jab wo pak ho ( tuhur ke dinon mein ho) ya hamila ho."
"2024","Hazrat Aamir Shaabey (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Fatima binte Qais (Raziallahu anha) sey kaha : mujhey apni Talaq key barey mein bataaiye. unhoney farmaya : merey khawind ney mujhey teen talaaqein dey den jabke wo Yamen gaey huye they to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney usey nafiz (laagu) qarar dey diya."
"2025","Hazrat Mutrif bin Abdullah bin Shikhkhir (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anha) sey sawal kiya gaya ke eik aadmi apni biwi ko Talaq deta hai aur phir us sey mubashrat (sambhog) karta hai magar Talaq deney ya us sey ruju karney par gawah nahin banata (uska kya hukm hai)?  Hazrat Imran (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : tu ney sunnat key khilaf Talaq di aur sunnat key khilaf hi ruju kiya. uski Talaq par bhi gawah muqarrar kar aur ruju par bhi."
"2026","Hazrat Zuber bin Awam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Hazrat Umme Kulsoom binte Aqba (Raziallahu anha) unkey nikah mein thin. hamal ke dinon mein unhoney us (Zuber) sey kaha : eik Talaq dey kar mera dil khush kar dijiye. unhoney eik Talaq dey di. iskey baad wo namaz key liye chaley gaey, wapis aaye to Umme kulsoom (Raziallahu anha) key yahan wiladat ho chuki thi. unhoney kaha : usney ye kyon kiya? usney mujh sey dhoka kiya hai. Allah usey dhokey ki saza dey, phir wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye (aur waqia bayan kiya) to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah key qanoon key mutabiq muqarrar waqt guzar chuka. (ab (usey) dobara) nikah ka pegham dey do."
"2027","Hazrat Abu-Sanaabil (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Sabeeaa binte Haris Aslamiya (Raziallahu anha) key yahan , unkey khawind ki wafat sey bees din sey chand din baad wiladat ho gaee. jab wo nifaas sey farigh huin to unhoney nikah ka irada zahir kiya, is par logon ney tanqeed ki. aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key samney bhi unkey is kaam ka zikr huwa to aap ney farmaya : agar wo aisa karti hai to (jayez hai kyonkey) uski iddat guzar chuki hai."
"2028","Hazrat Masruq aur Hazrat Amr bin Utba (Rahimahullah)  sey riwayat hai ke un dono ney Hazrat Sabeeaa binte Haris (Raziallahu anha) ko khat likh kar unka waqia daryaft kiya to unhoney (jawab mein) un hazraat ko likha ke unkey yahan, unkey khawind ki wafat sey pachchees din baad wiladat ho gaee, chunanche unhoney achchhey kaam (nikah) key iradey sey tayyari ki. Hazrat Abu-Sanaabil bin Ba'kak (Raziallahu anhu) unkey paas sey guzrey to farmaya : tum ney jaldi ki, baad wali muddat , yani chaar maah das din mukammal honey tak iddat guzaaro. (wo farmaati hain : ) mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz ki : Allah key Rasool ! merey liye maghfirat ki dua kijiye. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : wo kyon? mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko waqiey sey aagah kiya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar tumhen nek khawind mil jaey to nikah kar lo."
"2029","Humein Nasr bin Ali aur Muhammad bin Bashar ne kaha: Humein Abdullah bin Dawood ne Hisham bin Urwa se riwayat kiya aur unhon ne apne waalid (Urwa) se aur unhon ne al-Miswar bin Makhrama (RA) se riwayat kiya ke Nabi (SAW) ne Subai'ah (RA) ko hukm diya ke jab woh nifas (bache ki paidaish ke baad) se pak ho jaayein to nikah kar len."
"2030","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : qism hai Allah ki ! jo shakhs chahey hum us sey mubaahala kar (eik doosre ko laanat karna) saktey hain ke aurton key masaayel ki chhoti sura (Sura- Talaaq) chaar maah das din ka hukm nazil honey key baad nazil hui thi."
"2031","Hazrat Zenab binte Kaab bin Ajra (Raziallahu anha) jo Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ki zauja (biwi) mohtarma thin, Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ki behan Hazrat Fariaa binte Malik (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat karti hain, unhoney farmaya : merey shohar apney kuchh (bhagey huye) ghulamon ki talash mein nikley. (aakhir) \qudoom\"" jagah key qarib unhen ja liya. ghulamon ney unhen shaheed kar diya. jab mujhey merey khawind ki wafat ki khabar mili to main apney khandan key mohalley sey door ansaar key eik makaan mein rihaaish pazeer (reh rahi) thi. main Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey khawind ki wafat ki khabar is haal mein mili hai ke main eik aisey makaan mein reh rahi hun jo merey khandan key mohalley sey bhi door hai aur merey bhaiyon key gharon sey bhi door hai. aur usney koi maal bhi nahin chhoda jis sey mera kharch chalta rahey"," na koi maal chhoda hai jo mujhey tarkey mein miley"," na un ki milkiyat mein koi ghar tha. agar aap munasib samjhen to mujhey ijazat dey den ke main apney aqaarib aur apney bhaiyon key ghar chali jaun. mujhey ye baat ziyada pasand hai aur is sey merey (roz marra key) kaam behtar tor par chaltey rahengey. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar tum chaho to yun hi kar lo. wo farmaati hain : main bahar nikli to mujhey is baat ki khushi thi ke Allah ney apney Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki zaban sey merey haq mein faisla farmaya. main abhi masjid hi mein thi ya ghar key sehan hi mein thi ke aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey (dobara) talab farma liya"," phir farmaya : tum ney kaisey bayan kiya? mainey dobara soorate haal pesh ki. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab tak Allah ki muqarrar karda muddat (maut ki iddat) puri nahin ho jati"," usi ghar mein rihaaish rakho jahan tumhen apney khawind ki wafat ki khabar pahunchi. chunanche mainey chaar maah das din tak wahin iddat guzaari."""
"2032","Hazrat Urwa bin Zuber (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Marwan key paas gaya aur un sey kaha : aap key khandan ki eik aurat ko Talaq ho gaee hai. mera guzar uskey yahaan sey huwa to dekha ke wo (kisi aur ghar mein) muntaqil ho rahi hai. wo kehti hai : hamein Hazrat Fatima bint Qais (Raziallahu anha) ney muntaqil honey ko kaha hai aur bataya hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen (Fatima binte Qais (Raziallahu anha) ko) rihaaish tabdeel kar leney ka hukm diya tha. Marwan ney kaha : unhon (Fatima) ney hi unhen aisa karney ko kaha hai. Urwa (Rahimahullah) farmatey hain ke mainey kaha : qism hai Allah ki ! Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney is par tanqeed ki thi aur kaha tha ke Fatima eik wiran ghar mein thin aur unhen khatra tha (ke akeli paa kar koi bura chahney wala nuqsan pahunchaney ki koshish na karey) isliye Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen ijazat di thi."
"2033","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya ke Hazrat Fatima binte Qais (Raziallahu anha) ney arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey dar lagta hai ke koi merey ghar mein na ghus aaye to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen muntaqil ho janey ka hukm dey diya."
"2034","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : meri khaala ko Talaq ho gaee. unhoney apney khajuron key darakhton ka phal utaarna chaha. eik aadmi ney unhen ghar sey nikal kar (baagh mein) janey sey mana kiya to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin (aur masla poochha). aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : haan ! apni khajuron ka phal utaar lo, shayad tum sadqa karo ya koi neki ka kaam karo."
"2035","Humein Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah aur Ali bin Muhammad ne kaha: Humein Waki' ne Sufyan se riwayat kiya, unhon ne Abu Bakr bin Abi al-Jahm bin Sakhr al-Adwi se riwayat kiya, unhon ne kaha: Maine Fatima bint Qais (RA) ko suna, woh kehti thin ke unke shohar ne unhein teen talaq de di, to Rasool Allah (SAW) ne na unke liye koi ghar muqarrar kiya aur na nafqah."
"2036","Hazrat Fatima binte Qais (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya ke mujhey merey khawind ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein teen talaaqein dey den to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : terey liye na rihaaish hai na kharch."
"2037","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Umra binte Joon‬ (Raziallahu anha) ko jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kiya gaya (jab un ki rukhsati hui) to unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey Allah ki panah maangi (ye kaha : aap sey Allah bachaey). Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tu ney uski panah li hai jiski panah li jati hai. chunanche aap ney isey Talaq dey di. aur Hazrat Usama (Raziallahu anhu) ya Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm diya to unhoney usey teen safed sooti kapdey dey diye."
"2038","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab aurat khawind sey Talaq mil janey ka daawey karey aur eik qabile-aitimaad gawah pesh kar dey to uskey khawind sey qism uthaney ka mutalba kiya jaeyga. agar usney qism kha li (ke mainey Talaq nahin di) to gawah ki gawahi raddh ho jaeygi. aur agar usney qism sey inkar kiya to uska inkar doosrey gawah key qaaim maqam ho jaeyga aur uski Talaq nafiz (laagu) kar di jaeygi."
"2039","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen cheezen qasd (irada) aur iraday sey ki jaeyn to bhi haqeeqi (shumar hoti) hain aur hansi mazaq mein ki jaeyn to bhi haqeeqi (shumar hoti) hain : nikah, Talaq aur ruju."
"2040","Humein Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah ne Ali bin Mushar aur Abda bin Sulaiman se riwayat kiya. Aur Humaid bin Mas'adah ne Khalid bin al-Harith se riwayat kiya. Ye sab Saeed bin Abi Uruba se, unhon ne Qatadah se, unhon ne Zurara bin Aufa se, unhon ne Abu Huraira (RA) se riwayat kiya. Unhon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Allah ta'ala ne meri ummat ke liye un khayalat ko maaf kar diya hai jo dil mein aate hain"," jab tak ke un par amal na kiya jaye ya unhein zaban se na kaha jaye.\"""""
"2041","Humein Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah ne Yazid bin Haroon se riwayat kiya. Aur Humein Muhammad bin Khalid bin Khidash aur Muhammad bin Yahya ne Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi se riwayat kiya. Unhon ne Hammad bin Salama ne Hammad (bin Abi Sulaiman) se, unhon ne Ibrahim an-Nakhai se, unhon ne Aswad se, unhon ne Aisha (RA) se riwayat kiya ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Teen logon se qalam utha liya gaya hai: Sone wale se jab tak woh jag na jaye"," bachche se jab tak woh bulugh ko na pahonche"," aur paagal se jab tak woh hosh mein aa jaye.\"" Abu Bakr (bin Abi Shaibah) ne apni riwayat mein ye bhi kaha: \""Aur us shaks se jo aafat mein mubtala hai jab tak woh sehatyab na ho jaye.\"""""
"2042","Humein Muhammad bin Bashar ne Rawh bin Ubadah se riwayat kiya, unhon ne Ibn Juraij se, unhein Qasim bin Yazid ne khabar di, unhon ne Ali bin Abi Talib (RA) se riwayat kiya ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Qalam utha liya gaya hai bachche se aur paagal se aur sone wale se.\"""""
"2043","Humein Ibrahim bin Muhammad bin Yusuf al-Firyabi ne Ayyub bin Suwaid se riwayat kiya, unhon ne Abu Bakr al-Huzali se, unhon ne Shahr bin Hawshab se, unhon ne Abu Zar al-Ghilfari (RA) se riwayat kiya ke Rasool Allah (SAW) ne farmaya: \Allah ta'ala ne meri ummat se chook (gh"""
"2044","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala ney meri ummat key unkey dilon mein aaney waley waswasey maaf kar diye hain, jab tak un par amal na karen, ya unhen zaban sey ada na karen aur (wo gunah bhi maaf kar diye hain) jin par unhen zabardasti majbur kya jaey."
"2045","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala ney meri ummat sey ghalati , bhool aur wo gunah maaf kar diye hain jin par unhen zabardasti majbur kiya gaya ho."
"2046","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : zabardasti mein na Talaq hoti hai, na ghulam azad hota hai."
"2047","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib ney apney walid sey , aur unhoney apney dada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma)) sey riwayat ki, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya is (aurat) ko Talaq nahin (di ja sakti) jo Talaq deney waley ki milkiyat (nikah mein) na ho."
"2048","Hazrat Miswar bin Makhrima (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nikah sey pehley Talaq nahin aur Malik ban'ney sey pehley ghulam ka azad karna (durust) nahin."
"2049","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nikah sey pehley Talaq nahin."
"2050","Imam (Abdur-Rehman bin Amr) Auzaai (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Imam (Muhammad bin Muslim Shahab) Zohri (Rahimahullah) sey puchha ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki kis zauja (biwi) mohtarma ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey Allah ki panah maangi thi? unhoney kaha : mujhey Hazrat Urwa (Rahimahullah) ney Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat kartey huye bataya ke binte Joon (Raziallahu anha) jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key paas (khilwat mein) pahunchin to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) unkey qarib gaey, unhoney kaha : main aap sey Allah ki panah chahti hun to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tu ney azeem hasti ki panah ley li, apney ghar walon key paas chali ja."
"2051","Hazrat Yazeed bin Rukana (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney apni biwi ko Talaqe-bitta (teen Talaq) dey di, phir unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar masla daryaft kiya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : is (lafz) sey teri niyat kya thi? unhoney kaha : eik Talaq ki. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya Allah ki qism utha kar kehtey ho ke tumhari niyat eik hi Talaq ki thi? unhoney kaha : qism hai Allah ki ! meri niyat sirf eik Talaq ki thi. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us khatoon ko dobara unkey sath rehney ki ijazat dey di (aur Sabab ko ruju karney ki ijazat dey di). Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : mainey Abul-Hasan Ali bin Muhammad Tanaafusi ko farmatey huye suna : ye hadees kitni achchhi hai ! (kyonkey is sey wazeh taur par Sabit hota hai ke Talaqe bitta (teen Talaq) mein mard ki niyat par faisla hoga. agar mard ney eik Talaq ki niyat ki hogi to eik waqey hogi, agar teen ki niyat hogi to teeno waqey ho jaeyngi).  isi ke saath Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : Abu-Ubaid ko Naajiya ney tark kiya hua qarar diya aur Imam Ahmed ney us sey riwayat karney ki jur'at nahin ki."
"2052","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hamein ikhtiyar diya. hamney aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (ki zojiyat (nikah) mein rehney) ko muntakhab (ikhtiyar) kar liya. to aap ney isey (Talaq waghera) kuchh bhi shumar nahin kiya."
"2053","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab Sura Ehzaab ki ye aayat nazil hui : (وَإِن كُنتُنَّ تُرِدْنَ ٱللَّهَ وَرَسُولَهُۥ),''agar tum Allah ki, uskey Rasool ki aur aakhirat key ghar ki Talib ho to Allah ney tum mein sey neki karney waaliyon key liye ajrr-azeem tayyar kar rakha hai.'' to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) merey paas tashrif laye aur farmaya : Aaisha ! main tujhey eik baat keh raha hun, behtar hai ke to is (ka faisla kerney) mein jaldi na karna balke apney waliden sey mashwara kar lena. Ummul-mominin ney kaha : Allah ki qism ! (aap ney mashwara leney ko isliye farmaya tha ke) aap ko yaqin tha ke merey waliden mujhey kabhi aap sey judai ka mashwara nahin dengey. Ummul-mominin (Raziallahu anha) farmati hain : (ye farmaney key baad) aap ney mujhey wo aayaat padh kar sunaee : (يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلنَّبِىُّ قُل لِّأَزْوَجِكَ إِن كُنتُنَّ تُرِدْنَ ٱلْحَيَوةَ ٱلدُّنْيَا وَزِينَتَهَا),''aey Nabi ! apni biwiyon sey farma dijiye ke agar tumhen duniya ki zindagi aur duniya ki zeb aur zeenat matloob hai to aao main tumhen kuchh maal dey kar achchhey tareeqey sey rukhsat kar dun. aur agar tum Allah ki, uskey Rasool ki aur aakhirat key ghar ki Talib ho to Allah ney tum mein sey neki karney waaliyon key liye ajre-azeem tayyar kar rakha hai.'' mainey kaha : (aey Allah key Rasool ! ) kya main is mamley mein apney waliden sey mashwara karun? mainey (duniya ki dolat key muqabley mein) Allah aur uskey Rasool (ki raza aur mohabbat) ka intikhaab (chunaaw) kar liya hai."
"2054","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo aurat baghair kisi waaqe sabab key apney khawind sey Talaq maangeygi, usey jannat ki khushbu nahin aayegi, halanke uski khushbu chaalis saal key fasley sey mehsus hoti hai."
"2055","Hazrat Soban (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis aurat ney baghair sakht majburi key apney khawind sey Talaq maangi, is par jannat ki khushbu haram hai."
"2056","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Jameela binte Salool‬ (Raziallahu anha) ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kiya : Allah ki qism ! main Sabit (bin Qais bin Shamaas) (Raziallahu anhu) key Deen aur akhlaq (ki kisi kharabi) ki wajeh sey naraz nahin lekin mujhey musalman hotey huye (khaawind ki) nashukri karna achchha nahin lagta. mujhey wo itney burey lagtey hain ke main unkey sath nahin reh sakti. to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney isey farmaya : kya tum usey uska baagh wapis dey do gi? unhoney kaha : ji haan. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ko hukm diya ke un sey baagh wapis ley lein aur zayed kuchh na lein."
"2057","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Habiba binte Sehal (Raziallahu anha) Hazrat Sabit bin Qais bin Shamas (Raziallahu anhu) key nikah mein thin, aur wo khush shakal aadmi na they. Hazrat Habiba (Raziallahu anha) ney arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! qism hai Allah ki ! agar Allah ka dar na hota to jab wo merey paas aaye they, main unkey chehrey par thook deti. to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tum uska baagh wapis karti ho? unhoney kaha : ji haan. (hadees ke raawi ney kaha : ) chunanche unhoney unka baagh wapis kar diya aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unkey darmiyan judai karwa di."
"2058","Hazrat Ubada bin Waleed (Rahimahullah) ney Hazrat Rabee binte Muawwiz bin Ifra Raziallahu anhum sey riwayat kartey huye farmaya ke mainey unhen kaha : mujhey apna waqia sunaaiye. unhoney farmaya : mainey apney khawind sey Khula ley liya, phir mainey Hazrat Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar puchha : mujh par kitni iddat hai? unhoney farmaya : tum par koi iddat nahin, siwaye is surat key ke usney tujh sey thoda arsa pehley hambistari ki ho, tab tum uskey paas thahri raho yahan tak key eik haiz aa jaey. Hazrat Rabee (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : Usman (Raziallahu anhu) ney us muqaddmey mein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key us faisley ki perwi ki thi jo aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Maryam Maghaliyya‬ (Raziallahu anha) key barey mein diya tha. wo Hazrat Sabit bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) key nikah mein thin, phir unhoney Khula ley liya tha."
"2059","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney qism kha li ke aap eik mahina azwaje-mutahrat (paak biwiyon) Raziallahu anhu key paas tashrif nahin ley jaeyngey, chunanche aap untees din thehrey rahey. jab teeswen din ki Sham hui to aap merey yahaan tashrif ley aaye. mainey arz kiya : aap ney qism khai thi ke mahina bhar aap hamarey paas tashrif nahin laeyngey (aur abhi untees din purey huye hain, subah teeswaan din hoga). to aap ney teen baar ungliyon ka ishara kartey huye farmaya : mahina itna hota hai (tees din ka). aur (doosri baar) sari ungliyon sey (do baar ishara farma kar teesri baar eik ungli band ki, aur farmaya : aur mahina itna bhi hota hai) untees din ka."
"2060","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney isliye elaa (alhedgi ikhtiyar) kiya tha ke Ummul-mominin Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ney aap ka bheja huwa hadiya wapis kar diya tha. (is par) Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney kaha : Zenab (Raziallahu anha) ney aap ki azmat aur shaan ka khayal nahin kiya. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ghussa aa gaya aur aap ney un (sab) sey elaa (alhedgi ikhtiyar) kar liya ."
"2061","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney apni baaz azwaje-mutahrat (biwiyon) Raziallahu anhu sey eik mahiney key liye elaa (alhedgi ikhtiyar) kiya. jab untees din ho gaey to (teeswen din) Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) subah ya Sham key waqt (key paas) paak biwiyon ke paas tashrif ley gaey. arz kiya gaya : aey Allah key Rasool ! abhi untees din guzrey hain. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mahina untees din ka hai."
"2062","Hazrat Salma bin Sakhr Bayaazi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mujhey aurton sey bahut raghbat (dilchaspi) thi. merey khayal mein koi mard itni kasrat sey sohbat nahin karta hoga jis kasrat sey main karta tha. jab Ramzan shuru huwa to mainey Ramzan khatam honey tak biwi sey zihar kar liya . eik raat wo mujh sey baaten kar rahi thi ke uskey jism ka kuch hissa khul gaya. main be qabu ho kar us sey hum bistar ho gaya . jab subh hui to mainey apni qom (key kuchh afrad) key paas ja kar apna waqia sunaya aur unhen kaha : mujhey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey (masla) poochh den (ke uska kaffara kya hai)? unhoney kaha : hum log to nahin poochhengey. (agar hamney puchha to) Allah Taala hamarey barey mein Quran Majeed (ki aayaat) nazil farma dega, ya Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) kuchh (narazi waley) alfaz irshad farma dengey jo hamarey liye aar ka baais baney rahen gey, isliye hum terey gunah key badley tujhi ko bhejtey hain. to khud hi ja kar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein apna maamla arz kar. (Hazrat Salma (Raziallahu anhu) farmatey hain)  main rawana huwa yahan tak key aap ki khidmat mein hazir ho gaya aur apna waqia arz kiya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tu ney ye kaam kiya hai? mainey kaha : mainey ye kaam kiya hai aur aey Allah key Rasool ! main hazir hun. Allah ka merey barey mein jo hukm hoga, is par sabr (aur usey dil sey qubul) karta hun. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : eik gardan (ghulam ya londi) azad kar do. mainey kaha : qism hai us zaat ki jisney aap ko haq dey kar mab-us farmaya (bheja) hai ! main to sirf apni is gardan ka Malik hun. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tab musalsal do maah key rozey rakh lo. mainey arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujh par jo aazmaaish aai hai, ye bhi rozon hi ki wajeh sey aai hai. aap ney farmaya : tab sadqa kar. ya farmaya : saath miskinon ko khana khila. mainey kaha : qism hai us zaat ki jisney aap ko haq dey kar mab-us farmaya (Bheja) hai ! hamney to ye raat isi tarah guzaari hai ke hamarey paas Sham ka khana bhi nahin tha. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qabila banu zuraiq ki zakat jama karney waley aamil key paas ja, usey keh ke wo (apney qabiley ki) zakat tujhey dey dey. (us mein sey) saath miskinon ko khana khila dey aur baqi sey khud faeyda utha lena."
"2063","Hazrat Urwa bin Zuber (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha ke Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ney farmaya : Allah badi barkaton wala hai jo sab kuchh sunta hai. jab Hazrat Khaula binte Solba (Raziallahu anha) Rasul Allah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey apney khawind (Hazrat Aus bin Samit (Raziallahu anhu)) ki shikayat kar rahi thin to main bhi un ki baaten sun rahi thi lekin kuchh baaten (qarib honey key bawajood) meri samajh mein na aati thin . wo keh rahi thin : aey Allah key Rasool ! (mera khaawind) meri jawani kha gaya, mainey uskey liye (bachchey jann jann kar) pet khaali kar diya. ab jabke main boodhi ho gaee hun aur mujhey aulad hona band ho gaee hai to usney mujh sey zihar kar liya hai. ya Allah ! main tujhi sey shikayat karti hun. wo abhi wahin thin ke Jibreel (Alaihissalam) ye aayaat ley kar nazil ho gaey : (قَدْ سَمِعَ ٱللَّهُ قَوْلَ ٱلَّتِى تُجَـٰدِلُكَ فِى زَوْجِهَا وَتَشْتَكِىٓ إِلَى"
"2064","Hazrat Salma bin Sakhr Bayaazi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke zihar karney wala jo mard kaffara ada karney sey pehley mubashrat kar ley, uskey barey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (uskey zimmey) eik hi kaffara hai."
"2065","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney apni biwi sey zihar kiya, phir kaffara ada karney sey pehley us sey hum bistar ho gaya, phir usney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar waqia arz kiya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tu ney aisa kyon kiya? usney kaha : Allah key Rasool ! chaandni mein meri nazar uski paazebon par padi , phir mujhey apney aap par qabu na raha , aur main us sey mubashrat kar betha Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hans padey aur usey hukm diya ke kaffara ada karney sey pehley uskey qarib na jaey."
"2066","Hazrat Sehal bin Saad Saaid (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat Aasim bin Adi (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aaye aur kaha : mujhey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye baat poochh kar bataaiye ke agar koi shakhs apni biwi key sath kisi (ghair) mard ko (gunah mein mulawwis) dekhey aur (ghussey mein aa kar) usey qatl kar dey to kya usey (qisaas mein) qatl kiya jaeyga? warna wo kya kerey? Hazrat Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye (masla) daryaft kiya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney (is qism key) sawalat ko na-pasand farmaya. baad mein Hazrat Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) Hazrat Aasim (Raziallahu anhu) sey miley to un sey daryaft kiya aur kaha : tum ney kya kiya? unhoney kaha : huwa ye hai ke tujh sey mujhey bhalai nahin pahunchi. mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey (masla)  daryaft kiya to aap ney sawalat ko na-pasand farmaya. Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : Allah ki qism ! main zarur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar ye baat poochhunga, chunanche wo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye to malum huwa ke aap par unkey barey mein wahi nazil ho chuki hai. aap ney un dono (miyan biwi) mein liaan  kara diya. Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : Allah key Rasool ! agar ab main is aurat ko (ghar) ley jaun to (iska matlab hai ke) mainey is par jhoota ilzam lagaya hai, chunanche unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key hukm deney sey pehley hi is aurat ko Talaq dey di, phir liaan karney walon mein yehi tariqa jari ho gaya. iskey baad Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dekho ! agar us aurat key yahan siyah faam (rang), siyah aakhon wala, badey sirinon (peeth) wala bachcha paida huwa to merey khayal mein us (Uwemir (Raziallahu anhu)) ney yaqinan sach kaha hai. aur agar uskey yahaan bair bahuti jaisa surkh bachcha paida huwa to merey khayal mein us (Uwemir) ney zarur jhoot bola hai.  Raavi bayan kartey hain : phir us aurat key yahan buri surat wala bachcha paida huwa."
"2067","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Hilal bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar apni biwi par Shareek bin Sehma (Raziallahu anhu) sey mulawwis honey ka ilzam lagaya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : gawah pesh karo, warna tumhari peeth par (qazaf ki) had lagey gi. Hazrat Hilal bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : qism hai us zaat ki jisney aap ko haq key sath mab-us farmaya (bheja) hai, main bilkul sachcha hun. aur Allah Taala merey mamley mein zarur (wahi) nazil farma dega jis sey meri peeth (had lagney sey) bach jaeygi. to Raavi farmatey hain ke tab ye aayaat nazil huin : (وَٱلَّذِينَ يَرْمُونَ أَزْوَجَهُمْ وَلَمْ يَكُن لَّهُمْ شُهَدَآءُ إِلَّآ أَنفُسُهُمْ . . . وَٱلْخَـٰمِسَةَ أَنَّ غَضَبَ ٱللَّهِ عَلَيْهَآ إِن كَانَ مِنَ ٱلصَّـٰدِقِينَ),''aur wo log jo apni biwiyon par tohmat lagatey hain aur unkey paas apney siwa koi gawah na hon to un mein sey eik ki shahadat is tarah hogi ke chaar baar Allah ki qism kha kar kahey ke beshak wo sachchon mein sey hai. aur paanchwin baar ye kahey ke agar wo jhooton mein sey ho to is par Allah ki lanat ho. aur aurat sey tab saza talti hai ke wo chaar baar Allah ki qism kha kar kahey ke bila-shubah wo (uska khawind ( jhooton mein sey hai aur paanchwen baar ye kahey ke agar wo (uska khaawind) sachchon mein sey ho to us (aurat) par Allah ka ghazab ho.'' Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) lotey to un dono ko bula bheja, wo aagey to Hilal bin Umayya (Raziallahu anhu) ney khadey ho kar gawahi di aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) farma rahey they : Allah Taala ko malum hai ke tum mein sey eik jhoota hai to kya dono mein sey koi eik tauba karta hai? phir khatoon khadi hui aur usney gawahi di (aur qasmen khaaeen) jab wo paanchwin (gawahi) key waqt ye kehney lagi ke agar wo jhooti ho to is par Allah ka ghazab nazil ho. to haazirin ney isey kaha : ye qism (Allah key ghazab ko) wajib kar deney wali hai. Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ney bayan farmaya : (ye sun kar) usney twaqquf kiya (thehri), aur peechhey hati yahan tak key hamein ye khayal paida huwa ke wo (be-gunah honey key dawey sey) ruju kar ley gi, phir usney kaha : qism hai Allah ki ! main apni qom ko hamesha key liye badnaam nahin karungi (aur paanchwin qism bhi kha li). to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya is (key yahan wiladat honey) ka intizar karo. agar usney surmain aakhon wala , badiy peeth wala, moti pindliyon wala bachcha jana to wo Shareek bin Sehma ka hoga. (waqt aaney par) uskey yahaan aisa hi bachcha paida huwa. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar Allah ki kitab ka hukm nazil na ho chuka hota to mera us aurat sey (doosra) maamla hota."
"2068","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Jumey ki raat hum log masjid mein they ke eik aadmi ney kaha : agar koi mard apni biwi key sath kisi (ghair) mard ko (gunah ki haalat mein) dekh kar qatl kar dey to tum log usey (qisaas key tor par) qatl kar dogey. agar wo (apni biwi key mujrim honey ki) baat karey to tum usey (ilzam taraashi ki saza key tor par) kodey lagaogey. qism hai Allah ki ! main ye baat zaroor Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey arz karunga. aakhir kaar usney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey zikr kar diya to Allah Taala ney liaan ki aayat nazil farma den. uskey baad us aadmi ney aa kar apni biwi par ilzam lagaya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney un dono (miyan biwi) key darmiyan liaan karwa diya. aur farmaya : shayad us aurat key yahan siyah faam (rang) bachcha paida ho.  chunanche siyah faam (rang) aur ghunghriyaaley baalon wala bachcha hi paida huwa."
"2069","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik mard ney apni aurat sey liaan kiya aur uskey betey ko apna man'ney sey inkar kiya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney un dono key darmiyan judai kara di aur bachchey ko aurat key sath kar diya."
"2070","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik Ansari aadmi ney qabila banu Ajlan ki eik aurat sey nikah kiya, chunanche usney us sey sohbat ki aur raat bhar uskey paas raha. jab subah hui to usney kaha : mainey isey baakara (kanwari) nahin paya. uska muqadma Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kiya gaya to aap ney ladki ko bula kar daryaft kiya to usney kaha : main to baakara (kanwari) thi , chunanche Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney un dono mein liaan karwaya aur ladki ko haq mehar dilwaya."
"2071","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chaar aurton sey liaan nahin kiya jata : musalman mard ki Esai biwi, musalman mard ki Yahudi biwi, ghulam khawind ki azad biwi aur azad khawind ki wo biwi jo (kisi aur ki) londi ho."
"2072","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney apni biwiyon sey elaa kiya aur (un ko apney oopper)  haram kar liya, halal chiz ko haram kiya aur qism ka kaffara ada kiya."
"2073","Hazrat Saeed bin Juber (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ney halal chiz ko haram kar leney key barey mein farmaya : ye qism hai. aur Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) farmaya kartey they : ( لَّقَدْ كَانَ لَكُمْ فِى رَسُولِ ٱللَّهِ أُسْوَةٌ"
"2074","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Barira (Raziallahu anhuma) ko azad kiya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen ikhtiyar dey diya aur unka khawind azad tha."
"2075","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Barira (Raziallahu anha) key shohar ghulam they. unhen Mughees (Raziallahu anhu) kehtey they. (mujhey wo manzar yad hai) goya main un (Mughees) ko dekh raha hun ke wo Barira (Raziallahu anha) key peechhey rotey phir rahey hain aur unkey rukhsaaron par aansu beh rahey hain to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey farmaya : aey Abbas ! kya aap ko tajjub nahin hota ke Mughees Barira sey (shadeed) mohabbat karta hai aur Barira (Raziallahu anha) Mughees (Raziallahu anhu) sey (shadeed) nafrat karti hai? (eik baar) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Barira (Raziallahu anha) sey farmaya : kaash! ! tum un sey ruju kar lo, aakhir wo tumharey bachchon key baap hain. unhoney kaha : Allah key Rasool ! aap mujhey hukm farma rahey hain? Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main to sifarish karta hun. to unhoney kaha : mujhey un ki koi zarurat nahin."
"2076","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Barira (Raziallahu anha) ki wajeh sey teen sunnatein qaaim huin (aur teen sharae masaayel malum huye :)  (eik ye ke) jab wo azad huin to unhen ikhtiyar diya gaya . aur unka khawind ghulam tha. (doosri ye ke) log unhen sadqa detey they, wo (us sey kuchh) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko hadiya dey deti thin. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) farmatey they : ye is par sadqa hai, aur hamarey liye hadiya hai. (teesri ye ke) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : wala usi ka hai jo azad karey."
"2077","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Barira (Raziallahu anha) ko teen haiz iddat guzarney ka hukm diya gaya."
"2078","humein isma'eel bin toba ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne 'abbad bin al-'awwam se, unhon ne yahya bin abi ishaq se, unhon ne abdur rahman bin uzeena se, unhon ne abu huraira se, ke rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne barera ko ikhtiyar diya."
"2079","humein muhammad bin tarif aur ibrahim bin sa'id al-jawhari ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne 'umar bin shabib al-musalli se, unhon ne abdullah bin 'isa se, unhon ne 'atiyya se, unhon ne ibn 'umar se, unhon ne kaha ke rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \laundi ki talaq do martaba hai aur us ki iddat do haiz hai.\"""""
"2080","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : londi ki talaaqein do hain aur us (ki iddat) key haiz bhi do hain.  abu-Aasim (Rahimahullah) ney kaha : mainey is hadees ka Mazaahir sey zikr kiya aur kaha : aap mujh sey isi tarah hadees bayan karen jis tarah ibne-Jurej sey bayan ki hai, chunanche unhoney Qasim key wastey sey Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat bayan ki ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : londi ki do talaaqein hain aur uski iddat do haiz hai."
"2081","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey aaqa ney apni londi sey mera nikah kar diya tha. ab wo usey mujh sey juda karna chahta hai. hadees ke raavi ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) member par tashrif farma huye aur farmaya : logo ! kya wajeh hai ke koi shakhs apney ghulam sey apni londi ka nikah kar deta hai, phir un dono mein judai dalna chahta hai? Talaq dena to usi ka haq hai jisney pindli ko pakda."
"2082","Hazrat Abul-Hasan Mola banu Naufal (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey puchha gaya ke agar ghulam apni biwi ko (jo kisi ki londi ho) do talaaqein dey dey, phir wo dono azad ho jaeyn to kya wo us sey (dobara) nikah kar sakta hai? unhoney kaha : haan. un sey kaha gaya : (aap ye masla) kis sey (riwayat kartey hain)? unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney yehi faisla diya tha. Hazrat Abdullah bin Mubarak (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : Abul-Hasan ney apni gardan par bahut badi chattan utha li hai."
"2083","humein 'ali bin muhammad ne riwayat kiya, waki' ne hum se riwayat kiya, unhon ne sa'id bin abi 'aruba se, unhon ne matar al-warraq se, unhon ne raja bin haiwa se, unhon ne qabisa bin zu'ayb se, unhon ne 'amr bin al-'as se, unhon ne kaha: \hamare nabi muhammad (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki sunnat ko bigaRo nahi. umm al-walad ki iddat char mah aur das din hai.\"""""
"2084","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Umme-Salma aur Ummul-mominin Umme-Habiba (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik aurat ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kiya ke uski eik beti ka khawind faut ho gaya hai aur uski aankhen kharab ho gaee hain aur wo chahti hai ke (aakhon key ilaj key liye) uski aakhon mein surma lagaey (to kya ye jayez hai)? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (jahiliyat mein to) aurat saal pura guzarney par mengni phenka karti thi. (Islaamii shariyat mein to) ye iddat sirf chaar mahiney das din hai."
"2085","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aurat key liye jayez nahin ke khawind key siwa kisi faut honey waley par teen din sey ziyada sog karey."
"2086","Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki zauja mohtarma (biwi) Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah aur aakhirat par eman rakhney wali kisi aurat key liye jayez nahin ke khawind key siwa kisi faut honey waley par teen din sey ziyada sog kerey."
"2087","Hazrat Umme Atiya (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aurat kisi faut honey waley par teen din sey ziyada sog na karey , magar biwi apney khawind par chaar mahiney das din sog kerey. (us doran mein) wo rangin kapda na pehney, magar kuchh safed kuchh rangin kapda pehan sakti hai, aur surma na lagaey h, aur khushbu na lagaey magar (maahwari sey farigh ho kar) ghusl key moqey par thodi si ood hindi ya azfaar khushbu istimal kar ley."
"2088","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : merey nikah main eik aurat thi, mujhey wo pasand thi lekin abba jaan usey pasand nahin kartey they. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ye baat batai to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey hukm diya ke usey Talaq dey dun, chunanche mainey usey Talaq dey di."
"2089","Hazrat abu-Abdur-Rehman (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ko uskey walid ya walida ney hukm diya ke apni biwi ko Talaq dey dey to usney sau ghulam azad karney ki nazar maan li (agar wo biwi ko Talaq dey to so ghulam azad kerega). wo Hazrat Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) key paas aaya to dekha ke wo zuhaa (chaasht) ki namaz padh rahey hain aur usey taweel (lambi) kartey jatey hain. (Zohar ki namaz key baad bhi) unhoney Zohar sey Asr tak (nafl) namaz ada ki. (aakhir jab moqey mila to) usney un sey masla poochha. Hazrat Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : apni nazar puri kar aur waliden ki farman-bardari kar. Hazrat Abu-Darda (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey (ye farman) suna hai : baap jannat ka darmiyan wala darwaza hai. ab (tumhari marzi hai) apney waliden ka khayal rakho ya na rakho."
"2090","Hazrat Rifaa bin Araaba Juhni (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab qism khatey to yun farmatey : qism hai us zaat ki jis key haath mein Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki jaan hai."
"2091","humein hisham bin 'ammar ne riwayat kiya, abdul malik bin muhammad al-san'ani ne riwayat kiya, al-awza'i ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne yahya bin abi kathir se, unhon ne hilal bin abi maimuna se, unhon ne 'ata bin yasar se, unhon ne rifa'a bin 'araba al-juhani se, unhon ne kaha: rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki qasam jo wo khaate the wo thi: \main allah ke samne gawahi deta hoon ki us zaat ki qasam jis ke haath mein meri jaan hai.\"""""
"2092","humein abu ishaq al-shafi'i ibrahim bin muhammad bin al-'abbas ne riwayat kiya, abdullah bin raja al-makki ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne 'abbad bin ishaq se, unhon ne ibn shihab se, unhon ne salim se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne kaha: rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki aksar qasam ye thi: \nahi"," dilo ko pherne wali zaat ki qasam.\"""""
"2093","humein abu bakr bin abi shaiba ne riwayat kiya, hammad bin khalid ne riwayat kiya aur ya'qub bin humaid bin kasib ne humein riwayat kiya, ma'n bin 'isa ne riwayat kiya, sab ne muhammad bin hilal se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne abu huraira se, unhon ne kaha: rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ki qasam ye thi: \nahi"," aur main allah se maghfirat mangta hoon.\"""""
"2094","Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen apney baap ki qism khatey suna to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala tumhen baapon ki qism khaney sey mana farmata hai. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : phir mainey (kabhi) baap dada ki qism nahin khai , na apni taraf sey , na kisi ki baat naqal kartey huye."
"2095","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Samura (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : buton ki qasmen na khaya karo, aur na baap dada ki qasmen khaao."
"2096","humein abdur rahman bin ibrahim al-dimashqi ne riwayat kiya, 'umar bin abdul wahid ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne al-awza'i se, unhon ne al-zuhri se, unhon ne humaid se, unhon ne abu huraira se, ke rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \jo shaks qasam khaye aur apni qasam mein kahe 'laat aur uzza ki qasam'"," to woh kahe 'la ilaha illallah'.\"""""
"2097","Hazrat Saad bin Abi Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey laat aur uzza ki qism khai to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kaho : (لَا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ وَحْدَهُ لَا شَرِيكَ لَهُ), ''akeley Allah key siwa koi mabood nahin, uska koi shareek nahin.'' phir baain taraf teen baar thook do aur (shetan sey) Allah ki panah maango aur dobara ye ghalati na karna."
"2098","Hazrat Sabit bin Zuhaak (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney Islam key ilawa doosrey mazhab (mein chaley janey) ki jaan boojh kar jhooti qism khai to wo wesey hi hai jaisey usney kaha."
"2099","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney suna ke eik aadmi keh raha tha : (agar yun huwa to) yaqinan main us waqt Yahudi hun. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (yahudiyat ya dozakh) wajib ho gaee."
"2100","Hazrat Barida bin Haseeb (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs kahey : (agar falan baat yun hui to) mera Islam sey koi talluq nahin, isliye agar usney jhoot kaha to wo wesey hi ho gaya jaisey usney kaha tha (kafir ho gaya). aur agar sachcha huwa to bhi usey pura Islam nasib nahin hoga."
"2101","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi ko apney baap ki qism khatey suna to farmaya : apney baapon ki qasmen na khaya karo . aur jo shakhs Allah ki qism khaye usey chahiye ke sach boley. aur jis key liye (uskey mutalbey par) Allah ki qism khai jaey, usey chahiye ke (is qism par) razi ho jaey. aur jo Allah sey razi nahin hota, uska Allah sey koi talluq nahin."
"2102","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Hazrat Esa ibn Maryam (Alaihissalam) ney eik shakhs ko chori kartey dekha to farmaya : kya tu ney chori ki hai? usney kaha : qism hai us zaat ki jis key siwa koi mabood nahin ! (mainey chori) nahin (ki). Hazrat Esa (Alaihissalam) ney farmaya : main Allah par eman lata hun, aur apni aankh ko jhooti kehta hun."
"2103","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qism todnai padti hai ya is par sharminda hona padta hai."
"2104","humein al-'abbas bin abdul 'azim al-'anbari ne riwayat kiya, abdur razzaq ne riwayat kiya, ma'mar ne humein bataya, unhon ne ibn taus se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne abu huraira se, unhon ne kaha ke rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \jo shaks qasam khaye aur kahe 'in sha allah'"," to us ke liye us ki istisna hai.\"""""
"2105","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney qism khai aur Inshallah kaha to chahey wo (apney iradey sey) ruju kar ley, chahey (irada qaaim) rehney dey (aur wo kaam kar ley jiski qism khai hai) wo qism todney wala (shumar) nahin hoga."
"2106","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) bayan kartey hain, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney qism khai aur Inshallah kaha, uski qism nahin tooteygi."
"2107","Hazrat Abu-Musa Ash'ari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main qabila banu Ash'ar key chand afrad key sath sawariyan talab karney key liye Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah ki qism ! main tumhen sawariyan mohaiyya nahin karunga. aur merey paas sawari key janwer nahin hain. Hazrat Abu-Musa ney kaha : hum log, jab tak Allah ney chaha, (Madina mein) thehrey, phir aap key paas kuchh oont aagaey. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen safed kohaanon wali (moti tazi) teen oontniyaan dilwa den.  jab hum rawana huye to hamney eik doosrey sey kaha : hum log Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein sawariyan talab karney key liye hazir huye they to aap ney qism kha li thi ke hamein sawariyan mohaiyya nahin karaengey, phir hamein sawariyan mohaiyya farma den. chalo wapis chalen (aur daryaft karen ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen bhool kar sawariyan mohaiyya na farma di hon). chunanche hum khidmat mein hazir huye aur kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! hum aap ki khidmat mein sawariyan talab karney aaye they to aap ney qism kha li thi ke aap hamen sawariyan mohaiyya nahin farmaeyngey, phir aap ney hamein sawariyan mohaiyya farma den. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah ki qism ! mainey tumhen sawariyan nahin den balke Allah ney tumhen sawariyan di hain. qism hai Allah ki ! main to inshallah jo bhi qism khaaunga, phir mujhey dusri surat (qasam puri karney sey) behtar malum hogi to main apni qism ka kaffara dey dunga aur behtar kaam kar lunga. ya farmaya : main behtar kaam kar lunga aur apni qism ka kaffara dey dunga."
"2108","humein 'ali bin muhammad aur abdullah bin 'amir bin zurara ne kaha: abu bakr bin 'ayyash ne hum se riwayat kiya, unhon ne abdul 'aziz bin rufai' se, unhon ne tamim bin tarfa se, unhon ne 'adi bin hatim se, unhon ne kaha ke rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \jo shaks qasam khaye phir us se behtar dekhe to woh behtar kaam kare aur apni qasam ka kaffara de.\"""""
"2109","Hazrat Auf bin Malik Jushmi (Rahimahullah) ney apney walid (Hazrat Malik bin Nazlaa Jushmi (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat ki, unhoney farmaya : mainey kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey paas mera chacha zaad bhai aata hai (kisi baat par naraz ho kar) main qism kha leta hun ke usey kuchh nahin dunga, na us sey sila rehmi karunga. aap ney farmaya : apni qism ka kaffara ada kar do."
"2110","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney qata' rehmi ki qism khai, ya kisi najaaiz kaam ki qism khai to is qism ka pura karna yehi hai ke usey chhod dey."
"2111","humein abdullah bin abdul mu'min al-wasiti ne riwayat kiya, 'awn bin 'umara ne riwayat kiya, ruh bin al-qasim ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne 'ubaidullah bin 'umar se, unhon ne 'amr bin shu'aib se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne apne dada se, ke nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \jo shaks qasam khaye phir us se behtar dekhe to woh qasam chhod de"," kyunke us ka chhodna hi us ka kaffara hai.\"""""
"2112","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney kaffaarey key tor par eik saa (khushk) khajuren den aur logon ko bhi yehi hukm diya. jis key paas (khajuren) na hon, wo nisf (aadha) saa gehun dey dey."
"2113","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : koi aadmi apney ghar walon ko wusat key sath khana deta tha aur koi tangi key sath deta tha. tab ye aayat nazil hui : (أَوْسَطِ ما تُطْعِمُونَ"
"2114","humein sufyan bin waki' ne riwayat kiya, muhammad bin humaid al-ma'mari ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne ma'mar se, unhon ne hammam se, unhon ne kaha: maine abu huraira ko karte suna ke abul qasim (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \jab tum mein se koi qasam par israr kare to woh allah ke nazdeek us kaffara se zyada gunahgar hai jiska use hukm diya gaya.\"" aur doosri sanad: humein muhammad bin yahya ne riwayat kiya"," yahya bin salih al-wuhazi ne riwayat kiya"," muawiya bin salam ne riwayat kiya"," unhon ne yahya bin abi kathir se"," unhon ne 'ikrama se"," unhon ne abu huraira se"," nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) se isi ke misal."""
"2115","humein 'ali bin muhammad ne riwayat kiya, waki' ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne 'ali bin salih se, unhon ne ash'ath bin abi al-sha'tha se, unhon ne muawiya bin suwaid bin muqarrin se, unhon ne al-bara' bin 'azib se, unhon ne kaha: rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne hume qasam khane wale ki qasam pori karne ka hukm diya."
"2116","Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Safwan ya Hazrat Safwan bin Abdur-Rehman Qarshi (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jis din Makka Fateh huwa , wo apney walid ko ley kar khidmat mein hazir huye aur arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! hijrat mein merey walid ko bhi shareek kar lijiye (unhen muhajrin mein shumar kar lijiye). aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (ab) koi hijrat nahin. wo Hazrat Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) key paas chaley gaey, aur kaha : aap ney mujhey pahchaanaa? Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : haan (tab unhoney apna waqia bayan kiya) to Hazrat Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sirf qamis pehney huye (un key sath) chal diye, chadar bhi na odhi. aur kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! aap falan sahab sey waqif hain aur un sey hamarey jo talluqaat hain (wo bhi aap ko malum hain) wo apney walid ko ley kar hazir huye hain ke aap un sey hijrat ki baiat lein to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (ab) koi hijrat nahin. Hazrat Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : main aap ko qism deta hun. (is par) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney haath badha kar un sahab ka haath chhu liya aur farmaya : mainey apney chacha ki qism puri ki hai aur hijrat koi nahin. ye riwayat Yazeed bin Abi Ziyad ki sanad sey bhi isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"2117","humein hisham bin 'ammar ne riwayat kiya, 'isa bin yunus ne riwayat kiya, al-ajlah al-kindi ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne yazid bin al-asamm se, unhon ne ibn 'abbas se, unhon ne kaha ke rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \jab tum mein se koi qasam khaye to ye na kahe 'jo allah chahe aur jo tum chahe","' balke kahe 'jo allah chahe"," phir jo tum chahe'.\"""""
"2118","Hazrat Huzefa bin Yamaan (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik musalman ney khuwab mein dekha ke ehale kitab key eik aadmi (kisi Yahudi ya esai) sey uski mulaqat hui. usney kaha : tum (musalman) achchhey log ho, agar shirk na karo. tum kehtey ho : jo Allah aur Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) chahen. us aadmi ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ye khuwab sunaya to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qism hai Allah ki ! main bhi tumhari ye baat mehsus kar raha tha. tum yun kaha karo : jo Allah chahey, phir jo Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam)  chahen.mazkoora baala riwayat eik dusri sanad sey Hazrat Tufail bin Sakhbara sey bhi isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"2119","Hazrat Suwed bin Hanzala (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum log Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey mulaqat key liye rawana huye. hamarey sath Hazrat Wayl bin Hajar (Raziallahu anhu) bhi they. Hazrat Wayl (Raziallahu anhu) ko unkey eik dushman ney pakad liya to logon ney qism khaney mein harj mehsus kiya. mainey qism kha li ke wo merey bhai hain (ye zahir kiya ke ye Wayl bin Hajar nahin). usney unhen chhod diya, phir hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye to mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey (waqiaa) arz kiya ke doosrey afrad ney qism khaney mein harj mehsus kiya aur mainey qism kha li ke wo merey bhai hain. to aap ney farmaya : tum ney sach kaha. musalman musalman ka bhai hota hai."
"2120","humein abu bakr bin abi shaiba ne riwayat kiya, yazid bin harun ne riwayat kiya, hushaim ne humein bataya, unhon ne 'abbad bin abi salih se, unhon ne apne walid se, unhon ne abu huraira se, unhon ne kaha ke rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \qasam to qasam dilane wali ki niyat par hai.\"""""
"2121","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teri qism usi mafhoom par waqey hogi jis par tera sathi (qasam dilaney wala) tujhey sachcha samjhey."
"2122","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney nazar manney sey mana kiya aur farmaya : iskey zariey sey kanjus (key haath) sey (maal) nikalwaayaa jata hai."
"2123","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : nazar Adam key betey ko iskey siwa kuchh nahin dila sakti jo uskey liye muqaddar kar diya gaya hai. taqdir nazar par ghalib aa jati hai, jo uski qismat mein hai wo ho jaeyga. lekin nazar key zariey sey bakheel (kanjoos) sey (kuchh na kuchh) niklwa liya jata hai. is tarah is par wo kaam (gharib ki madad karna) aasan ho jata hai jo pehley aasan nahin tha, halanke Allah Taala ney farmaya hai : to kharch kar, main tujh par kharch karunga (tujhey duniya mein bhi dun ga)."
"2124","humein sahl bin abi sahl ne riwayat kiya, sufyan bin 'uyaina ne riwayat kiya, ayyub ne riwayat kiya, unhon ne abu qilaba se, unhon ne apne chacha se, unhon ne 'imran bin al-husain se, unhon ne kaha ke rasool allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \gunah mein nazar nahi hai aur na hi us cheez mein nazar hai jo insan ki malikiyat mein nahi.\"""""
"2125","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : gunah key kaam ki koi nazar nahin aur uska kaffara qism ka kaffara hai."
"2126","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs Allah ki itaat ki nazar maaney, usey chahiye ke Allah ki itaat kerey. aur jo shakhs Allah ki nafarmani ki nazar maaney, usey chahiye ke Allah ki nafarmani na kerey."
"2127","Hazrat Aqba bin Aamir Juhni (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney nazar maana aur uska naam na liya, uska kaffara qism ka kaffara hai."
"2128","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney nazar maana aur uska naam na liya (ta'yyun na kiya), uska kaffara qism ka kaffara hai. aur jisney nazar maana jisey wo pura karney ki taqat nahin rakhta, uska kaffara bhi qism ka kaffara hai. aur jisney aisi nazar maana jisey pura karney ki wo taqat rakhta hai, usey chahiye ke nazar puri kerey."
"2129","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey jahiliyat main eik nazar maani. Islam qubul karney key baad mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey daryaft kiya to aap ney mujhey nazar puri karney ka hukm diya."
"2130","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey bawaana key maqam par oont zibeh karney ki nazar maana hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : terey dil mein jahiliyat wali koi baat to nahin? usney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : apni nazar puri kar ley."
"2131","Hazrat Memuna binte Kardam Yasariyya‬ (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke unkey walid (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey miley jabke wo (oont par apney walid key) peechhey sawar thin. unhoney kaha : mainey bawaana key maqam par oont zibeh karney ki nazar maana hai to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya wahan koi but hai? unhoney arz kiya : nahin. aap ney farmaya : apni nazar puri kar ley. ye riwayat eik dusri sanad sey bhi Hazrat Memuna binte Kardam (Raziallahu anha) sey isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"2132","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Saad bin Ubada (Raziallahu anhu) ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey masla puchha ke un ki walida key zimmey nazar thi, wo nazar puri kiye baghair faut ho gaeen to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uski taraf sey tum puri karo."
"2133","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik khatoon Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur kaha : Allah key Rasool ! meri walida faut ho gaee hain aur unkey zimmey nazar key rozey they. wo nazar puri karney sey pehley hi faut ho gaeen. to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : uski taraf sey wali rozey rakhey."
"2134","Hazrat Aqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke un ki behan ney nangey paon aur nangey sar pedal safar (kar key Haj) karney ki nazar maan li. unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ye baat batai to aap ney farmaya : usey hukm do ke sawari par bethey, (sar par) dupatta ley aur teen rozey rakh ley."
"2135","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik boodhey ko apney do beton key darmiyan (un ka sahara ley kar) chaltey dekha to farmaya : iska kya maamla hai? uskey beton ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! isney nazar maan rakhi hai. aap ney farmaya : badey miyan ! sawar ho jao ! Allah Taala tum sey aur tumhari nazar sey mustaghni (beniyaaz) hai."
"2136","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Makka Mukarrama mein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka guzar eik shakhs key paas sey huwa jo dhoop mein khada tha to aap ney farmaya : ye kya maamla hai? logon ney arz kiya : usney nazar maana hai ke roza rakhega, raat tak saye mein nahin aayega, kalam nahin kerega aur khada rahega. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey chahiye ke kalam kerey. saye mein aaye, bethey aur apna roza pura kerey. Imam Ibne-Maja ney mazkura riwayat Husain bin Muhammad bin Shana Waasti key wastey sey bhi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey guzishta hadees ki tarah bayan ki."
"2137","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Aaisha Siddiqa (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : insan ka behtareen khana wo hai jo uski kamai sey (hasil) ho. aur uski aulad bhi uski kamai hai."
"2138","Hazrat Miqdam bin Madi Karb Zubaidi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi aadmi apney haath ki kamai sey ziyada pakizah (aur umda) rozi hasil nahin kar sakta. aur aadmi apni zaat par, apney biwi bachchon par aur apney khaadimon par jo kuchh bhi kharch karta hai, wo sadqa hota hai."
"2139","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : diyanat daar, sachcha musalman taajir qiyamat key din shaheedon key sath hoga."
"2140","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : bewa aur miskeen (ki zarooriyaat puri kerney) key liye daud dhoop karney wala , Allah ki raah mein jihad karney waley ki tarah hai, aur us shakhs ki tarah hai jo raat ko qiyam karta aur din ko roza rakhta hai."
"2141","Hazrat Muaz bin Abdullah (Rahimahullah) apney walid (Hazrat Abdullah bin Khubaib (Raziallahu anhu)) sey aur wo apney chacha (Hazrat Ubaid (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : hum log eik majlis mein mojud they ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tashrif ley aaye. aap key sar Mubarak par pani ka asar tha (ghusl farma kar tashrif laye they). baaz logon ney arz kiya : aaj hum aap ko khush dekh rahey hain. aap ney farmaya : haan, Allah ka shukar hai. phir logon ney khushhali (aur dolat mandi) ka zikr chhed diya to aap ney farmaya : muttaqi aadmi key liye dolat-mand honey mein harj nahin. aur muttaqi key liye sehat dolat sey behtar hai. aur tabiat ka khush hona bhi (Allah) ki nemat hai."
"2142","Hisham bin Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, Ismail bin Ayyash ne hum se bayan kiya, Umara bin Ghaziyya se, Rabia bin Abi Abdur Rahman se, Abdul Malik bin Saeed Ansari se, Abu Humaid Saadi se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Duniya ke talab mein narmi ikhtiyar karo"," kyunki har shakhs us cheez ke liye aasan kiya gaya hai jis ke liye woh paida kiya gaya hai.\"""""
"2143","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sab sey ziyada pareshani us momin ko hoti hai jo apni duniya key maamlat ki bhi fikr karta hai aur apni aakhirat key maamlat ki bhi. Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) bayan kartey hain ke ye hadees gharib hai. isey sirf Ismail (bin Behram) ney riwayat kiya hai."
"2144","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey logo ! Allah sey daro aur achchhey tareeqey sey (aetidaal (darmiyaani raaste) key sath) rozi talab karo kyonkey koi insan apna rizq pura kiye baghair nahin mareyga agar-che us (rizq key husool) mein der ho jaey. chunanche Allah sey daro aur achchhey tareeqey sey rozi talab karo. jo halal hai, wo ley lo aur jo haram hai, wo chhod do."
"2145","Hazrat Qais bin Abu Ghazraa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum log Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamanaey Mubarak mein dalaal kahlaatey they. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hamarey paas sey guzrey to aap ney hamara us sey behtar naam rakh diya . aap ney farmaya : aey taajiron ki jamaat ! kharid aur farokht mein qasmen khai jati hain aur fuzul baaten ho jati hain, (isliye) iskey sath sath sadqa bhi kartey raha karo."
"2146","Hazrat Ismail bin Ubaid apney walid (Hazrat Ubaid bin Rifaa) (Raziallahu anhuma) sey aur wo unkey dada (apney walid) Hazrat Rifaa bin Raafey bin Malik (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat karte hain, unhoney farmaya : hum log Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath bahar gaey. log subah key waqt kharid aur farokht mein mashghool they. aap ney unhen aawaz di : aey taajiron ki jamaat ! . jab un logon ney apni nazren uthaeyn aur gardanen lambi kin (aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki taraf mutawajjeh ho gaey) to aap ney farmaya : taajir log qiyamat key din faajir (badkaar) (aur gunahgaar) bin kar uthengey , siwaye uskey jo Allah sey darta raha aur usney neki ki aur sach bola (yani jhoot aur dhokey sey perhez kiya)."
"2147","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisey kisi janib sey (kisi peshey, ilaqey, mlazimat waghera sey) kuchh (rizq) miley to usey chahiye ke us (peshey waghera) ko ikhtiyar kiye rakhey."
"2148","Hazrat Nafey (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Sham aur Misr ki taraf samane tijarat bheja karta tha, (eik baar) mainey Iraaq ki taraf saman bhej diya, phir main Ummul-mominin Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur kaha : Ummul-mominin ! main Sham ki taraf saman bheja karta tha. ab mainey Iraaq ki taraf saman bheja hai. unhoney farmaya : aisa na karo, tumharey (sabiqa (pichhle)) maqame tijarat ko kya ho gaya? mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye irshade Mubarak suna hai : jab Allah Taala tum mein sey kisi key liye eik taraf sey rizq ka sabab paida karey to wo usey us waqt tak tarak na karey jab tak is mein badlaaw ya kharabi paida na ho jaey."
"2149","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala ney koi Nabi aisa nahin bheja jo bakriyan charaney wala na ho. Sahaba kiram ney kaha : Allah key Rasool ! aap bhi (galla-baani kartey rahey hain)?  aap ney farmaya : main bhi (bakriyan charaataa raha hun). meain qeeraaton key badley main Makka walon ki bakriyan charaayaa karta tha. (Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key ustaad) Hazrat Suwed bin Saeed (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : yani har bakri (ki dekh bhaal) ki ujrat eik qeeraat hoti thi."
"2150","Muhammad bin Yahya ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Abdullah Khuzai, Hajjaj aur Haitham bin Jameel ne kaha: hum se Hammad ne bayan kiya, Sabit se, Abu Rafi se, Abu Huraira se, ki Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Zakariyya badhghar the.\"""""
"2151","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : bilashuba taswiren bananey walon ko qiyamat key din azab hoga. unhen kaha jaeyga jo kuch tum ney (apney khayal key mutabiq) paida kiya tha, usey zinda bhi karo."
"2152","Amr bin Rafi ne hum se bayan kiya, Umar bin Haroon ne hum se bayan kiya, Hammam se, Farqad Sabakhi se, Yazid bin Abdullah bin Shikhkheer se, Abu Huraira se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Sab se jhuthe log rangrej aur sonar hain.\"""""
"2153","Nasr bin Ali al-Jahdami ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Ahmad ne hum se bayan kiya, Israel ne hum se bayan kiya, Ali bin Salim bin Thawban se, Ali bin Zaid bin Judaan se, Saeed bin al-Musayyib se, Umar bin al-Khattab se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Jalib (maal laane wala) marzooq hai aur ihtikar karne wala maloon hai.\"""""
"2154","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne hum se bayan kiya, Yazid bin Haroon ne hum se bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ishaq se, Muhammad bin Ibrahim se, Saeed bin al-Musayyib se, Mamar bin Abdullah bin Nadla se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Ihtikar sirf gunehgar karta hai.\"""""
"2155","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ye farmatey suna : jo musalmanon sey khaney peeney ki chizon ki zakhira andozi kerega, Allah Taala usey juzaam aur iflaas (kodh aur kangaali) mein mubtala kerega."
"2156","Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hum tees sawaron ko eik fauji muhim par bheja. (raastey mein) hum kuchh logon key yahan (un ki basti mein) thehrey. hamney un sey khana manga. unhoney (hamari mehmani karney sey) inkar kar diya. (phir aisa huwa ke) unkey sardar ko bichchhu ney kaat liya , chunanche wo log hamarey paas aaye aur kaha : kya tum mein sey koi shakhs bichchhu kaatey ka dam kar sakta hai? mainey kaha : haan, main (kar sakta hun) lekin jab tak tum hamein bakriyan nahin dogey main usey dam nahin karunga. unhoney farmaya : hum tumhen tees bakriyan dengey (tum dam kar do). hamney un ki ye pesh kaash! qubul kar li. mainey saat baar Sura Fatiha padh kar us (mareez) par dam kiya to wo sehat yaab ho gaya aur hamney bakriyan wasul kar lin, phir hamarey dil mein shak paida huwa. (maloom nahin, ye bakriyan lena jayez tha ya nahin) hamney kaha : jaldi na karo yahan tak key hum Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho jaeyn. jab hum log khidmat mein hazir huye to mainey aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko bataya ke mainey ye kaam kiya hai. aap ney farmaya : kya tujhey malum na tha ke ye (surat) dam hai? bakriyan taqseem kar lo aur mera bhi hissa rakho. dusri do sanadon sey bhi ye riwayat Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai. Imam abu-Adbullah (Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah)) ney (oopper mazkur do sanadon mein Abu-Saeed Khudri sey bayan karney waley key barey mein raaey detey huye ( kaha : sahih ye hai ke wo ( ibn mutawakkil nahin balke ( abu-Mutwakkil hai."
"2157","Hazrat Ubada bin Samit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey as-haabe suffa (Raziallahu anhum) mein sey chand afrad ko Quran ki aur likhney ki taalim di. un mein sey eik aadmi ney tohfey key tor par mujhey eik kamaan dey di. mainey ye soch kar ley li ke ye koi maal to hai nahin, aur main Allah ki raah mein (jihad kartey huye) is sey teer chalaaunga. mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey uskey barey mein daryaft kiya to aap ney farmaya : agar tujhey ye baat pasand hai ke iskey badley tujhey (jahannam ki) aag ka toq pehnaya jaey to qubul kar ley."
"2158","Hazrat Ubai-bin Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey eik aadmi ko Quran padhaya. usney mujhey tohfey key tor par eik kamaan di. mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko ye baat batai to aap ney farmaya : agar tu ney ye ley li to aag ki kamaan li. chunanche mainey wo wapis kar di."
"2159","Hisham bin Ammar aur Muhammad bin al-Sabbah ne kaha: hum se Sufyan bin Uyayna ne bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman se, Abu Masood se, ki Nabi ne mana kiya: kutte ki qeemat, besharm aurat ki mehar aur kaahin ki inaam se."
"2160","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney kuttey ki qeemat aur nasal kushi key janwer (saand) chhodney ki ujrat leney sey mana farmaya hai."
"2161","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney billi ki qeemat leney sey mana farmaya hai."
"2162","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney seengi lagwaai aur usey (seengi lagwaaney waley ko) uski ujrat ata farmaai. Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney kaha : is riwayat ko sirf ibne-Abi umr hi ney bayan kiya hai."
"2163","Amr bin Ali Abu Hafs al-Sayrafi aur Muhammad bin Abada al-Wasiti ne kaha: hum se Abu Dawood aur Yazid bin Haroon ne bayan kiya, Warqa se, Abd al-Ala se, Abu Jameela se, Ali se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah ne pichni karwayi aur mujhe hukum diya to maine pichni karne wale ko uski mazdoori de di."
"2164","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney seengi lagwaai aur seengi laganey waley ko uski ujrat ata farmaai."
"2165","Hisham bin Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Hamza ne hum se bayan kiya, Awzai ne mujh se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Abu Bakr bin Abdur Rahman bin Harith bin Hisham se, Abu Masood Uqba bin Amr se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah ne mana kiya pichni karne wale ki kamayi se."
"2166","Hazrat Haram bin Mahisa (Rahimahullah) apney walid (Hazrat Saad bin Mahisa bin Masood Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat kartey huye farmatey hain ke unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey seengi laganey waley ki kamai key mutalliq daryaft kiya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen is sey mana farmaya. unhoney apney hajat mand (aur muflis) honey ka zikr kiya to aap ney farmaya : uska apney oonton ko chaara khila do."
"2167","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Fateh Makka key saal Makka mein farmaya : Allah Taala ney aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney sharab , murdar , khinzir aur buton ki farokht haram kar di hai. us waqt aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey arz kiya gaya : aey Allah key Rasool ! murda (janweron) ki charbi key barey mein farmaiye, us sey kashtiyon ko chikna kiya jata hai, chamdon ko lagaya jata hai (aur is tarah unhen qabile istimal banaya jata hai). aur log  (isey chiraghon mein jala kar) is sey roshni hasil kartey hain. aap ney farmaya : nahin, ye sab cheezen haram hain.  phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala yahudiyon ko tabah karey ! Allah ney un par charbi haram ki to unhoney usey pighla kar bech dala, aur uski qeemat kha gaey."
"2168","Ahmad bin Muhammad bin Yahya bin Saeed al-Qattan ne hum se bayan kiya, Hashim bin al-Qasim ne hum se bayan kiya, Abu Jafar al-Razi ne hum se bayan kiya, Asim se, Abu al-Muhallab se, Abdullah al-Ifriqi se, Abu Umama se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah ne mana kiya: gawai laundiyon ki bikri se, unhen khareedne se, unki kamayi se aur unki qeemat khane se."
"2169","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Numayr aur Abu Usama ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah bin Umar se, Khubayb bin Abdur Rahman se, Hafs bin Asim se, Abu Huraira se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah ne mana kiya do qisam ki bikri se: mulamisa (cheez haath lagane se) aur munabaza (cheez phenkne se)."
"2170","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mulaamisa aur munaabiza sey mana farmaya hai. (hadees ke raavi) Sehal ney apni riwayat mein ye izafa kiya hai ke Hazrat Sufiyan (bin Uena) (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : mulaamisa ka matlab ye hai ke aadmi chiz ko (haath sey) chhuey aur usey (aakhon sey) na dekhey. aur munaabiza ka matlab ye hai ke yun kahey : tum apni chiz meri taraf phenk do aur main apni chiz tumhari taraf phenk deta hun."
"2171","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi kisi ki bai (saude) par bai (sauda) na karey."
"2172","Hisham bin Ammar ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Saeed bin al-Musayyib se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi ne farmaya: \Koi shakhs apne bhai ki bikri par na bache aur na uski boli par boli lagaaye.\"""""
"2173","Maine Musab bin Abdullah Zubairi ke saamne padha, unhoone Malik se riwayat kiya; aur Abu Hudhafa ne hum se bayan kiya, Malik bin Anas ne hum se bayan kiya, Nafe se, Ibn Umar se, ki Nabi ne najash (zaid qeemat lagwana) se mana kiya."
"2174","Hisham bin Ammar aur Sahl bin Abi Sahl ne kaha: hum se Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Saeed se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi ne farmaya: \Najash na karo.\"""""
"2175","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne hum se bayan kiya, Sufyan bin Uyayna ne hum se bayan kiya, Zuhri se, Saeed bin al-Musayyib se, Abu Huraira se, ki Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Shahri dihati ki koi cheez na beche.\"""""
"2176","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : shehri bahar waley ki taraf sey farokht na karey, logon ko chhod do ke Allah unhen eik doosrey key zariey sey rizq ata farmaaey."
"2177","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney is baat sey mana farmaya hai ke shehar wala dehat waley ki taraf sey farokht kerey. Hazrat Taaus (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey puchha : is irshad ka kya matlab hai ke shehar wala dehat waley ki taraf sey farokht na kerey? unhoney farmaya : yani uska dalaal na baney."
"2178","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : saman laney waley taajiron ko (aagey ja kar) na milo. jo shakhs kisi (tajir) sey ja kar mila aur us sey (saman) kharid liya to Malik (bechney wala) jab bazar mein pahunchega to usey ikhtiyar hoga (ke soda qaaim rakhey ya mansookh kar dey)."
"2179","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney saman laney walon ko aagey ja kar milney sey mana farmaya hai."
"2180","Yahya bin Hakim ne hum se bayan kiya, Yahya bin Saeed aur Hammad bin Masada ne hum se bayan kiya, Sulaiman Taymi se; aur Ishaq bin Ibrahim bin Habib bin al-Shahid ne hum se bayan kiya, Mutamir bin Sulaiman ne hum se bayan kiya, maine apne walid (Sulaiman) se suna, unhoone bayan kiya: Abu Uthman al-Nahdi se, Abdullah bin Masood se, unhoone kaha: Rasool Allah ne mana kiya bikron ki aagosh (astaqbal) se."
"2181","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab do aadmi bai (sauda) keren to un mein sey har eik ko (us waqt tak) ikhtiyar hai jab tak wo eik doosrey sey juda na hon, aur ikatthey hon, ya unmein sey eik shakhs doosrey ko ikhtiyar na dey dey. agar eik ney doosrey ko ikhtiyar dey diya aur unhoney is shart par bai (sauda) ki to bai (sauda) wajib ho gaee. aur agar bai (sauda) key baad wo eik doosrey sey juda ho gaey, aur dono mein sey kisi ney bai (sauda) tarak na ki, tab bhi bai (sauda) wajib ho gaee."
"2182","Ahmad bin Abda aur Ahmad bin al-Miqdam ne kaha: hum se Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, Jameel bin Murra se, Abu al-Wazi se, Abu Barza al-Aslami se, unhoone kaha: Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Kharidne aur bechne wale ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh alag na ho jayen.\"""""
"2183","Muhammad bin Yahya aur Ishaq bin Mansoor ne kaha: hum se Abd al-Samad ne bayan kiya, Shuba ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Hasan se, Samura se, unhoone kaha: Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Kharidne aur bechne wale ko ikhtiyar hai jab tak woh alag na ho jayen.\"""""
"2184","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) sey darakhton key patton ki eik gathdi khareedi. jab bai (sauda) ho chuki to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tujhey ikhtiyar hai (bai (sauda) ko qaaim rakhey ya fasakh (radd) kar dey). Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) ney kaha : Allah aap jaisey soda karney waley ko lambi umr dey."
"2185","Abbas bin al-Waleed al-Dimashqi ne hum se bayan kiya, Marwan bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Dawood bin Salih Madani se, unke walid se, maine Abu Saeed Khudri se suna, woh kehte the: Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Bikri to sirf aapas ki raza se hoti hai.\"""""
"2186","Hazrat Qasim bin Abdur-Rehman (Rahimahullah) apney walid (Hazrat Abdur-Rehman bin Abdullah bin Masood) sey riwayat kartey huye farmatey hain ke Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ney sarkaari ghulamon mein sey eik ghulam Hazrat Ash'as bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) key haath farokht kiya. baad mein unka aapas mein ikhtilaf ho gaya. Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : mainey aap ko (wo ghulam) bees hazar ka farokht kiya tha. Hazrat Ash'as bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : mainey aap sey das hazar ka kharid tha. Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : agar aap chahen to main aap ko eik hadees sunaun jo mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suni thi. unhoney kaha : suna dijiye. Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna aap farma rahey they : jab bechney waley aur kharidney waley mein ikhtilaf ho jaey aur un mein sey kisi key paas gawah na ho, aur sauda hui chiz bilkul wesey hi mojud ho to bechney waley ka qol taslim kiya jaeyga (aur bai (sauda) qaaim rahegi) ya wo dono bai (saude) ko fasakh kar dengey. Ash'as (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : mera khayal hai ke main ye soda fasakh (radd) kar dun, chunanche Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ney bai (sauda) fasakh (radd) kar key ghulam wapis ley liya."
"2187","Hazrat Hakim bin Hizaam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! eik shakhs mujh sey koi chiz khareednaa chahta hai jabkey wo chiz merey paas mojud nahin, kya main usey wo chiz bech dun? aap ney farmaya : jo chiz terey paas nahin, wo farokht na kar."
"2188","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib (Rahimahullah) apney walid Shuaib bin Muhammad (Rahimahullah) sey , aur wo apney dada Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo chiz terey paas nahin, usey bechnaa jayez nahin, aur jiski zimme-daari qubul nahin ki gaee, is par nafa lena bhi jayez nahin."
"2189","Hazrat itaab bin Usaid (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen Makka (governer bana kar) bheja to unhen us chiz ka nafa leney sey mana farmaya jiski zimmey daari qubul na ki gaee ho."
"2190","Hazrat Aqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) ya Hazrat Samura bin Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs do aadmiyon sey bai (sauda) kerey to wo un dono mein sey pehley aadmi ki hogi."
"2191","Husain bin Abi al-Sirri al-Asqalani aur Muhammad bin Ismail ne kaha: hum se Wake ne bayan kiya, Saeed bin Bashir ne hum se bayan kiya, Qatada se, Hasan se, Samura se, unhoone kaha: Rasool Allah ne farmaya: \Jab do mojiz (bechne wale) hon to pahle ka ehtiyat hai.\"""""
"2192","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney bai (sauda) arbaan (bayaane key sath lain den kerney) sey mana farmaya hai."
"2193","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney bai (sauda) arbaan sey mana farmaya hai. abu-Adbullah (Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah)) ney farmaya : bai (sauda) arbaan usey kehtey hain ke eik aadmi koi janwer so Dinar ka khareedey aur usey (bechney waley ko) do Dinar bayaana dey dey aur kahey : agar mainey ye janwer na kharid to ye do Dinar terey hongey. eik qol key mutabiq iska matlab. Allah ki qism aalam, ye hai ke aadmi koi bhi chiz khareedey aur bechney waley ko eik dirham ya us se kam aur ziyada (peshgi) ada kar dey aur kahey : agar mainey ye soda ley liya (aur bai (sauda) fasakh (radd) na ki) to theek hai warna ye dirham tera hoga."
"2194","Muhriz bin Salama al-Adani ne hum se bayan kiya, Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad ne hum se bayan kiya, Ubaydullah se, Abu al-Zinad se, Araj se, Abu Huraira se, unhoone kaha: Rasool Allah ne mana kiya jokh (gharar) ki bikri se aur kankari (hasah) ki bikri se."
"2195","Haddasana Abu Kuraib aur Al-Abbas bin Abdil Azeem Al-Anbari, unhonne kaha: Haddasana Al-Aswad bin Aamir, Haddasana Ayyub bin Utba, Yahya bin Abi Katheer se, unhonne Ata se, unhonne Ibn Abbas se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne bay' al-gharar se mana farmaya."
"2196","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney janweron key pet key bachchey kharidney sey mana farmaya jab tak wo paida na ho jaeyn, aur unkey thanon mein mojud (doodh) ko kharidney sey mana farmaya magar maap kar, aur ghulam ko kharidney sey mana farmaya jabke wo bhagoda ho, aur ghanimat ki ashiya (cheezen) kharidney sey mana farmaya yahan tak key wo taqseem ho jaeyn, aur sadqaat ki ashiya (cheezen) kharidney sey mana farmaya yahan tak key wo (mustahiqeen key) qabzey mein aa jaeyn, aur ghota maarney waley key ghotey (sey hasil honey wali chiz ki peshgi kharidari) sey mana farmaya."
"2197","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hamila ka hamal bechney sey mana farmaya."
"2198","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik Ansari aadmi ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar (maali taawun (madad) ka) sawal kiya. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tumharey ghar mein tumhari koi chiz mojud hai? usney kaha : ji haan ! eik kambal hai. hum aadha nichey bichhate hain aur aadha odh letey hain aur eik piyala hai jis mein pani peetey hain. aap ney farmaya : dono cheezen merey paas ley aao. wo unhen ley kar hazir huwa to Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen apney haath mein liya aur farmaya : ye dono cheezen kon khareedtaa hai? eik aadmi ney kaha : main inhen eik dirham mein khareedtaa hun. aap ney do teen baar farmaya : eik dirham sey ziyada kon deta hai? eik aadmi ney kaha : main inhen do dirham mein khareedtaa hun. aap ney isey dono cheezen dey kar do dirham ley liye aur us Ansari Sabab ko dey diye, aur farmaya : eik dirham ka khaney peeney ka saman ley kar ghar walon ko dey do aur doosrey dirham ka kulhaada kharid kar merey paas lao. usney aisey hi kiya. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney kulhaada ley kar is mein apney haath sey dasta lagaya aur farmaya : jao (jangal sey) endhan ki lakdiyan laya karo (aur bech kar zarooriyaat puri karo) aur pandarah din tak main tumhen na dekhun. wo endhan la kar bechney laga. (uskey baad) wo hazir huwa to uskey paas das dirham (jama ho chukey) they. aap ney farmaya : kuchh raqam ka khaney ka saman kharid lo aur kuchh raqam ka kapda kharid lo. phir farmaya : ye kaam (mehnat sey rozi kamaana) terey liye us baat sey bahut behtar hai ke to qiyamat key din aaye to maangney ki wajeh sey tera chehra dagh daar ho. maangna sirf uskey liye jayez hai jisey muflisi (ghurbat) khaak-nasheen kar dey, ya jo intehai maqrooz ho, ya jo khoon ki wajeh sey pareshan ho (jis sey qatl sarzad ho gaya ho aur wo diyat ada karney ki taqat na rakhta ho)."
"2199","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs kisi musalman ka suda wapis kar lega to Allah Taala qiyamat key din uskey gunah maaf farma dega."
"2200","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein (eik baar ashiya (cheezon) key) bhaaw chadh gaey. logon ney arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! bhaaw chadh gaey hain, aap (ashiya (cheezon) key) bhaaw muqarrar kar dijiye. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala bhaaw muqarrar karney wala hai, wohi tangi karney wala, faraakhi karney wala aur raaziq hai. mujhey ummid hai ke main jab apney Rab sey miloonga to koi shakhs jaan aur maal key barey mein zulm ki bina par mujh sey koi mutalba karney wala nahin hoga."
"2201","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamana Mubarak mein bhaaw chadh gaey to Sahaba kiram Raziallahu anhum ney arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! kaash! aap qimtein muqarrar farma detey. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : mujhey ummid hai ke main tum sey juda hunga to koi shakhs mujh sey kisi zulm ki talaafi ka talab-gaar nahin hoga, jo zulm mainey is par kiya ho."
"2202","Haddasana Muhammad bin Abaan Al-Balkhi Abu Bakr, Haddasana Ismail bin Ulayya, Yunus bin Ubaid se, unhonne Ata bin Farrūkh se, unhone kaha: Usman bin Affan ne kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Allah Ta'ala ne ek aadami ko Jannat mein dakhil kiya jo bechne aur khareedne mein narmi (aasan) tha.\"""""
"2203","Haddasana Amr bin Usman bin Saeed bin Katheer bin Deenaar Al-Himsi, Haddasana Abi (mere walid), Haddasana Abu Ghassan Muhammad bin Mutarrif, Muhammad bin Al-Munkadir se, unhonne Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Allah us bande par rahmat kare jo narmi (sakhavat) se kaam leta ho"," jab beche to narmi se"," jab khareede to narmi se"," jab taqaza kare to narmi se.\"""""
"2204","Hazrat Qeela Umme bani Anmaar (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key kisi Umerey key doran mein Marwa key qarib khidmat mein hazir hui. mainey arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! main kharid aur farokht karney wali aurat hun. main jab koi chiz khareednaa chahti hun to main jo (qeemat ada karna) chahti hun, us sey kam par baat karti hun, phir badhtey badhtey us qeemat tak pahunch jati hun jo mera (asal) irada hota hai. aur jab main koi chiz bechnaa chahti hun to main jo (qeemat wasul karna) chahti hun, us sey ziyada ki baat karti hun, phir kam kartey kartey us qeemat tak pahunch jati hun jo mera irada hota hai (kya ye jayez hai)?  Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Qeela ! aisey na kiya karo. jab koi chiz khareednaa chaho to wohi qeemat pesh karo jo tumhara irada hai, chahey tumhen wo chiz (us qeemat par) miley ya na miley. aur farmaya : jab tum koi chiz bechnaa chaho to wohi qeemat talab karo jo tumhara irada hai, phir chahey (us qeemat par girahak key raza mand honey par) farokht karo (becho) ya (uskey raza mand na honey par) farokht na karo (becho)."
"2205","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main eik ghazwey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath tha. aap ney mujh sey farmaya : kya tum apna ye oont mujhey eik Dinar key iwaz farokht kartey ho? Allah tumhari maghfirat kerega. mainey kaha : Allah key Rasool ! jab main Madina pahunch jaunga to ye oont aap ka huwa. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tum isey merey haath do Dinar key iwaz farokht kartey ho? Allah tumhari maghfirat kerega. Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke aap eik eik Dinar ka izafa farmatey rahey aur har Dinar key izaafey key sath farmatey : Allah tumhari maghfirat kerega. yahan tak key bees Dinar tak pahunch gaey. jab main Madina Munawra pahunch gaya to mainey oont ko uskey sar sey pakad kar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kar diya. to aap ney farmaya : Bilal ! isey maale ghanimat mein sey bees Dinar dey do. (raqam ki adaegi key baad) aap ney mujh sey farmaya : apna oont ley lo aur isey apney ghar ley jao."
"2206","Haddasana Ali bin Muhammad aur Sahl bin Abi Sahl, unhonne kaha: Haddasana Ubaidullah bin Musa, anba'ana Al-Rabi' bin Habib, Nawfal bin Abdul Malik se, unhonne apne walid se, unhonne Ali se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya suraj nikalne se pehle saudaa karna (ya bhav lagana) aur doodh wali jaanwar ko zibah karna."
"2207","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen aadmi aisey hain jin sey qiyamat key din Allah Taala kalam nahin farmaeyga , na un ki taraf dekhega , na unhen paak kerega, aur unkey liye dardnak azab hai. eik wo aadmi jis key paas sehra mein (chashmey waghera ka) pani, uski zarurat sey zayed hai aur wo musafir ko uskey istimal sey mana karta hai. (doosra) wo aadmi jisney Asr key baad kisi key haath soda bechaa aur Allah ki qism kha kar kaha ke usney itni qeemat mein isey kharid hai. kharidar ney isey sach samajh liya, halanke haqiqat uskey khilaf thi. aur (teesra) wo aadmi jo kisi Imam (Islaami hukmran) ki baiat karta hai aur wo sirf husoole duniya key liye uski baiat karta hai, agar Imam usey duniya (ka maal) dey dey to wafaa karta hai aur agar Imam usey duniya ka maal na dey to wo baiat par qaaim nahin rehta (Imam ki itaat nahin karta)."
"2208","Haddasana Ali bin Muhammad aur Muhammad bin Ismail, unhonne kaha: Haddasana Wakee, Mas'oodi se, unhonne Ali bin Mudrik se, unhonne Kharasha bin Al-Hurr se, unhonne Abu Zar se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se. Aur (doosri sanad se) Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashshar, Haddasana Muhammad bin Ja'far, Haddasana Shu'ba, Ali bin Mudrik se, unhonne Abu Zur'a bin Amr bin Jarir se, unhonne Kharasha bin Al-Hurr se, unhonne Abu Zar se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, aap ne farmaya: \Teen aise hain jin se Allah Qayamat ke din baat nahi karega aur na un ki taraf dekhega aur na unhein paak karega aur un ke liye dardnaak azaab hai.\"" Main ne kaha: \""Ya Rasool Allah"," woh kaun hain? Woh to na-murad aur nuqsaan uthane wale hain.\"" Aap ne farmaya: \""Jo apna ezaar (libaas) latkata ho (takabbur se)"," aur jo apna ehsan jatata ho"," aur jo apni cheez jhoothi qasam kha kar beche.\"""""
"2209","Hazrat Abu-Qatada Haris bin Rabee Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : farokht kartey waqt qism khaney sey ijtinab (parhez) karo, ye sodey mein raghbat (dilchaspi) paida karti hai (jis sey pehley pehal soda ziyada biktaa hai), phir barkat ko khatam kar deti hai."
"2210","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ney phal aaya hua huwa khajoor ka darkht kharid to us (darkht) ka phal bechney waley ka hai agar ye ke kharidar shart kar ley (ke main darkht phal samet kharid raha hun). Imam Ibne-Maja ney Muhammad bin Rumeh key wastey sey bhi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey mazkura baala hadees ki maanind bayan kiya."
"2211","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney khajoor key darkht bechey jabke un ki taabeer ho chuki thi to unka phal bechney waley ka hai, siwaye us surat key ke kharidar shart kar ley. aur jisney koi ghulam kharid jis key paas kuch maal tha to uska maal bechney waley ka hai, siwaye is surat key ke kharidar shart kar ley."
"2212","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs khajoor key darkht bechey aur ghulam bechey. Nafey (Rahimahullah) ney ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) sey dono jumley ikhattey (eik jumley ki surat mein) riwayat kiye."
"2213","Haddasana Abd Rabbihi bin Khalid An-Numairi Abu Al-Mughallis, Haddasana Al-Fudail bin Sulaiman, Musa bin Uqba se, haddasani (mujh se bayan kiya) Ishaq bin Yahya bin Al-Waleed bin Ubada bin As-Samit, Ubada bin As-Samit se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne faisla farmaya ke khajoor ke phal (tamr) usi ke hain jisne unhein paani diya (ya tabdeel kiya) magar ye ke khareedne wala shart kar le. Aur ghulam ka maal usi ka hai jisne use becha, magar ye ke khareedne wala shart kar le."
"2214","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : phal us waqt tak na becho, jab tak unka sahih hona zahir na ho jaey. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney bechney waley aur kharidney waley (dono) ko mana farmaya."
"2215","Haddasana Ahmad bin Isa Al-Misri, Haddasana Abdullah bin Wahb, Yunus bin Yazid se, unhonne Ibn Shihab se, haddasani (mujh se bayan kiya) Saeed bin Al-Musayyab aur Abu Salama bin Abdur Rahman, Abu Huraira se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Phal (darakhton ke) na becho jab tak un ki acchayi (pakka hona) zahir na ho jaaye.\"""""
"2216","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney phal bechney sey mana farmaya yahan tak key un ki durusti zahir ho jaey."
"2217","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney phalon ki farokht sey mana farmaya yahan tak key unka rang badal jaey, aur angooron ki farokht sey mana farmaya yahan tak key wo siyah ho jaeyn, aur ghalley (gehun aur jau waghera) ki farokht sey mana farmaya yahan tak key wo sakht ho jaey."
"2218","Haddasana Hisham bin Ammar aur Muhammad bin As-Sabbah, unhonne kaha: Haddasana Sufyan, Humaid Al-A'raj se, unhonne Sulaiman bin Ateeq se, unhonne Jabir bin Abdullah se, ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne mana farmaya \bay' as-sineen\"" se (jo ek qisam ka mu'amala tha jismein phal ko lagatar kai saalon ke liye pehle se bech diya jaata tha)."""
"2219","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs (baagh ka) phal farokht karey, phir is par aafat aa jaey to us (bechney waley)  ko chahiye ke apney bhai key maal sey kuchh na ley (uski qeemat wasul na karey). wo apney musalman bhai ka maal kis wajeh sey leta hai?"
"2220","Hazrat Suwed bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main aur Hazrat Mukhrifaa Abdi (Raziallahu anhu) Hijr (key shehar) sey kapda laye . hamarey paas Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tashrif laye aur hum sey eik shalwaar ka soda kiya. hamarey paas eik tolney wala tha jo ujrat par tolta tha. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : aey tolney waley ! wazan kar, aur jhuktaa tol."
"2221","Hazrat Abu-Safwaan bin Umaira (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey hijrat sey pehley Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key haath eik paajaama farokht kiya. aap ney (uski qeemat key tor par sona , chaandi ya ghalla) mujhey tol kar ata farmaya aur jhuktaa huwa tola."
"2222","Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya, Haddasana Abdus Samad, Haddasana Shu'ba, Muharib bin Dithar se, unhonne Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jab tum tolna to jhaak (zyada) rakho.\"""""
"2223","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Madina tashrif laye to (Madiney key) logon ka maap intehai bura tha, phir Allah Taala ney ye aayat nazil farmaai : (وَيْلٌ لِّلْمُطَفِّفِينَ),''maap tol mein kami karney walon key liye halakat hai.'' to unhoney achchhey tareeqey sey maapna shuru kar diya."
"2224","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik aadmi key paas sey guzrey jo ghalla farokht kar raha tha. aap ney us (ghalley) mein haath dala to malum huwa ke is mein dhoka hai. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo dhoka dey, wo hum mein sey nahin."
"2225","(Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key azad karda ghulam) Hazrat Abu Humraa (Hilal bin Haris (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik aadmi key paas sey guzrey jis key paas eik bartan mein khaney ki chiz (gehun ya khajoor waghera) thi. aap ney is mein haath dala, phir farmaya : shayad tu ney dhoka kiya hai. jisney hamein dhoka diya, wo hum mein sey nahin."
"2226","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs ghizaae jins (cheeze) khareedey to wo usey puri tarah wasul karney sey pehley na bechey."
"2227","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs ghizaae jins (cheeze) khareedey to wo usey puri tarah wasul karney sey pehley na bechey. abu-Awaana apni riwayat mein bayan kartey hain ke Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ney farmaya : meri raey mein har chiz ka hukm ghizaae ajnaas (saaman) wala hi hai."
"2228","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney khaney ki chiz (ghalla waghera) farokht karney sey mana farmaya, jab tak usey do pemaney na maap lein : bechney waley ka pemana aur kharidney waley ka pemana."
"2229","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum log qaflon sey ghalla maapey toley baghair kharid letey they. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hamein is ko bechney sey mana farmaya yahan tak key uski jagah sey muntaqil kar lein."
"2230","Hazrat Usman bin Affaan (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main bazar mein khajuren bechaa karta tha. main(gaahak ko) kehta : mainey apney is pemaney sey maapaa hai ke ye is qadr (itney wasq) hai. main is maap ki bina par khajuren uskey hawaley karta aur apna munaafaa ley leta, phir mujhey is barey mein shak paida huwa to mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey daryaft kiya to aap ney farmaya : jab to pemaney ka naam ley to usey maap kar dey."
"2231","Hazrat Abdullah bin Basar Mazni (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna aap farma rahey they : apna khana (ghalla waghera) maap liya karo, is main tumharey liye barkat hogi."
"2232","Haddasana Amr bin Usman bin Saeed bin Katheer bin Deenaar Al-Himsi, Haddasana Baqiyya bin Al-Waleed, Baheer bin Sa'd se, unhonne Khalid bin Ma'dan se, unhonne Al-Miqdam bin Ma'dikarib se, unhonne Abu Ayyub se, Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) se, aap ne farmaya: \Apne ghalay ko (paimaane se) maapo"," us mein barakat di jaayegi.\"""""
"2233","Haddasana Ibrahim bin Al-Munzir Al-Hizami, Haddasana Ishaq bin Ibrahim bin Saeed, haddasani (mujh se bayan kiya) Safwan bin Sulaim, haddasani Muhammad aur Ali, jo Hasan bin Abi Al-Hasan Al-Barrad ke bete hain, ke Zubair bin Al-Munzir bin Abi Usaid As-Sa'idi ne unhein bayan kiya ke un ke walid Al-Munzir ne un se bayan kiya, Abu Usaid se, ke Abu Usaid ne bayan kiya ke Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) \Sooq-un-Nabit\"" (nabatiyon ka bazaar) gaye"," use dekha aur farmaya: \""Yeh tumhara bazaar nahi hai.\"" Phir aap doosre bazaar gaye"," use dekha aur farmaya: \""Yeh tumhara bazaar nahi hai.\"" Phir aap is bazaar mein wapas aaye aur is ka chakkar lagaya"," phir farmaya: \""Yeh tumhara bazaar hai. Is mein na kami ki jaaye aur na is par kiraaya (tax) lagaya jaaye.\"""""
"2234","Hazrat Salman (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna aap farma rahey they : jo shakhs subah key waqt Fajr ki namaz key liye jata hai, wo eman ka jhandaa ley kar jata hai. aur jo shakhs subah subah bazar jata hai, wo iblees ka jhandaa ley kar jata hai."
"2235","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs bazar mein dakhil hotey waqt ye dua padhey : (لا إِلَهَ إِلَّا اللَّهُ وَحْدَهُ لَا شَرِيكَ لَهُ لَهُ الْمُلْكُ وَلَهُ الْحَمْدُ يُحْيِي وَيُمِيتُ وَهُوَ حَيٌّ لَا يَمُوتُ بِيَدِهِ الْخَيْرُ كُلُّهُ وَهُوَ عَلَى كُلِّ شَيْءٍ قَدِيرٌ), ''akeley Allah key siwa koi mabood nahin, uska koi shareek nahin, badshahi usi ki hai aur tareef bhi usi ki hai, wo zinda karta hai aur wohi maut deta hai, aur wo zinda rehney wala hai jisey maut nahin, usi key haath mein tamam ki tamam bhalai hai, aur wo har chiz par qadir hai.'' to Allah Taala uskey liye das lakh nekiyan likhtaa hai, aur das lakh gunah maaf farmata hai. aur uskey liye jannat main eik ghar taamir farmata hai."
"2236","Hazrat Sakhr bin Wdaa'a Ghaamidi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Allah ! meri ummat key liye subah ka waqt ba-barkat bana dey. unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab koi fauji dasta ya lashkar rawana farmatey to subah key waqt rawana farmatey they. Hazrat Umaara bin Hadeed (Rahimahullah) ney kaha : Hazrat Sakhr (Raziallahu anhu) taajir they, wo apna tijaarati qafila subah key waqt rawana farmaya kartey they, chunanche wo khushhal ho gaey aur unka maal ziyada ho gaya."
"2237","Haddasana Abu Marwan Muhammad bin Usman Al-Usmani, Haddasana Muhammad bin Maimoon Al-Madani, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Az-Zinad se, unhonne apne walid se, unhonne Al-A'raj se, unhonne Abu Huraira se, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Aye Allah! Meri ummat ke liye subah (jaldi) mein barakat de"," khaas kar jumeraat (Thursday) ke din.\"""""
"2238","Haddasana Ya'qub bin Humaid bin Kasib, Haddasana Ishaq bin Ja'far bin Muhammad bin Ali bin Husain, Abdur Rahman bin Abi Bakr Al-Jud'ani se, unhonne Nafe se, unhonne Ibn Umar se, ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Aye Allah! Meri ummat ke liye subah mein barakat de.\"""""
"2239","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney aisa janwer kharid jis ka doodh roka gaya tha to usey teen din tak ikhtiyar hai (ke soda qaaim rakhey ya khatam kar dey) agar wo janwer ko wapis karey to uskey sath eik saa khajuren bhi dey, gehun na dey."
"2240","Haddasana Muhammad bin Abdul Malik bin Abi Ash-Shawarib, Haddasana Abdul Wahid bin Ziyad, Haddasana Sadaqa bin Saeed Al-Hanafi, Haddasana Jumai' bin Umair At-Taimi, Haddasana Abdullah bin Umar, unhone kaha: Rasool Allah (Sallallahu Alaihi Wasallam) ne farmaya: \Aye logo! Jis ne doodh bandh kar ke (ya ishtihar ke liye) jaanwar becha"," to us ko teen din ka ikhtiyar hai. Agar woh use wapas kare to us ke saath us doodh ke badle mein (ya us ke baraaber) do chand (ya baraaber) gehu bhi de.\"""""
"2241","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main gawahi deta hun ke sach bolney waley , aur jinhen sachchi khabren di gaeen, (yani) Abul-Qaasim (Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam)) ney hamein hadees sunai aur farmaya : un mada janweron ki farokht dhoka hai jinka doodh roka gaya ho. aur musalman key liye dhoke bazi haram hai."
"2242","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba aur Ali bin Muhammad, unhonne kaha: Haddasana Wakee, Ibn Abi Dhi'b se, Makhlad bin Khufaf bin Ima bin Rahda Al-Ghifari se, unhonne Urwa bin Az-Zubair se, unhonne Aisha se, ke Rasool Allah (S"
"2243","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney eik ghulam kharid aur us sey mazduri karwaai, phir us ghulam mein aeb malum huwa to usey wapis kar diya. bechney waley ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! usney merey ghulam sey mazduri karwaai hai (lihaza wo aamdani mujhey dilwaai jaey). to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : faeyda (nuqsan ki) zimmey-daari key sath hai."
"2244","Hazrat Samura bin Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ghulam ki zimmey daari teen din tak hai."
"2245","Hazrat Aqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chaar din key baad (ghulam ki) koi zimmey daari nahin."
"2246","Hazrat Aqba bin Aamir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna aap farma rahey they : musalman musalman ka bhai hai, aur jo musalman apney bhai key haath koi aeb daar chiz bechey uskey liye halal nahin ke uskey liye (wo aeb) bayan na karey."
"2247","Hazrat Waasila Isqaa' (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna aap farma rahey they : jis shakhs ney bataey baghair aeb daar chiz bech di, wo hamesha Allah key ghazab mein mubtala rahega , aur farishtey is par hamesha lanat kartey rahengey."
"2248","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein jab ghulam hazir kiye jatey to aap eik ghar key sab afrad (eik shakhs ko) ata farmatey, unkey darmiyan judai dalna pasand na farmatey."
"2249","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mujhey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney do ghulam ata farmaaey jo aapas mein bhai they. mainey un mein sey eik bech diya. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : un do ghulamon ka kya haal hai? mainey kaha : mainey un mein sey eik bech diya hai. aap ney farmaya : usey wapis ley lo."
"2250","Hazrat Abu-Musa (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us shakhs par lanat farmaai hai jo maa betey mein , ya bhai bhai mein judai daley."
"2251","Hazrat Abdul-Majeed bin Wahab (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke mujh sey Hazrat Ada bin Khalid bin Hauza (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : kya main tujhey eik tehreer na padhaaun jo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey ata farmaai thi? mainey kaha : ji haan. unhoney mujhey tehreer nikal kar dikhai. is mein ye alfaz likhey huye they : ye us chiz ki dastawez hai jo Ada bin Khalid bin Hauza (Raziallahu anhu) ney Muhammad Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey khareedi. usney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey eik ghulam ya eik aisi londi khareedi hai jisey koi bimari nahin, koi buri aadat nahin aur na haram ka maal hai. ye bai eik musalman ki eik musalman sey hui hai.'"
"2252","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab koi shakhs koi londi kharidey to ye dua padhey : (اللهم إِنِّي أَسْأَلُكَ خَيْرَهَا وَخَيْرَ ما جَبَلْتَهَا عَلَيْهِ وَأَعُوذُ بِكَ مِنْ شَرِّهَا وَشَرِّ ما جَبَلْتَهَا عَلَيْهِ)aey Allah ! main tujh sey uski bhalai maangta hun aur jin aadaton par tuney isey paida kya hai unki bhalai maangta hun. aur uskey shar sey teri panah mein aata hun aur jin aadaton par tu ney isey paida kya hai unkey shar sey teri panah mein aata hun. aur barkat ki dua kerey. aur jab koi shakhs oont khareedey to unki kohaan ki bulandi par haath rakh kar barkat ki dua karey aur wohi alfaz padhey."
"2253","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : soney ka soney sey tabaadla sood hai magar jab dast badast ho (tab sood nahin), gehun ka gehun sey tabaadla sood hai siwaye uskey ke dast-badast ho, jo ka jo sey tabaadla sood hai magar jab dast badast ho, khajoor ka khajoor sey tabaadla sood hai illa ye ke dast badast ho."
"2254","Hazrat Muslim bin Yasar aur Hazrat Abdullah bin Ubaid (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : ( kisi safar mein) eik manzil par Hazrat Ubada bin Samit aur Hazrat Muawiya (Raziallahu anhuma) ki kisi girja ya (yahud key) Maabad mein baham (aapas mein) mulaqat ho gaee. Hazrat Ubada bin Samit (Raziallahu anhu) ney ( haazirin ko) hadees sunatey huye farmaya : hamen Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney chaandi key badley mein chaandi ki, soney key badley mein soney ki, gehun key badley mein gehun ki, jo key badley mein jo ki, aur khajoor key badley mein khajoor ki, eik riwayat key mutabiq : aur namak key badley mein namak ki kharido-farokht karney sey mana farmaya. aur hamen jo key badley mein gehun ya gehun key badley mein jo ki dast badast bai karney ka hukm diya jaisey hum chahen (miqdaar ki kami beshi key sath.)"
"2255","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chaandi key badley mein chaandi, soney key badley mein sona, jo key badley mein jo , aur gehun key badley mein gehun barabar barabar ( tabaadla) hona chahiye ."
"2256","Hazrat abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hamen adna qism ki khajuren inayat farmatey . hum unkey badley mein un sey behtar khajuren , ziyada narkh par kharid letey . Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : eik saa khajuron ka do saa sey tabaadla ya eik dirham ka do dirahmon sey tabaadla jayez nahin . dirham key badley mein dirham aur Dinar key badley mein Dinar hota hai. un dono key darmiyan , siwaye wazan ki kami beshi key , koi fazilat nahin ."
"2257","Hazrat abu-Saaleh (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) ko farmatey suna ke dirham key badley mein dirham aur Dinar key badley mein Dinar hota hai. mainey kaha : mainey Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ko (uskey bar-aks) dusri baat kehtey suna hai. abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : main Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey mila tha. mainey unhen kaha : aap sirf ( dirham o Dinar key tabaadley) key barey mein jo kuch farmatey hain, kya ye masla aap ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna hai ya Allah ki kitab mein (uskey barey mein) kuch dekha hai? to unhoney farmaya : mainey ye masla na Allah ki kitab mein paya hai, na Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna hai lekin mujhey Hazrat Usama bin Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) ney bataya tha ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya hai : sood sirf udhaar mein hota hai."
"2258","Hazrat Abu Jozaa (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Hazrat ibne-Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey) barahe-rast ( suna ke wo bai sarf ka hukm detey they) usey jayez kehtey they (aur un sey ye qol riwayat kya jata tha, phir mujhey khabar mili ke unhoney us qol sey ruju kar liya hai, chunanche main un sey Makka ja kar mila aur arz kya : mujhey khabar mili hai ke aap ney (Sarf key jawaz sey) ruju kar liya hai. unhoney farmaya : haan! wo qol meri apni raey thi. aur ye abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey riwayat kartey hain ke aap ney bai sirf sey mana farmaya hai."
"2259","Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : chaandi key badley mein sona lena sood hai magar jab dast badast ho (phir nahin). abu-Bakar bin Abu-Sheba bayan kartey hain ke Hazrat Sufiyan bin Uena (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : chaandi key badley mein sona, yad rakho ."
"2260","Hazrat Malik bin Aus bin Hadsan (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey (kisi majlis mein) aa kar kaha : hamen (dinaron key) badley mein dirham kon dega? to Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) key paas Hazrat Talha bin Ubedullah (Raziallahu anhu) tashrif farma they. unhoney farmaya : hamen apna sona dikhao , phir jab hamara khazaanchi aayega to hamarey paas aana, hum aap ko aap ki chaandi (dirahmon ki surat mein) ada kerengey. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : qism hai Allah ki! aisey nahin ho sakta , aap usey chaandi (abhi) ada keren, ya uska sona usey wapis kar den kyonkey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya hai : soney key badley mein chaandi ( lena ya dena) sood hai magar dast badast jayez hai."
"2261","Hazrat umr bin Muhammad bin Ali bin abi Talib apney walid (Hazrat Muhammad bin hanfiya (Rahimahullah)) sey aur wo unkey dada (aur apney walid Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Dinar key badley mein Dinar hai aur dirham key badley mein dirham. un mein koi kami beshi ( jayez ) nahin . jis ko chaandi ki zarurat ho, wo soney key badley mein usey hasil kar ley, aur jisey soney ki zarurat ho, wo chaandi key iwaz tabaadla kar key ley ley . aur sirf (dirham o Dinar ka bahami (aapsi) tabaadla) haathon haath hota hai."
"2262","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main oont becha karta tha. main chaandi key badley mein sona, soney key badley mein chaandi , dirahmon key badley mein Dinar aur dinaron key badley mein dirham ley liya karta tha, phir mainey aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey daryaft kya to Nabi (Alaihissalam) ney farmaya : jab eik chiz ley aur dusri dey to apney sathi sey juda na ho jab tak maamla saaf na ho jaey . ye riwayat eik dusri sanad sey Saeed bin Juber key shagirdon sey shak key baghair Samak bin Harab key wastey sey ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) sey marvi hai."
"2263","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba, Suwaid bin Sa'eed aur Haroon bin Ishaq ne kaha: humein Al-Mu'tamir bin Sulaiman ne khabar di, Muhammad bin Faza se, unhoon ne apne walid se, unhoon ne Alqama bin Abdullah se, unhoon ne apne walid se, unhoon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne mana farmaya musalmaano ke chalti hui sikka (ke torhne) se, magar kisi takleef (ya majboori) ke bina."
"2264","qabila banu zohra key Mola Hazrat Abu-Ayash Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney Hazrat Saad bin abi Waqas (Raziallahu anhu) sey jau ko Sulat key iwaz kharidney ka masla puchha to Hazrat Saad (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : un mein behtar jins kon si hai? Hazrat Zaid (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : (mainey kaha) jo . to Saad (Raziallahu anhu) ney mujhey us tabaadley sey mana farma diya aur farmaya : mainey khud suna ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey khushk khajoor key iwaz taza khajoor kharidney key barey mein puchha gaya to aap ney farmaya : kya taza khajoor khushk ho kar (wazan mein) kam ho jati hai? Sahaba kiram Raziallahu anhum ney kaha : ji haan . to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us bai sey mana farma diya ."
"2265","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney bai mazaabna sey mana farmaya. mazaabna ka matlab ye hai ke aadmi apney baagh ka phal us andaz sey farokht karey ke khajoor key darakhton ka phal khushk khajuron key iwaz maap kar bechey. aur angoor ki belon ka phal kishmish key iwaz maap kar bechey, aur khet (ki fasal) ghalley key iwaz maap kar farokht kerey. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney un sab Suraton sey mana farmaya."
"2266","Azhar bin Marwan ne kaha, humein Hammad bin Zaid ne bayan kiya, Ayyub se, unhoon ne Abul Zubair aur Sa'eed bin Mina se, unhoon ne Jabir bin Abdullah se, ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne Muhafala aur Muzabana se mana farmaya."
"2267","Hammad bin al-Sari ne kaha, humein Abul Ahwas ne bayan kiya, Tariq bin Abdur Rahman se, Sa'eed bin al-Musayyab se, Rafay bin Khadij se, unhoon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne Muhafala aur Muzabana se mana farmaya."
"2268","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mujhey Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ney bataya ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney araaya key barey mein rukhsat di hai."
"2269","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mujhey Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ney bataya ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ariya ko uskey andazey key barabar khushk khajoor key iwaz farokht karney ki ijazat di. Hazrat Yahya bin Saeed (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : araaya ka ye matlab hai ke aadmi khajoor key chand darakhton ka taza phal andazey sey apney ghar ki khushk khajuron key iwaz kharid ley."
"2270","Abdullah bin Sa'eed ne kaha, humein Abda bin Sulaiman ne bayan kiya, Sa'eed bin Abi Aruba se, Qatada se, Hasan se, Samra bin Jundab se, ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne mana farmaya jaandar ko jaandar ke badle udhaar (nasiya) par bechne se."
"2271","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : eik janwer ka do janweron sey dast badast tabaadla karney mein koi harj nahin . aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney (is qism ka tabaadla) udhaar key sath napasand farmaya."
"2272","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Safeeya (Raziallahu anha) ko saat ghulamon key iwaz kharid tha. Abdur-Rehman bin Mehdi (Rahimahullah) ney is hadees mein ye alfaz bhi bayan farmaai : Hazrat dahiya kalbi (Raziallahu anhu) sey ."
"2273","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis raat mujhey meraaj hui, (us safar key doran mein) mera guzar aisey afrad key paas sey huwa jinkey pet makaanon ki tarah (badey badey) they, un (peton) mein sanp bharey huye they jo unkey un key peton key bahar sey nazar aa rahey they. mainey kaha : Jibril ! ye kon log hain? Jibril (Alaihissalam) ney farmaya : ye sood khaney waley hain."
"2274","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sood key sattar gunah hain jin mein sab sey halka gunah is qadr (bada) hai jaisey koi shakhs apni maa sey nikah kerey."
"2275","Amr bin Ali al-Sairaafi Abu Hafs ne kaha, humein Ibn Abi Adi ne bayan kiya, Shu'ba se, Zubaid se, Ibrahim se, Masruq se, Abdullah (bin Masood) se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se ki aap ne farmaya: \Sood (riba) ke tehattar (73) darwaze hain.\"""""
"2276","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : sab sey aakhir mein sood ki aayat nazil hui aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) uski tashreeh karney sey pehley faut ho gaey, isliye sood ko bhi chhod do aur mashkook surat sey bhi perhez karo."
"2277","Muhammad bin Bashar ne kaha, humein Muhammad bin Ja'far ne bayan kiya, humein Shu'ba ne bayan kiya, humein Simak bin Harb ne bayan kiya, unhoon ne kaha: maine Abdur Rahman bin Abdullah ko suna, woh Abdullah bin Masood se riwayat karte the, ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne laanat farmayi sood khane wale par, sood khilane wale par, uske do gawaahon par, aur likhne wale par."
"2278","Abdullah bin Sa'eed ne kaha, humein Ismail bin 'Ulayya ne bayan kiya, humein Dawood bin Abi Hind ne bayan kiya, Sa'eed bin Abi Khaira se, Hasan se, Abu Huraira se, unhoon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Zaroor aayega logon par ek zamana ke un mein se koi nahi bachega magar woh sood khayega"," pas jisne sood nahi khaya usay uski gard (gubaar) lagegi.\"""""
"2279","Abbas bin Ja'far ne kaha, humein Amr bin Aun ne bayan kiya, humein Yahya bin Abi Za'ida ne bayan kiya, Israel se, Rukain bin al-Rabi' bin Amila se, unhoon ne apne walid se, unhoon ne Ibn Masood se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, aap ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs bhi sood (ko zyada kare) to uske kaam ka anjaam kam (tangdasti) hi hota hai.\"""""
"2280","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (Madina munawwara) tashrif laye to log do-do teen-teen saal pehley raqam dey kar khajuren kharid letey they to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs khajuron ki bai salaf karey to usey chahiye ke malum maap aur malum tol key sath malum muddat key liye bai salaf kerey."
"2281","Hazrat Abdullah bin Salam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik aadmi ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kiya : falan log musalman ho gaey hain, unka talluq Yahud sey hai aur wo bhookey hain (un key paas khurak mojud nahin) mujhey khatra hai ke wo (bhook ki wajeh sey) murtad ho jaeyngey. to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kisi key paas (kuchh maal) mojud hai? eik Yahudi ney kaha : merey paas itni miqdaar hai (usney chiz ka naam bhi liya tha) usney ghaaliban kaha : teen sau Dinar. (aur kaha ke main iskey iwaz) falan bhaaw sey, falan baagh sey (wasul karunga) Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : falan bhaaw sey, itni muddat key udhaar par, lekin falan baagh sey nahin (baagh key ta'yun ki shart na lagaeyn)."
"2282","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abu Mujaalid ya Abu Majaalid sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Hazrat Abdullah bin Shaddad aur Hazrat Abu-Barza (Raziallahu anhuma) ka bai-salam key barey mein ikhtilaf ho gaya. unhoney mujhey Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Oofaa (Raziallahu anhu) key paas bheja. mainey (un ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar) un sey daryaft kiya to unhoney farmaya : hum log Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key ehad Mubarak mein aur Hazrat abu-Bakar aur Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhuma) key zamanae Mubarak mein gehun , jau , munaqqa aur khajoor un logon sey peshgi raqam dey kar kharid letey they jinkey paas (us waqt) wo cheezen nahin hoti thin. unhoney farmaya : mainey Abdur-Rehman bin Abzi (Raziallahu anhu) sey bhi ye masla puchha to unhoney bhi yehi farmaya."
"2283","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab to kisi chiz ki baie-salaf karey to usey dusri chiz (ke saude) sey tabdeel na kar. Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney yehi riwayat Shujaa bin Waleed key doosrey shagrid Abdullah bin Saeed ki sanad sey bhi isi tarah bayan ki lekin is mein Ziyad bin Khaseema aur Atiya key darmiyan Saad ka wasta bayan nahin kiya."
"2284","Najraani sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey kaha : kya main khoshey nikalney sey pehley khajuron key darakhton ki baie-salam kar liya karun? unhoney farmaya : nahin ! mainey kaha : kyon? unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney main eik shakhs ney khajuron key darakhton par khoshey zahir honey sey pehley khajuron key eik baagh ki baie-salam ki. us saal baagh mein phal na laga. kharidar ney kaha : khoshey aaney tak ye baagh mera hai. bechney waley ney kaha : mainey tujhey ye baagh eik saal key liye farokht kiya tha. unhoney apna muqadma Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kiya to aap ney bechney waley sey kaha : kya usney terey darakhton sey kuchh (phal ya rupya) wasul kiya hai? usney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : to phir uska maal apney liye kis tarah halal samajhta hai? us sey jo kuchh liya hai, wo usey wapis kar dey aur (aainda) khajoor key darakhton ki bai-salam na kiya karo jab tak uski salahiyat zahir na ho jaey."
"2285","Hazrat Abu-Raafey (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik aadmi sey jawan oont qarz liya aur farmaya : jab zakat key oont ayengey, hum tujhey (eik oont) ada kar dengey. jab oont aaye to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : abu-Raafey ! us shakhs ko uska jawan oont ada kar do. lekin mujhey chaar daant ya us sey ziyada umr wala oont hi mila. mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko (soorate haal sey) aagah kiya to aap ney farmaya : wohi dey do, behtareen log wo hotey hain jo achchhey tareeqey sey (qarz) ada kartey hain."
"2286","Hazrat Arbaz bin Saariya (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir tha ke eik Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) ney arz kiya : mujhey mera oont ada farma dijiye. Nabi (Alaihissalam) ney isey badi umr ka oont ata farmaya to usney kaha : Allah key Rasool ! iski umr to merey oont sey ziyada hai (aur ye ziyada qeemti hai). Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : behtareen log wo hotey hain jo achchhey tareeqey sey (qarz) ada karen."
"2287","Usman aur Abu Bakr (donon Abu Shayba ke bete) ne kaha: humein Abdur Rahman bin Mahdi ne bayan kiya, Sufyan se, Ibrahim bin Muhajir se, Mujahid se, Qa'id al-Saib se, Saib se, unhoon ne kaha: maine Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se kaha: \Aap jaahiliyyat ke zamaane mein mere shareek the"," to aap sabse achhe shareek the"," aap mujhse jhagda nahi karte the aur na mujhe dhoka dete the.\"""""
"2288","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey , Hazrat Saad (Raziallahu anhu) ney aur Hazrat Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) ney jange Badr key din hasil honey waley maale ghanimat mein sharaakat ki. main aur Hazrat Ammar (Raziallahu anhu) kuchh na laye, jabke Hazrat Saad (Raziallahu anhu)) kuffar key (do aadmi) giraftar kar key (ley aaye). jo hum teeno key mushtarka ghulam huye."
"2289","Hazrat Saleh bin Suheb bin Sanan (Rahimahullah) apney walid (Hazrat Suheb Romi (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen chizon mein barkat hai : udhaar bechnaa , muqaarza, aur ghar mein istimal key liye gehun mein jau mila lena, bechney key liye nahin."
"2290","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne kaha, humein Ibn Abi Za'ida ne bayan kiya, A'mash se, Umara bin Umair se, unhoon ki phupi se, Aisha (radhi allahu anha) se, unhoon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Beshaq sabse pak cheez jo tum khaate ho woh tumhari kamaai hai aur beshaq tumhari aulaad bhi tumhari kamaai hai.\"""""
"2291","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! merey paas kuchh maal hai aur meri aulad bhi hai. aur mera baap mera sara maal ley lena chahta hai to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : to bhi aur tera maal bhi terey baap hi ka hai."
"2292","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur arz kiya : merey walid ney mera sara maal ley liya hai. to aap ney farmaya : to aur tera maal terey baap ka hai.  aur Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ye bhi farmaya hai : tumhari aulad tumhari behtareen kamai mein sey hai, isliye unkey maal sey kha liya karo."
"2293","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Hind binte Utba bin Rabiaa‬ (Raziallahu anha) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huin aur arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! (merey shohar) Hazrat Abu-Sufiyaan paisa sanbhaal kar rakhney waley aadmi hain. wo mujhey itna (kharch) nahin detey jo mujhey aur merey bachchon ko kafi ho, siwaye uikey ke main un ki la ilmi mein unkey maal mein sey kuchh ley lun (tab guzaara ho sakta hai) to aap ney farmaya : itna ley lo jo tumhen aur tumhari aulad ko munasib had tak kafi ho."
"2294","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab aurat (ghar key halaat mein) kharabi kiye baghair khawind key ghar sey kharch karey (riwayat key Raavi Muhammad bin Abdullah ney kaha) merey baap ney apni hadees mein bayan kiya : jab khana khilaaey to usey us (key amal) ka sawab milega , aur mard ko uski kamai honey ki wajeh sey itna hi sawab milega, aur aurat ko (Fi sabilillah) kharch karney ka sawab milega, aur (maal ki hifazat aur kharch key zimmedar) khazaanchi ko bhi itna hi sawab milega. unkey sawab mein (eik doosrey key sawab ki wajeh sey) koi kami nahin ki jaeygi."
"2295","Hazrat Abu-Umama Baahli (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna aap farma rahey they : aurat apney ghar ki koi chiz khawind ki ijazat key baghair kharch na kerey. haazirin ney arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! khana bhi nahin? aap ney farmaya : wo to hamara umda maal hai."
"2296","Muhammad bin al-Sabah ne kaha, humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, (aur) Amr bin Rafay ne kaha, humein Jarir ne bayan kiya, Muslim al-Mulaai se, unhoon ne Anas bin Maalik ko kehte suna: \Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ghulam ki daawat bhi qabool farma lete the.\"""""
"2297","Hazrat Aabiul-Laham (Raziallahu anhu) key azad karda ghulam Hazrat Umer (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : merey aaqa mujhey (khaney ki) koi chiz detey to main (doosron ko) khila deta. unhoney mujhey mana kiya. ya farmaya : unhoney mujhey maara. mainey ya unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey (is soorate-haal key mutalliq) daryaft kiya. mainey kaha : main to us kaam sey baaz nahin aaunga . ya (kaha) main ye kaam tarak nahin karunga to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sawab tum dono ko milega."
"2298","bano ghabar qabiley key eik fard Hazrat Ibaad bin Shurehbil (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik saal hamarey yahan qehat pad gaya, main Madiney aaya. wahan eik khet mein chala gaya aur kuchh khoshey tod kar daney nikal kar kha liye aur (kuchh daney) apni chadar mein dal liye. khet waley ney aa kar mujhey maara aur mera kapda chin liya. mainey Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar shikayat ki to aap ney us aadmi sey farmaya : wo bhookaa ya thakaa huwa tha tu ney isey khana nahin khilaya. wo (masley sey) na-waqif tha tu ney isey taalim nahin di . Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key hukm sey us shakhs ney kapda wapis kar diya. aur aap ney isey eik aadha wasq ghalla bhi dilwaya."
"2299","Hazrat Raafey bin Amr Ghifaari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab main ladka tha to main (eik baar) apney khajuron key darakhton par, ya farmaya : Ansaar key darakhton par patthar maar raha tha. mujhey (pakad kar) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir kiya gaya to aap ney farmaya : ladkey ! ya farmaya : beta ! to darakhton par patthar kyon maarta hai? mainey kaha : khaney key liye . aap ney farmaya : darakhton par patthar na phenka kar, jo khajuren nichey giri hui hon, wo kha liya kar. phir merey sar par haath pher kar farmaya : aey Allah ! iska pet bhar dey."
"2300","Hazrat Abu-Saeed (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab to kisi charwahey (key rewad) key paas sey guzrey to us (charwahey) ko teen baar aawaz dey. agar wo tujhey jawab dey to theek hai (us sey ijazat ley ley) warna kharabi kiye baghair (bakri ka doodh hasabe zarurat) pi ley. jab tera guzar kisi baagh key paas sey ho to baagh waley ko teen baar aawaz dey. agar wo ijazat dey to behtar warna (baagh ka phal hasabe zarurat) kha ley lekin kharabi na karna."
"2301","Hadiya bin Abdul Wahhab, Ayyub bin Hassan al-Wasiti, aur Ali bin Salma ne kaha: humein Yahya bin Sulaim al-Taifi ne bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Nafe se, Ibn Umar se, unhoon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jab tum mein se koi kisi bagh (haait) se guzre to usme se kha le"," lekin apni jholi bhar kar na le.\"""""
"2302","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (khitab farmaney key liye) khadey huye aur farmaya : koi shakhs kisi key janwer ka doodh bila ijazat na ley. kya tum mein sey kisi ko ye baat achchhi lagti hai ke koi uskey kamrey mein aa kar uskey ghalla mehfooz rakhney ki jagah ka darwaza todey aur ghalla nikal kar ley jaey? logon key janweron key thanon mein un (malikon) ki khurak mehfooz hoti hai, isliye koi aadmi kisi shakhs ka janwer uski ijazat key baghair na dohey ."
"2303","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik safar mein hum log Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath they. (raastey main eik jagah) hamen keekar key darakhton taley kuchh than bandhi oontniyaan nazar aayin. hum unkey paas jama ho gaey. (us par) hamein Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney aawaz di to hum aap key paas wapis aagaey. aap ney farmaya : ye oontniyaan eik musalman gharaney ki hain. Allah key baad yehi unkey liye khurak ka zariya aur barkat ka baais hain. kya tumhen ye baat achchhi lagti hai ke tum apney tosha daanon key paas pahuncho to dekho ke un mein jo kuchh tha, koi ley gaya hai? kya tum isey insaf samajhtey ho? ,Sahaba Raziallahu anhum ney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : ye maamla bhi aisa hi hai. hamney arz kiya : agar hamein khaney peeney ki zarurat ho to (hum kya keren)? aap ney farmaya : kha lo aur sath na ley jaao, pi lo aur sath na ley jaao."
"2304","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne kaha, humein Waqi ne bayan kiya, Hisham bin Urwa se, unhoon ne apne walid se, unhoon ne Umm Hani se, ki Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne unse farmaya: \Bakriyaan paal lo"," beshaq us mein barkat hai.\"""""
"2305","Hazrat Urwa bin Ja'ad Baarqi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : oont apney malikon key liye quwat ka baais hain, aur bakriyan barkat wali hain, aur ghodon ki peshani key baalon sey qiyamat tak khair ka talluq qaaim kar diya gaya hai."
"2306","Isma bin al-Fadl al-Naisaburi aur Muhammad bin Firas Abu Huraira al-Sairaafi ne kaha: humein Harmiy bin Umara ne bayan kiya, humein Zarbe ne bayan kiya (jo Hisham bin Hassan ki masjid ke imam the), humein Muhammad bin Sireen ne bayan kiya, Ibn Umar (radi Allahu anhu) se, unhoon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Bakri jannati janwaron mein se hai.\"""""
"2307","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney dolat mandon ko bakriyan paalney ka hukm diya aur naadaaron (ghareebon) ko murghiyan paalney ka hukm diya. aur farmaya : jab dolat mand murghiyan paalney lagen to Allah Taala bastiyon ko halak karney ka hukm dey deta hai."
"2308","Abu Bakr bin Abi Shayba ne kaha, humein Mu'alla bin Mansur ne bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Ja'far se, Usman bin Muhammad se, Maqburi se, Abu Huraira se, Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) se, aap ne farmaya: \Jise logon ka qaazi banaya gaya"," to use bina chhuri ke zibah kar diya gaya.\"""""
"2309","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney qazi ka mansab talab kiya, wo apni jaan key hawaley kar diya jata hai, aur jisey us (mansab ko qubul kerney) par majbur kiya gaya, eik farishta nazil ho kar uski rehnumai karta hai."
"2310","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mujhey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Yamen rawana farmaya to mainey arz kiya : Allah key Rasool ! aap mujhey rawana farma rahey hain ke unkey faisley karun, halanke main jawan hun (tajarba kaar nahin), mujhey to malum nahin faisla kaisey kiya jata hai? Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ney bayan kiya : aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney merey seeney par haath maara aur farmaya : aey Allah ! iskey dil ko hidayat dey aur iski zaban ko (sahih baat par) qaaim farma. wo farmatey hain : iskey baad mujhey do shakhson key darmiyan faisla kartey waqt kabhi shak pesh nahin aaya."
"2311","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo bhi Qazi logon key darmiyan faisley karta hai, qiyamat key din wo us haal mein hazir hoga ke eik farishtey ney usey guddi sey pakad rakha hoga, phir aasman ki taraf sar uthaeyga , agar Allah ney farmaya : usey phenk dey to farishta usey (jahannam key) gadhey mein phenk dega (jis mein wo) chaalis saal tak (girta chala jaeyga)."
"2312","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abi Aufi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala Qazi key sath hota hai jab tak wo zulm (be insafi) na karey. jab wo zulm karta hai to Allah Taala usey uskey nafs key supurd kar deta hai."
"2313","Ali bin Muhammad ne kaha, humein Waki ne bayan kiya, humein Ibn Abi Zi'b ne bayan kiya, unke khaal (chacha) Haris bin Abdur Rahman se, Abu Salma se, Abdullah bin Amr se, unhoon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Allah ki laanat hai rishwat dene wale aur rishwat lene wale par.\"""""
"2314","Hisham bin Ammar ne kaha, humein Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad al-Darawardi ne bayan kiya, humein Yazid bin Abdullah bin al-Haad ne bayan kiya, Muhammad bin Ibrahim al-Taymi se, Busr bin Sa'eed se, Abi Qais se (jo Amr bin al-Aas ke ghulam the), Amr bin al-Aas se, ki unhoon ne suna Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) farma rahe the: \Jab haakim (qazi) faisla kare aur ijtehad kare aur sahi ho to uske liye do ajr hai"," aur jab faisla kare aur ijtehad kare aur ghalati ho to uske liye ek ajr hai.\"" Yazid ne kaha: maine yeh Abu Bakr bin Amr bin Hazm se bayan kiya"," to unhone kaha: aise hi mujhe Abu Salma ne Abu Huraira se bayan kiya."""
"2315","Hazrat Abu-Hashim (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke agar Hazrat Abdullah bin Barida (Rahimahullah) ki wo hadees na hoti jo unhoney apney walid (Hazrat Barida bin Haseeb Aslami (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat ki hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Qazi teen (tarah key) hain. do jahannam mein jaeyngey aur eik jannat mein. (eik) wo aadmi (hai) jisney haq malum kar liya , phir uskey mutabiq faisla diya to wo jannat mein jaeyga. (doosra) wo aadmi (hai) jisney (haq sey) la ilm hotey huye logon mein faisla kiya, wo jahannam mein jaeyga. (teesra) wo aadmi (hai) jisney faisla kartey huye zulm sey kaam liya, wo bhi jahannam mein jaeyga. (agar ye hadees na hoti) to hum kehtey ke Qazi jab ijtihaad sey kaam ley (apni puri koshish kerey) to wo jannati hai."
"2316","Hazrat Abu-Bakra (Nufai bin Haris bin Kalda Saqafi (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Qazi do aadmiyon key darmiyan faisla na karey jabke wo ghussay mein ho. (ustaad) Hisham ney apni riwayat mein ye alfaz bayan farmaaey hain : faisla karney waley key liye munasib nahin ke wo do aadmiyon key darmiyan faisla karey jabke wo ghussey mein ho."
"2317","Ummul-mominin Hazrat Umme-Salma (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum merey paas apney jhagdon ley kar aatey ho. aur main eik insan hi hun. shayad koi shakhs apni daleel ko doosrey ki nisbat behtar tor par bayan kar sakta ho. aur main to jo kuchh tum (fareeqain aur gawahon) sey sunta hun usi key mutabiq faisla karta hun, lihaza jis ko main uskey bhai key haq mein sey koi chiz dey dun to wo usey na ley. main to usey aag ka eik tukda dey raha hun. qiyamat key din wo usey ley kar hazir hoga."
"2318","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main to mehaz eik insan hun. shayad tum mein sey eik shakhs apni daleel ko doosrey ki nisbat behtar tor par bayan kar sakta ho, lihaza jis ko uskey bhai key haq mein sey eik tukda kaat kar dey dun to main usey (jahannam ki) aag ka eik tukda kaat kar dey raha hun."
"2319","Abdul Waris bin Abdul Samad bin Abdul Waris bin Saeed Abu Ubaida ne kaha, mujh se mere walid ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha mujh se mere walid ne bayan kiya, mujh se Hussain bin Zakwan ne bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Burayda se, unhone kaha: mujh se Yahya bin Ya'mar ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha: Abul Aswad al-Dili ne unhe bayan kiya, Abu Zar se, ki unhoon ne suna Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) farma rahe the: \Jisne us cheez ka daawa kiya jo uski nahi hai woh hum mein se nahi"," aur woh apna thikanah jahannam mein bana le.\"""""
"2320","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney kisi muqaddmey mein zulm mein (zalim ki) madad ki, wo hamesha Allah ki narazi ka mustahiq rehta hai yahan tak key (us gunah sey) baaz aa jaey."
"2321","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar logon ko mehaz unkey dawey ki bina par chiz dey di jaey to log doosrey afrad key jaan aur maal par dawey kar den lekin qism khana uske zimme hai jis par ilzaam lagaaya gaya hai."
"2322","Hazrat Ash'as bin Qais (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : zamin ka eik tukda meri aur Yahudi ki mushtarka milkiyat tha. usney mera hissa taslim karney sey inkar kar diya. mainey usey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein pesh kiya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mujh sey farmaya : kya terey paas koi gawah hai? mainey kaha : nahin. Nabi (Alaihissalam) ney Yahudi sey kaha : qism kha. mainey kaha : wo to (jhooti) qism kha kar mera maal ley ley ga. to Allah Taala ney ye aayat nazil farmaai : (إِنَّ ٱلَّذِينَ يَشْتَرُونَ بِعَهْدِ ٱللَّهِ وَأَيْمَـٰنِهِمْ ثَمَنًا قَلِيلًا),''be shak jo log Allah key ehad aur apni qasmon ko thodi qeemat par bech daltey hain unkey liye aakhirat mein koi hissa nahin, Allah Taala na to un sey baat cheet kerega, na un ki taraf qiyamat key din dekhega, na unhen pak kerega, aur unkey liye dardnak azab hai.''"
"2323","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney koi qism khai jabke wo qism khatey huye gunah (jhoot) ka kaam kar raha hai aur is (jhooti qasam) key zariey sey kisi musalman key maal ka kuchh hissa hasil karta hai, jab Allah sey uski mulaqat hogi to Allah is par naraz hoga."
"2324","Hazrat Abu-Umama Haarisi (Raziallahu anhu) bayan kartey hain ke unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna aap farma rahey they : jo shakhs qism kha kar kisi musalman aadmi ka haq maarta hai to Allah Taala is par jannat haram aur jahannam wajib kar deta hai. haazirin mein sey eik sahab ney kaha : agar-che koi maamuli si chiz ho? Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar-che peelu ki eik miswak ho."
"2325","Amr bin Rafay ne kaha, humein Marwan bin Muawiya ne bayan kiya, aur Ahmad bin Sabit al-Jahdari ne kaha, humein Safwan bin Isa ne bayan kiya, dono ne kaha: humein Hashim bin Hashim ne bayan kiya, Abdullah bin Nistaas se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhoon ne kaha: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Jisne mere is mimbar ke paas jhooti qasam khayi"," to woh apna thikana jahannam mein bana le"," chahe woh qasam miswak (hari lakdi) par hi kyun na ho.\"""""
"2326","Narrated to us Muhammad ibn Yahya and Zayd ibn Akhram, who both said: narrated to us al-Dahhak ibn Makhlad: narrated to us al-Hasan ibn Yazid ibn Farrukh — Muhammad ibn Yahya said, and he was Abu Yunus al-Qawi — who said: I heard Abu Salamah saying: I heard Abu Hurayrah saying: The Messenger of Allah ﷺ said, “No slave or slave-woman shall swear a false oath at this pulpit — even if it be for a fresh tooth-stick — except that the Fire shall become obligatory for him.”"
"2327","Hazrat Bara bin Aazib (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik Yahudi aalim ko bulaya aur farmaya : main tujhey us zaat ki qism deta hun jisney Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) par Torat nazil farmaai."
"2328","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney do yahudiyon sey farmaya : main tumhen us Allah ki qism deta hun jisney Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) par Torat nazil farmaai."
"2329","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke do aadmiyon ney eik janwer key barey mein daawey kiya, aur unkey darmiyan (faisla karney wali) koi gawahi mojud na thi to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen hukm diya ke qism khaney key liye qura andazi kar lein. (phir jis ka qura nikley wo qism kha ley)."
"2330","Hazrat Abu-Musa Ash-ari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke do aadmiyon ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key samney muqadma pesh kiya, unkey darmiyan (jhagdey ki wajeh) eik janwer tha. un mein sey kisi key paas gawah na tha to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney un dono ko wo janwer aadha aadha taqseem kar diya (ke wo janwer farokht kar key qeemat aapas mein taqseem kar lein)."
"2331","Hazrat Samura bin Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab kisi ki koi chiz gum ho jaey ya chori ho jaey, phir usey wo chiz us shakhs key haath mein miley jo usey farokht kar raha hai to wo (Malik) us chiz ka ziyada haq rakhta hai aur kharidar bechney waley sey apni qeemat wasul kar ley."
"2332","Hazrat Haram bin Saad bin Mahisa (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Bara bin Aazib bin Haris (Raziallahu anhuma) ki eik oontni logon key khet char jaya karti thi. wo kuchh logon key baagh mein ja ghusi aur usey kharab kar diya. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein waqia arz kiya gaya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ye faisla farmaya ke maal (baagh waghera) ki hifazat din key waqt (baagh key) malikon ki zimmey daari hai. aur raat ko janwer jo kuch kharab karen uski talaafi janweron key malikon key zimmey hai. Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) ney eik dusri sanad sey ye riwayat Bara bin Aazib sey bayan farmaai ke aale Bara ki eik oontni ney kisi ki kheti waghera kharab kar di to aap ney mazkura hadees ki tarah hi faisla farmaya."
"2333","Hazrat Qais bin Wahab Rahimahullah qabila banu Sawaat key eik aadmi sey riwayat kartey hain, usney kaha : mainey Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey arz kiya : mujhey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key akhlaq key barey mein bataaiye. unhoney farmaya : kya to Quran nahin padhta? (jis mein ye irshad hai : )  (وَإِنَّكَ لَعَلَىٰ خُلُقٍ عَظِيمٍ), ''aap yaqinan azeem akhlaq key hamil hain.'' (uskey baad Ummul-mominin (Raziallahu anha) ney) farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) apney as-haab key sath tashrif farma they. mainey aap key liye khana tayyar kiya. Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ney bhi aap key liye khana tayyar kiya. Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) ney pehley tayyar kar liya. mainey khaadima sey kaha : ja kar unka piyala ulat do. Hazrat Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) abhi piyala Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key samney rakhney ka irada hi kar rahi thin ke khaadima ney unhen ja liya aur piyala ulat diya. piyala (gir kar) toot gaya aur khana bikhar gaya. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney piyaley key tukdey jama kiye aur is mein jo khana tha wo chamdey key dastar khuwan par jama kiya aur sab ney khaya, phir Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mera piyala Hafsa (Raziallahu anha) key yahan bhej diya, aur wo unhi ko dey diya. aur farmaya : apney bartan ki jagah ye bartan ley lo. aur is mein jo khana hai wo bhi kha lo. (Ummul-mominin ney) farmaya : mujhey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key chehre Mubarak par naraazgi key asaar nazar nahin aaye."
"2334","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) eik Ummul-mominin (Raziallahu anha) key yahan tashrif farma they. eik aur Ummul-mominin (Raziallahu anha) ney eik piyaley mein khana bheja. unhoney laney wali key haath par haath maara to piyala gir kar toot gaya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney piyaley key dono tukdey ley kar eik doosrey sey milaaey aur us (tootey huye piyaley) mein khana dalney lagey aur farmaya : tumhari maa ko ghairat aa gaee thi. khana kha lo. chunanche unhoney khana khaya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jis zauja mohtarma key yahan tashrif farma they, wo apna piyala laeen to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wo sahih Salim piyala khana laney wali ko dey diya aur tootaa huwa unkey ghar rehney diya jinhoney wo toda tha."
"2335","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab kisi sey uska hamsaaya (padosi) uski deewar mein lakdi gaadney ki ijazat talab karey to (usey chahiye ke) usey mana na karey. (Abdur-Rehman Aaraj (Rahimahullah) ney kaha : ) jab Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney ye hadees sunai to saamein (sunne waalon) ney sar jhuka liye, chunanche jab Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ney unhen (is haal mein) dekha to farmaya : kya wajeh hai ke main tumhen is hadees sey aeraz kartey (bachte hue) mehsoos karta hun? Allah ki qism ! main is (hadees) ko tumharey kandhon par maaroonga."
"2336","Hazrat Ikrima bin Salma (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke qabila banu Mughira key do bhai they. un mein sey eik ney qism kha li ke wo apni deewar par (kisi ko) shehteer nahin rakhney dega warna ghulam azad karega. is par Hazrat ikrima bin Salma (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke qabila banu Mughira key do bhai they. un mein sey eik ney qism kha li ke wo apni deewar par (kisi ko) shehteer nahin rakhney dega warna ghulam azad kerega. is par Hazrat Majmaa bin Yazeed (Raziallahu anhu) aur bahut sey doosrey Ansari as-haab aagey aur unhoney kaha : hum gawahi detey hain ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shakhs apney hamsaaey ko apni deewar par shehteer rakhney sey mana na karey. us (qasam khaney waley) aadmi ney kaha : merey bhai ! aap key haq mein , merey khilaf faisla ho gaya hai (aur main isey qubul karta hun) lekin mainey qism kha li hai to aap meri deewar key sath eik sutoon bana lein aur is par apna shehteer rakh lein."
"2337","Harmala bin Yahya ne kaha, humein Abdullah bin Wahb ne bayan kiya, mujhe Ibn Lahi'a ne khabar di, Abul Aswad se, Ikrama se, Ibn Abbas se, ki Nabi (sallallahu alayhi wa sallam) ne farmaya: \Tum mein se koi apne padosi ko apni deewar par lakdi rakhne se na rokay.\"""""
"2338","Haddathana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba, haddathana Wakii, haddathana Muthanna bin Saeed al-Dhubai, an Qatada, an Bashir bin Kaab, an Abu Huraira, qala: Qala Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: “Raasta saat haath ka banao.”"
"2339","Haddathana Muhammad bin Yahya aur Muhammad bin Umar bin Hiyaj, unhon ne kaha: Haddathana Qabisa, haddathana Sufyan, an Simak, an Ikrama, an Ibn Abbas, qala: Qala Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: “Jab tum raasta mein ikhtilaf karo to use saat haath ka banao.”"
"2340","Hazrat Ubada bin Samit (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney faisla diya : na (pehley pehal) kisi ko nuqsan pahunchana aur takleef dena jayez hai, na badley key tor par nuqsan pahunchana aur takleef dena."
"2341","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : na (pehley pehal) kisi ko nuqsan pahunchana aur takleef dena jayez hai, na badley key tor par nuqsan pahunchana aur takleef dena."
"2342","Hazrat Abu-Sarma (Malik bin Qais Ansari)  (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo ( kisi ko) nuqsan pahunchaeyga, Allah uska nuqsan kar dega aur jo kisi ko mushkil mein daleyga, Allah is par sakhti karega."
"2343","Namraan bin Jaariya apney walid (Hazrat Jaariya bin Zafar (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain ke kuchh logon ney eik jhaunpdi key barey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein daawa kiya. wo (jhaunpdi) dono fariqon key istimal mein thi. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ko unka faisla karney key liye bheja. Hazrat Huzefa (Raziallahu anhu) ney un logon key haq mein faisla diya jinki taraf sarkandey ka naram hissa tha. jab wo wapis Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye aur aap ko (is faisley ki) khabar di to aap ney farmaya : tu ney durust (faisla) kiya aur achcha faisla kiya."
"2344","Hazrat Samura bin Jundub (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jab eik chiz do aadmiyon key haath farokht kar di jaey to pehley key haath bechnaa hi moatabar hoga. Abul-Waleed ney kaha : is hadees sey (doosrey kharidar ki taraf sey) qabza dilwaney ki shart najaaiz sabit hoti hai."
"2345","Hazrat Imran bin Husain (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi key chhe ghulam they. uska unkey ilawa aur koi maal nahin tha. usney wafat key waqt un sab ko azad kar diya. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unkey (teen) hissey kiye , phir do ghulamon ko azad kar diya aur chaar ko ghulam rehney diya."
"2346","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik saudey mein do aadmiyon ka jhagda ho gaya . un mein sey kisi key paas sabut nahin tha (gawahi waghera ya koi aur tareeqa) to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen hukm diya ke qura dal kar qism kha lein, chahey unhen (qasam khana) pasand ho ya na-pasand ho."
"2347","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab kisi safar mein tashrif ley jatey to apni azwaje-mutahrat (paak biwiyon) (Raziallahu anhu) mein qura daltey."
"2348","Hazrat Zaid bin Arqam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) Yamen mein they to un ki khidmat mein teen mard hazir kiye gaey jinhoney eik aurat sey eik hi tuhur (paaki) mein jima (sambhog) kiya tha. (ab us aurat key bachey key barey mein jhagda ho gaya tha) Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ney do aadmiyon sey puchha : kya tum dono is (teesrey) shakhs key haq mein bachchey ka iqrar kartey ho? un dono ney kaha : nahin. phir do aadmiyon (doosrey aur teesrey) sey farmaya : kya tum taslim kartey ho ke bachcha us (pehley) ka hai? unhoney kaha : nahin. (isi tarah teesrey aur pehley ko mukhatib kar key poochha) Hazrat Ali jab bhi (koi sey) do sey sawal kartey : kya tum taslim kartey ho ke bacha us (teesrey sathi) ka hai? to dono kehtey : nahin, chunanche aap ney un (teeno) key darmiyan qura dala aur jis key naam ka qura nikla bacha usi ka qarar dey diya aur uskey zimmey do tihai diyat dal di. ye waqia Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein arz kiya gaya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) khul kar hansey yahan tak key aap ki daadhein zahir ho gaeen."
"2349","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : eik din Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) merey paas bahut khush khush tashrif laye aur aap farma rahey they : Aaisha ! tumhen nahin malum ke aaj Mujaz'ziz Mudlaji merey paas aaya to usney Usama aur Zaid (Raziallahu anhuma) ko dekha ke wo chadar odhey (letey) huye they. unhoney apney sar chupa rakhey they aur unkey paon nazar aa rahey they to us (Mujaz'ziz) ney kaha : ye paon eik doosrey sey miltey hain."
"2350","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Quraish eik kaahin aurat key paas gaey aur us sey kaha : hamein ye bata ke maqame Ibrahim par jis shakhs ka nishan hai, hum mein sey kis ka nishane qadam us sey ziyada milta hai? usney kaha : agar tum humwaar retili zamin par eik chadar khinch kar (usey bilkul humwaar kar do, phir) is (ret) par chalo to main tumharey sawal ka jawab dey dungi. unhoney chadar khinchi, phir log us (humwaar ret) par chaley. us aurat ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key qadame Mubarak key nishan ko dekh kar kaha : ye sahab us (Ibrahim (Alaihissalam)) sey sab sey ziyada mushaabihat rakhtey hain. uskey baad taqriban bees saal ya (kam o besh) jitna Allah ney chaha, utna arsa guzraa, phir Allah Taala ney Hazrat Muhammad (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko (nabuwat ata farma kar) mab-us farma (bhaij) diya."
"2351","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik bachchey ko uskey walid aur walida key darmiyan intikhaab ka moqey diya aur farmaya : ladkey ! ye teri walida hai aur ye tera walid hai (tu jis key sath chahey chala ja)."
"2352","Hazrat Abdul-Hameed bin Salma (Rahimahullah) apney walid sey aur wo unkey dada sey riwayat kartey hain ke unkey waliden ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein muqadma pesh kiya, un mein sey eik kafir tha aur eik musalman tha. Nabi (Alaihissalam) ney bachchey ko ikhtiyar diya to wo kafir ki taraf maael huwa to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aey Allah ! isey hidayat dey. to wo musalman ki taraf maael ho gaya, chunanche Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us (musalman) key haq mein faisla dey diya."
"2353","Hazrat Amr bin Auf Ansari (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna aap farma rahey they : musalmanon key darmiyan suleh durust hai siwaye us suleh key jo kisi halal ko haram karey ya haram ko halal karey."
"2354","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney main eik sahab they, un ki aql kamzor thi. aur wo kharid aur farokht kartey they (to dhoka kha jatey they) unkey ghar walon ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! un par pabandi laga dijiye. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen talab farmaya aur kharid aur farokht sey mana kar diya unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! main kharid aur farokht sey sabr nahin kar sakta to aap ney farmaya : jab to kharid aur farokht karey to keh diya kar : dhoka na karna."
"2355","Janab Muhammad bin Yahya bin Hibban (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : wo merey par-dada Hazrat Munqid bin Amr (Raziallahu anhu) they. unkey sar mein shadeed zakham aaya tha (jo dimagh ki jhilli tak pahuncha) is sey un ki zaban mein bhi luknat paida ho gaee thi, uskey bawajud wo tijarat tarak nahin kartey they aur un sey hamesha dhoka ho jata tha, chunanche unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar soorate haal arz ki to aap ney farmaya : jab tum lain-den karo to keh diya karo : dhoka nahin, phir tum jo chiz bhi kharido, us main tumhen teen din tak (wapis karney ka) ikhtiyar hoga, agar pasand aaye to rakh lo, napasand ho to uskey Malik ko wapis kar do."
"2356","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney main eik shakhs ney (baagh key) phal khareedey jin mein usey bahut khasara huwa aur wo bahut maqrooz ho gaya, chunanche Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey sadqa do. logon ney isey sadqa diya lekin us sey uska pura qarz ada nahin ho sakta tha to Rasulullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney qarz khuwahon sey farmaya : tumhen jo kuch milta hai ley lo, iskey siwa tumhen kuchh nahin milega."
"2357","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ko qarz khuwahon (chaahnewalon) key haath sey chhudaayaa, phir unhen Yamen mein aamil (governer ya zakat wasul karney ka zimmey-daar) muqarrar farma diya. Hazrat Muaz (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mera maal dey kar mujhey chhudaayaa, phir mujhey aamil bana diya."
"2358","Haddathana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba, haddathana Sufyan bin Uyayna aur Haddathana Muhammad bin Rumh, anba’ana al-Laith bin Saad, jamee’an an Yahya bin Saeed, an Abu Bakr bin Muhammad bin Amr bin Hazm, an Umar bin Abdul Aziz, an Abu Bakr bin Abdul Rahman bin al-Harith bin Hisham, an Abu Huraira, qala: Qala Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: “Jis shakhs ne apna maal kisi aise admi ke paas dekh liya jo muflis ho gaya ho, to woh us cheez ka doosron se zyada haqdaar hai.”"
"2359","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ney apni koi chiz bechi, wo chiz usey diwaliya qarar diye huye shakhs key paas waisi hi mil gaee jabke usney abhi uski qeemat mein sey kuchh bhi wasul nahin kiya tha to wo us (bechney waley) ki hai. aur agar usney qeemat ka kuchh hissa wasul kar liya ho to wo bhi doosrey qarz khuwahon key hukm mein hai."
"2360","Hazrat umr bin Khulda Zarqi (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, aur wo Madina Munawra mein Qazi (jaj) they. unhoney farmaya : hamara eik sathi diwaliya ho gaya. hum uskey mamley mein Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) ki khidmat mein hazir huye to unhoney farmaya : aisey hi shakhs key barey mein Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ye faisla farmaya hai : jo shakhs faut ho jaey ya diwaliya ho jaey to saman ka Malik apney saman ka ziyada mustahiq hai, jab wo usey uskey paas waisa hi mil jaey."
"2361","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs faut ho jaey aur uskey paas kisi (qarz chahney wale) ka maal waisa hi mojud ho to qarz chahney wale ney us sey kuchh wasul kiya ho ya na kiya ho, (har haal mein) wo doosrey qarz khuwahon (chahney walon) ki tarah hi hai."
"2362","Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey sawal kiya gaya : kon log behtar hain? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : merey zamaney key (momin) afrad, phir jo un sey muttasil (lage hue) hongey, phir jo un sey muttasil hongey , phir aisey log aa jaeyngey jinki gawahi un ki qism sey pehley aur un ki qism un ki gawahi sey pehley aayegi."
"2363","Hazrat Jabir bin Samura (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney maqame jaabiya mein hum sey khitab farmaya : aap ney is mein farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) hamarey andar isi tarah khadey huye they jis tarah main tumharey andar khada hun, phir farmaya : merey Sahaba key barey mein mera khayal rakhna , phir un logon key barey mein jo un (Sahaba) sey muttasil (lage huey) hongey (yani Tabe-een), phir un logon key barey mein jo un (Tabe-een) sey muttasil hongey (yani Tabbe-Tabe-een), uskey baad jhoot aam ho jaeyga yahan tak key aadmi gawahi dega , halanke us sey gawahi talab nahin ki jaaeygi. aur wo qism khayega, halanke us sey qism nahin li jaeygi."
"2364","Haddathana Ali bin Muhammad aur Muhammad bin Abdul Rahman al-Ju’fi, unhon ne kaha: Haddathana Zaid bin al-Hubab al-Ukli, akhbarani Ubayy bin Abbas bin Sahl bin Saad al-Sa’idi, haddathana Abu Bakr bin Amr bin Hazm, haddathana Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Amr bin Uthman bin Affan, haddathana Kharija bin Zaid bin Thabit, akhbarani Abdul Rahman bin Abi Amra al-Ansari, ke usne Zaid bin Khalid al-Juhani ko ye kehte hue suna ke usne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko ye farmate hue suna: “Behtareen gawah woh hai jo apni gawahi is se pehle de de ke us se maangi jaye.”"
"2365","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney ye aayat padhi : (يَـٰٓأَيُّهَا ٱلَّذِينَ ءَامَنُوٓا۟ إِذَا تَدَايَنتُم بِدَيْنٍ إِلَىٰٓ أَجَلٍ مُّسَمًّى)'''aey momino ! jab tum eik muqarrara muddat tak qarz lo ya do.'' yahan tak key aap is aayat par pahunchey : (فَإِنْ أَمِنَ بَعْضُكُم بَعْضً),''agar tum aapas main eik doosrey sey mutmain ho (to jisey amanat di gaee hai wo isey ada kerey).''  to farmaya : usney pehli aayat ko mansookh kar diya."
"2366","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib apney walid (Hazrat Shuaib bin Muhammad) sey aur wo apney dada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma)) sey riwayat kartey hain, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : khayanat karney waley mard aur aurat ki gawahi qubul nahin, aur na uski jisey Islam (laney key baad kisi jurm ki saza) mein had lagai gaee ho, aur na apney bhai sey adawat rakhney waley ki gawahi qubul hai."
"2367","Haddathana Harmala bin Yahya, haddathana Abdullah bin Wahb, akhbarani Nafi’ bin Yazid, an Ibn al-Had, an Muhammad bin Amr bin Ata, an Ata bin Yasar, an Abu Huraira, ke usne Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko ye farmate hue suna: “Badwi ki gawahi shehri ke khilaf nahi chalegi.”"
"2368","Haddathana Abu Mus’ab al-Madini, Ahmad bin Abdullah al-Zuhri aur Yaqub bin Ibrahim al-Dawraqi, unhon ne kaha: Haddathana Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad al-Darawardi, an Rabia bin Abi Abdul Rahman, an Suhail bin Abi Salih, an apne waldain, an Abu Huraira, ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne gawah aur qasam ke saath faisla diya."
"2369","Haddathana Muhammad bin Bashshar, haddathana Abdul Wahhab, haddathana Ja’far bin Muhammad, an apne waldain, an Jabir, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne gawah aur qasam ke saath faisla diya."
"2370","Haddathana Abu Ishaq al-Harawi, Ibrahim bin Abdullah bin Hatim, haddathana Abdullah bin al-Harith al-Makhzumi, haddathana Saif bin Sulaiman al-Makki, akhbarani Qais bin Saad, an Amr bin Dinar, an Ibn Abbas, qala: Qaza Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam bil-shahid wal-yameen (yani gawah aur qasam ke saath faisla kiya)."
"2371","Haddathana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba, haddathana Yazid bin Harun, anba’ana Juwayria bin Asma, haddathana Abdullah bin Yazid, maula al-Munba’ith, ek shakhs se jo Misr ka rehne wala tha, an Surraq, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne aadmi ki gawahi aur da’wa karne wale ki qasam ko jaiz qarar diya."
"2372","Hazrat Khuraim  (bin Akhram bin Shaddad bin Amr) bin Faatik Asadi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney subah ki namaz padhaai, phir jab aap ney salam pheraa to khadey ho gaey aur farmaya : jhooti gawahi ko shirk key barabar qarar diya gaya hai.  aap ney teen baar ye baat irshad farmaai, phir ye aayat padhi : (وَٱجْتَنِبُوا۟ قَوْلَ ٱلزُّورِ حُنَفَآءَ لِلَّهِ غَيْرَ مُشْرِكِينَ"
"2373","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jhooti gawahi deney waley key qadam (hisab kitab key moqey par) apni jagah sey harkat nahin karengey yahan tak key Allah Taala uskey liye jahannam wajib kar dega."
"2374","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ehale kitab ki eik doosrey key barey mein gawahi ko moatabar qarar diya."
"2375","Hazrat Noman bin Bashir (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke unkey walid (Hazrat Bashir bin Saad (Raziallahu anhu)) unhen uthaey huye Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye aur arz kiya : gawah rahen ke mainey Noman ko apney maal mein sey falan falan chiz hiba (hadiya) kar di hai. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tum ney apney sarey beton ko wesi chiz di hai jaisi Noman ko di hai? unhoney kaha : nahin. aap ney farmaya : to is (hiba) par merey siwa kisi aur ko gawah bana lo. phir farmaya : kya tumhen ye baat pasand nahin ke wo sab tum sey barabar husne-suluk karen? Bashir (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : ji haan (pasand hai). Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tab (is tarah) nahin (karna chahiye)."
"2376","Hazrat Noman bin Bashir (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke unkey walid ney unhen eik ghulam hiba (hadiya) kiya. wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye taake aap ko is par gawah bana lein. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : kya tum ney apni tamam aulad ko yehi kuchh diya hai? unhoney kaha : ji nahin. aap ney farmaya, phir usey wapis ley lo."
"2377","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) aur Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aadmi key liye jayez nahin ke (kisi ko) koi chiz dey kar wapis ley ley, siwaye walid key, jo kuchh wo apni aulad ko deta hai, (usey wapis ley sakta hai)."
"2378","Hazrat Amr bin Shuaib (Rahimahullah) apney walid sey , wo apney dada (Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma)) sey riwayat kartey hain ke Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : koi shakhs apney hiba sey ruju na karey magar walid apni aulad sey (wapis ley sakta hai)."
"2379","Haddathana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaiba, haddathana Yahya bin Zakariyya bin Abi Zaida, an Muhammad bin Amr, an Abi Salama, an Abu Huraira, qala: Qala Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: “Koi umra nahi, jo shakhs kisi ko umra mein koi cheez de to woh usi (lene wale) ki hai.”"
"2380","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey suna , aap farma rahey they : jisney kisi shakhs ko umra key taur par kuchh diya to wo us (wasul karney waley) ka aur uskey bachchon ka hai. umra karney waley ki baat sey is mein uska haq khatam ho gaya, wo chiz uski hai jisey umr bhar key liye di gaee, aur uski aulad key liye hai."
"2381","Haddathana Hisham bin Ammar, haddathana Sufyan, an Amr bin Dinar, an Tawus, an Hujr al-Madari, an Zaid bin Thabit, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne umra ko waris ka haq qarar diya."
"2382","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : raqbaa kuchh nahin, jisey raqbaa key tor par koi chiz di gaee , wo zindagi mein bhi aur marney par bhi usi ki hai.  Raavi ney bayan kya : raqbaa ka matlab doosrey sey ye kehna hai : ye chiz uski hai jo hum dono mein sey baad mein faut ho."
"2383","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : umra us shakhs key haq mein jari hoga jisey umraa key tor par diya gaya. aur raqbaa us shakhs key haq mein jari hoga jisey raqbaa key tor par diya gaya."
"2384","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs apna Atiya wapis leta hai, wo kuttey ki tarah hai, jo khata rehta hai, jab sair ho jata hai to qai kar deta hai, phir apni qai ko dobara khaney lag jata hai."
"2385","Haddathana Muhammad bin Bashshar aur Muhammad bin al-Muthanna, unhon ne kaha: Haddathana Muhammad bin Ja’far, haddathana Shu’ba, qala: Maine Qatada se suna jo Saeed bin al-Musayyab se, an Ibn Abbas, qala: Qala Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: “Apna hiba wapis lene wala us ki tarah hai jo apni qay (ulti) wapis le.”"
"2386","Haddathana Ahmad bin Abdullah bin Yusuf al-Ar’ari, haddathana Yazid bin Abi Hakim, haddathana al-Umari, an Zaid bin Aslam, an Ibn Umar, an Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, qala: “Apna hiba wapis lene wala us kutte ki tarah hai jo apni qay mein wapis jata hai.”"
"2387","Haddathana Ali bin Muhammad aur Muhammad bin Isma’il, unhon ne kaha: Haddathana Wakii, haddathana Ibrahim bin Isma’il bin Mujammi’ bin Jariya al-Ansari, an Amr bin Dinar, an Abu Huraira, qala: Qala Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: “Aadmi apne hiba par tab tak zyada haqdaar hai jab tak uska badla na diya jaye.”"
"2388","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney eik khutba diya. is mein aap ney farmaya : aurat ko khawind ki ijazat key baghair apney maal mein tasarruf (dakhal) jayez nahin, jabke wo uski ismat ka Malik ho (jab tak nikah qaaim ho)."
"2389","Hazrat Kaab bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ki aulad mein sey eik sahab Hazrat Abdullah bin Yahya (Rahimahullah) apney walid sey aur wo apney dada (Hazrat Kaab bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain ke un ki daadi, yani Hazrat Kaab bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) ki ehliya Hazrat Khaira‬ (Raziallahu anha) apna zewar ley kar Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur arz kiya : main ye sadqa karti hun. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aurat key liye khawind ki ijazat key baghair apney maal mein tasarruf (dakhal) karna durust nahin. kya tum ney Kaab sey ijazat li hai? unhoney kaha : haan. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unkey khawind Hazrat Kaab bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) key paas pegham bhej kar daryaft farmaya : kya tum ney Khaira ko ijazat di hai ke wo apna zewar sadqa kar dey? unhoney kaha : ji haan. chunanche Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey sadqa wasul farma liya."
"2390","Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : apney sadqey sey ruju na karo. yani kisi ko sadqa dey kar wapis na lo."
"2391","Haddathana Abdul Rahman bin Ibrahim al-Dimashqi, haddathana al-Walid bin Muslim, haddathana al-Awza’i, haddathani Abu Ja’far Muhammad bin Ali, haddathani Saeed bin al-Musayyib, haddathani Abdullah bin al-Abbas, qala: Qala Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam: “Jo shakhs sadaqa dey phir use wapas le, us ki misaal us kutte ki hai jo qay karta hai phir wapas ja kar apni qay khata hai.”"
"2392","Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamanae Mubarak main eik ghoda sadqa kiya. phir (baad mein) unhoney dekha ke uska Malik (jisey wo ghoda sadqe key tor par diya gaya tha) usey kam qeemat par bech raha hai. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho kar uskey mutalliq masla daryaft kiya to aap ney farmaya : apna sadqa mat kharido."
"2393","Hazrat Zuber bin Awam (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unka eik ghoda jis ka naam ghamar ya ghamraa tha, unhoney wo (bator sadqa kisi ko) sawari key liye dey diya. baad mein unhoney uskey eik bachhedey ya bachheiri ko biktaa dekha to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen us (ko kharidney) sey mana kar diya."
"2394","Hazrat Abdullah bin Barida (Rahimahullah) apney walid (Hazrat Barida bin Haseeb Aslami (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain ke unhoney farmaya : eik aurat Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir hui aur kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey apni walida ko eik londi sadqe key taur par di thi. ab walida faut ho gaee hain. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah ney tujhey ajr dey diya aur wo (londi) virasat key taur par terey paas wapis aa gaee."
"2395","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke eik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa aur kaha : mainey apni walida ko apna eik baagh dey diya tha. (ab) wo faut ho gaee hain, aur merey ilawa koi waris chhod kar nahin gaeen. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tera sadqa durust ho gaya, aur tera baagh teri milkiyat mein wapis aa gaya."
"2396","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Hazrat umr bin Khattab (Raziallahu anhu) ko khaibar mein zamin mili to wo Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye aur mashwara talab kartey huye arz kiya : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey khaibar mein aisa maal mila hai ke meri nazar mein us sey umda maal mujhey kabhi nahin mila to aap mujhey kya hukm farmatey hain? Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar tum chaho to asal zamin apney paas rakho aur us (ki pedawar) ko sadqa kar do. Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney aisey hi kya, aur ye (shart laga di) ke asal zamin na bechi jaeygi, na ( kisi ko) hiba ki jaeygi aur na (kisi ko) virasat key tor par di jaeygi. aap ney wo zamin gharibon key liye, rishte-daaron key liye, Allah ki raah mein, musafiron aur mehmano key liye sadqa kar di, jo uska intizam karey is par gunah nahin ke is mein sey munasib had tak khaye ya dost ko khilaaey lekin us sey maal na kamaey."
"2397","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! khaibar mein mujhey jo sau hissey miley hain, mujhey us sey pyara (aur behtar) maal kabhi nahin mila. mera irada hai ke unhen sadqa kar dun. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : asal (zameen) ko roke rakho aur uska phal Allah ki raah mein (sadqa) qarar dey do. (Imam Ibne-Maja key ustad) ibne-Abi umr ney kaha ke yehi hadees meri kitab main eik dusri jagah ''Sufiyan, an Abdullah, an Nafey an ibne-Umar'' ki sanad sey Hazrat umr sey isi tarah marvi (riwayat hui) hai."
"2398","Hazrat abu-Umama (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye irshad suna hai : aariyatan (udhaar) li hui chiz wapis ki jaey aur doodh key liye liya huwa janwer wapis kiya jaey."
"2399","Haddathana Hisham bin Ammar aur Abdul Rahman bin Ibrahim al-Dimashqi, unhon ne kaha: Haddathana Muhammad bin Shu’aib, an Abdul Rahman bin Yazid, an Saeed bin Abi Saeed, an Anas bin Malik, qala: Maine Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko ye farmate hue suna: “Uziiyat (di hui cheez) wapas ki jaye aur atiya (aarizatan di hui cheez) wapas ki jaye.”"
"2400","Haddathana Ibrahim bin al-Mustamirr, haddathana Muhammad bin Abdullah aur Haddathana Yahya bin Hakim, haddathana Ibn Abi Adi, jamee’an an Saeed, an Qatada, an al-Hasan, an Samura, ke Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: “Haath par us cheez ki zimmedari hai jo usne li hai yahan tak ke woh use wapas kar de.”"
"2401","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr bin Aas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis key paas amanat rakhi gaee ho (aur wo ittifaaq se zaya ho jaey) to is par tawaan (jurmaana) nahin hoga."
"2402","Hazrat Urwa bin Abu-Ja'ad Baarqi (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney unhen bakri kharidney key liye eik Dinar diya. usney do bakriyan kharid lein, phir eik bakri eik Dinar ki bech di aur Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein Dinar bhi pesh kar diya aur bakri bhi. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney uskey haq mein barkat ki dua farmaai. Raavi kehtey hain (iskey baad un ki ye haalat thi ke) agar wo mitti bhi khareedtey to is mein bhi unhen nafa mil jata. Hazrat Urwa bin Abu-Ja'ad Baarqi (Raziallahu anhu) sey dusri riwayat mein ye alfaz hain, unhoney farmaya : bahar sey maale tijarat aaya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney mujhey eik Dinar diya----.  iskey baad pura waaqiyaa bayan farmaya."
"2403","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dolat waley ka taal matol karna zulm hai. aur tum mein sey kisi ko jab maal daar aadmi ka hawala diya jaey to usey chahiye ke hawala qubul kar ley."
"2404","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : dolat waley ka taal matol karna zulm hai aur agar tujhey kisi maal daar aadmi ka hawala diya jaey to qubul kar."
"2405","Haddathana Hisham bin Ammar aur al-Hasan bin Arafa, unhon ne kaha: Haddathana Isma’il bin Ayyash, haddathani Shurahbil bin Muslim al-Khawlani, qala: Maine Abu Umama al-Bahili ko ye kehte hue suna ke maine Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ko ye farmate hue suna: “Zamanat lene wala zimmedaar hai aur qarz ada karna wazib hai.”"
"2406","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney main eik aadmi key zimmey dusron key das Dinar they. wo har waqt maqrooz key sath rehney laga. maqrooz ney kaha : tujhey deney ko merey paas kuch nahin. usney kaha : Allah ki qism ! main tujhey nahin chhodunga yahan tak key to mera qarz ada karey ya koi zaamin pesh karey. wo usey khinch kar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein ley aaya to Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : to isey kitney arsey ki mohlat deta hai? usney kaha : eik mahiney ki. Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : main iski zimmey daari uthata (zamanat deta) hun. maqrooz Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key farmaai huye waqt par hazir ho gaya . Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey farmaya : tujhey ye maal kahan sey mila? usney kaha : eik kaan sey. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : is mein koi bhalai nahin. aur khud uska qarz ada kar diya."
"2407","Hazrat Abu-Qatada (Haris bin Rabee Ansari) (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, (unhoney farmaya : ) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key paas eik janaza laya gaya taake aap uski namaze janaza ada farmaain to aap ney farmaya : tum log apney sathi ka janaza padh lo (main nahin padhunga) is par qarz hai. Hazrat Abu-Qatada (Raziallahu anhu) ney arz kya : main iski zimmey-daari uthata hun. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : (zimme-daari) puri karogey? unhoney kaha : puri karunga. aur uska qarz atthaara ya unnis dirham tha."
"2408","Hazrat Imran bin Huzefa (Rahimahullah) Ummul-mominin Hazrat Memuna binte Haris (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat kartey hain ke wo qarz liya karti thin. unkey ghar key kisi fard ney us ko na-munasib samajhtey huye arz kiya : aap aisa na kiya karen. unhoney farmaya : kyon na lun? mainey apney Nabi aur apney mehbub (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye farman suna hai : jo musalman qarz leta hai aur Allah ko uskey barey mein ye ilm hota hai ke wo isey ada karney ka irada rakhta hai to Allah Taala uska qarz duniya hi mein utaar deta hai."
"2409","Hazrat Abdullah bin Jaafar bin Abi Talib (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah Taala qarz leney waley key sath hota hai yahan tak key wo qarz ada kar dey, jabkey (qarz) us kaam key liye na ho jo Allah ko na-pasand hai. Hazrat Abdullah bin Jaafar (Raziallahu anhuma) apney khazanchi sey kaha kartey they : jao ! merey liye qarz ley aao. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka ye farman sunney key baad main pasand nahin karta ke main koi raat (is tarah) guzaarun ke Allah merey sath na ho."
"2410","Haddathana Hisham bin Ammar, haddathana Yusuf bin Muhammad bin Saifi bin Suhaib al-Khair, haddathani Abdul Hameed bin Ziyad bin Saifi bin Suhaib, an Shu’aib bin Amr, haddathana Suhaib al-Khair, an Rasul Allah sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, qala: “Jo shakhs qarz kare aur us waqt us ka irada na ho ke woh use ada karega, to woh Allah se aisa mulakat karega j jaise chori karne wala.” Haddathana Ibrahim bin al-Mundhir al-Hizami, haddathana Yusuf bin Muhammad bin Saifi, an Abdul Hameed bin Ziyad, an apne waldain, an apne dada Suhaib, an Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam, isi ke misl."
"2411","Haddathana Yaqub bin Humaid bin Kasib, haddathana Abdul Aziz bin Muhammad, an Thawr bin Zaid al-Dili, an Abi al-Ghaith, maula Ibn Muti’, an Abu Huraira, ke Nabi sallallahu alayhi wa sallam ne farmaya: “Jo shakhs logon ka maal is iraade se le ke use barbaad kare to Allah use barbaad kar dega.”"
"2412","Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key azad karda ghulam Hazrat Soban (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis shakhs ki jaan us haal mein uskey jism sey nikli ke wo teen chizon sey pak tha, wo jannat mein dakhil ho jaeyga : takabbur sey, maale-ghanimat ki khayanat sey aur qarz sey."
"2413","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : momin ki rooh uskey qarz ki wajeh sey latakti rehti hai yahan tak key uski taraf sey (qarz) ada kar diya jaey."
"2414","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs is haal mein faut huwa ke uskey zimmey eik Dinar ya eik dirham tha, wo uski nekiyon sey ada kya jaeyga, wahan (aakhirat mein) Dinar hongey na dirham."
"2415","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamanae Mubarak mein jab koi momin maqrooz ho kar faut hota to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) uskey barey mein poochhtey aur farmatey : kya usney apney qarz ki adaegi ka saman chhoda hai? agar log kehtey : haan to aap uska janaza padhatey aur agar log kehtey : nahin to aap farmatey : apney sathi ka janaza padh lo. jab Allah Taala ney apney Nabi ko futoohaat (aur ghaneematein) ata farmaeen to aap ney farmaya : main mominon sey un ki janon sey bhi ziyada talluq rakhta hun, isliye jo koi maqrooz faut hoga to uskey qarz ki adaegi merey zimmey hai aur jo koi maal chhod kar faut ho jaeyga to wo maal uskey warison ka hai."
"2416","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo koi maal chhod jaey to wo uskey warison ka hai aur jo koi qarz ya chhotey bachchey chhod jaey to uski adaegi aur un ki nigehdasht (dekh-bhaal) merey zimmey hai. aur main mominon sey sab sey ziyada talluq rakhney wala hun (ya unka ziyada zimmey daar hun)."
"2417","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney kisi tang dast par aasani ki to Allah Taala duniya aur aakhirat mein usey aasani ata farmaeyga."
"2418","Hazrat Barida bin Haseeb Aslami (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs kisi tang dast ko mohlat deta hai, usey har roz sadqey ka sawab milta hai. aur jisney wajibul-adaa honey key baad mazeed mohlat di, usey bhi yehi sawab milta hai, (yani) har roz sadqey ka sawab hota hai."
"2419","Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key Sahabi Hazrat Abu Yousr (Kaab bin Amr Sulami (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo shakhs pasand karta hai ke Allah Taala usey apney saye mein jagah dey to usey chahiye ke tang dast ko mohlat dey ya uska qarz maaf kar dey."
"2420","Hazrat Huzefa (bin Yamaan (Raziallahu anhuma)) sey riwayat hai, Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : eik aadmi faut ho gaya. usey kaha gaya : tu ney kon sa (nek) amal kiya hai? usey yad aa gaya, ya yad dilaaya gaya to usney kaha : main sikkey aur naqdi mein chashm poshi (nazar andaaz) karta tha aur tang dast ko (qarz ki adaegi mein) mohlat dey diya karta tha. Allah Taala ney usey maaf kar diya. Hazrat Abu-Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : mainey bhi Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye hadees suni hai."
"2421","Haddasana Muhammad bin Khalaf Al-Asqalani aur Muhammad bin Yahya ne kaha, humein Ibn Abi Maryam ne bayan kiya, unhone Yahya bin Ayyub se, unhone Ubaidullah bin Abi Ja'far se, unhone Nafi' se, unhone Ibn Umar aur Aisha se riwayat kiya ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Jo shakhs apna haq talab kare to woh use puri iffat ke saath talab kare"," chahe woh haq poori tarah milay ya na.\"""""
"2422","Haddasana Muhammad bin Al-Muammal bin As-Sabbah Al-Qaisi ne kaha, humein Muhammad bin Muhabb Al-Qurashi ne bayan kiya, unhone Saeed bin As-Saib At-Taifi se, unhone Abdullah bin Yamin se, unhone Abu Hurairah se riwayat kiya ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne haq walay se farmaya: \Apna haq puri iffat ke saath lo"," chahe woh poori tarah milay ya na.\"""""
"2423","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah ne kaha, humein Shababah ne bayan kiya, aur Haddasana Muhammad bin Bashshar ne kaha, humein Muhammad bin Ja'far ne bayan kiya, unhone kaha humein Shubah ne bayan kiya Salmah bin Kuhail se, maine Abu Salamah bin Abdur Rahman se suna, woh Abu Hurairah se riwayat karte hain ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Behtareen log tum mein se – ya behtareen logon mein se – woh hain jo qarz ada karne mein behtar hain.\"""""
"2424","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abu-Rabeea (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney un sey ghazwae Hunain key moqey par tees hazar ya chaalis hazar qarz liya. jab Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) (ghazwe sey wapis) tashrif laye to unhen qarz ada kar diya, phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Allah terey ghar baar mein aur terey maal mein barkat ata farmaaey. udhaar ka badla (qarz ki) adaegi aur shukriya ada karna hai."
"2425","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey qarz wapis maangney aaya , ya kisi aur maali haq ka mutalba karney aaya. usney kuchh (na munasib) alfaz kahey. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key Sahaba Raziallahu anhum ney usko saza dene ka irada kiya to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ruk jao, qarz waley ko apney sathi (maqrooz) par ikhtiyar hota hai, jab tak wo adaegi na kar dey."
"2426","Hazrat Abu-Saeed Khudri (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : eik baddoo (ea'raab) Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey apney kisi qarz ka taqaza karney aaya jo aap key zimmey tha. usney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey sakht lehje mein baat ki, yahan tak key yahan tak keh diya : agar aap ada nahin kerengey to main aap key sath sakht ravaiya ikhtiyar karunga. Sahaba Raziallahu anhum ney usey daantaa aur kaha : tujh par afsos ! kya tujhey malum nahin to kis sey mukhatib hai? usney kaha : main to apna haq mang raha hun. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum ney haq waley ka sath kyon na diya? phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat khaula binte Qais (Raziallahu anha) ko pegham bheja : agar tumharey paas khajuren hain to hamein qarz dey do, hamari khajuren aayengi to hum tumhara qarz ada kar dengey. unhoney kaha : merey maa baap aap par qurban, aey Allah key Rasool ! main hukm ki taameel karungi. unhoney aap ko (khajuren) qarz dey den. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Erabi (dehati) (dehaati) ka qarz ada kiya aur usey khana khilaya. usney kaha : aap ney mujhey pura haq dey diya, Allah aap ko pura dey to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aisey log behtareen hotey hain. wo qom paak nahin hoti jis mein kamzor ko pareshan kiye baghair uska haq na diya jaaey."
"2427","Hazrat Amr bin Shareed (Rahimahullah) apney walid (Hazrat Shareed Saqafi (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : adaegi ki taqat rakhney wala taal matol karey to uski be-Izzati karna aur usey saza dena jayez ho jata hai. (Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key ustaad) Ali bin Muhammad Tanaafusi (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : be Izzatii karney sey murad uski shikayat karna aur saza sey murad qaid karna hai."
"2428","Hazrat Harmaas bin Habib (Rahimahullah) apney walid (Hazrat Habib bin Solba) sey aur wo Harmaas key dada (Hazrat Solba Tameemi Anbari (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey hain, unhoney farmaya : main apney eik maqrooz ko ley kar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huwa. aap ney mujh sey farmaya : (ye jahan jaey) iskey sath raho. phir Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) Sham key waqt merey paas sey guzrey to farmaya : aey bani Tameem key bhai ! tumharey qaidi ka kya bana?"
"2429","Hazrat Kaab bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney masjid mein Hazrat Abdullah bin Abu Hadrad (Raziallahu anhu) sey unkey zimmey apney qarz ki wapsi ka taqaza kiya. un ki aawazen buland ho gaeen yahan tak key Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney apney ghar mein un ki aawazen sun lein. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) bahar nikal kar unkey paas tashrif laye aur Hazrat Kaab (Raziallahu anhu) ko aawaz di, unhoney kaha : Allah key Rasool ! main hazir hun. aap ney farmaya : apney qarz mein sey itna maaf kar do. aur haath sey nisf (aadhe) ka ishara kiya (aadha qarz chhod do). unhoney kaha : mainey maaf kiya. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney (ibne Abu Hadrad (Raziallahu anhu) sey) farmaya : utho, iska qarz ada karo."
"2430","Hazrat Qais bin Romi (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : Hazrat Suleman (Alaihissalam) bin Aznaan (Rahimahullah) ney Hazrat Alqama (Rahimahullah) ko unka wazeefa (tankhwaah) milney tak ki muddat key liye eik hazar dirham qarz diya. jab unhen wazeefa mila to unhon (Suleman) ney un sey sakhti sey (qarz ki wapsi ka) taqaza kiya. Alqama (Rahimahullah) ney adaegi kar di lekin unhen narazi mehsus hui (ke itni sakhti sey taqaza kiya hai) chand maah thehar kar wo (phir) unkey paas aaye aur kaha : mujhey tankhwaah milney tak eik hazar dirham qarz dey den. unhoney kaha : haan, (main badi khushi sey aap ka) ehtiraam kartey huye (aap ko qarz deta hun, phir apni biwi sey kaha) : aey Umme Utba ! tumharey paas jo mehar band thaili hai, wo ley aao. wo ley aayen to (Alqama sey) kaha : qism hai Allah ki ! ye aap key wohi dirham hain jo aap ney mujhey ada kiye they. mainey in mein sey eik dirham bhi idhar-udhar nahin kiya. Alqama (Rahimahullah) ney kaha : kya khub ! aap ney mujh sey jo sulook kiya, iski kya wajeh? unhoney kaha : (iski wajeh wo hadees thi) jo mainey aap sey suni. unhoney kaha : aap ney mujh sey kon si hadees suni? Suleman (Alaihissalam) ney kaha : mainey aap (Alqama) ko Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat kartey suna ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jo musalman doosrey musalman ko dobara qarz deta hai, wo eik baar itna sadqa karney key barabar ho jata hai. Alqama (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : mujhey Hazrat Abdullah bin Masood (Raziallahu anhu) ney (waqaee) isi tarah hadees sunai thi."
"2431","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : Meraj ki raat mainey jannat key darwazey par likha huwa dekha : sadqey ka sawab das guna hai aur qarz ka atthaara guna. mainey kaha : aey Jibril ! kya wajeh hai ke qarz sadqey sey bhi ziyada fazilat ka hamil hai? unhoney kaha : isliye ke saail ( baaz oqaat) sawal karta hai, halanke uskey paas ( uski zarurat ka maal) mojud hota hai jabkey qarz leney wala zarurat (aur majburi (ki haalat hi mein qarz leta hai) kyonkey qarz ki wapsi to zaruri hai, isliye majburi key waqt hi liya jata hai) ."
"2432","Hazrat Yahya bin Abu-Ishaq Hunaai (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey puchha : eik aadmi apney bhai ko maal bataur qarz deta hai, phir wo (maqrooz) usey kuch tohfa dey deta hai (kya ye munasib hai?) unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum mein sey koi shakhs jab (kisi ko) qarz dey, phir (maqrooz) usey tohfa dey ya sawari key liye janwer pesh karey to (qarz khaah ko chahiye ke wo is par sawari na karey aur na wo (tohfa) qubul kerey. siwaye uskey ke un dono mein pehley sey (tohfey ka) ye silsila jari ho."
"2433","Hazrat Saad bin Atwal johni (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unka bhai faut ho gaya, usney teen so dirham (tarka) chhoda aur baal bachey bhi chhodey . mainey chaha ke ye maal uskey biwi bachon par kharch karun . Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tumhara bhai apney qarz ki wajeh sey qaid hai, isliye uska qarz ada karo . to Hazrat Saad (Raziallahu anhu) ney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool ! mainey uska ( sara) qarz ada kar diya hai, siwaye do Dinar key . eik aurat unka daawa karti hai lekin uskey paas koi sabut ( gawahi waghera) nahin . Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : usey dey do , wo sachi hai."
"2434","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke unkey walid (Hazrat Abdullah bin haram Ansari (Raziallahu anhu)) faut huye to unkey zimmey eik Yahudi ka tees wasq ghalla qarz tha. Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) ney us sey mohlat maangi to usney mohlat deney sey inkar kar diya, to Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) ney Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey guzarish ki ke Yahudi sey un ki sifarish kar den , chunanche Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney tashrif ley ja kar Yahudi sey baat cheet ki (aur ye pesh kaash! ki) ke un par jo qarz hai uskey badley wo un ki khajuron ka sara phal ley ley to us ( yahudi) ney ye baat manney sey inkar kar diya . Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney isey Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) ko mohlat deney ka kaha to usney us sey bhi inkar kar diya . Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) khajuron key baagh mein tashrif ley gaey aur darakhton key darmiyan chaley , phir Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey farmaya : phal utaaro aur usey uska haq pura dey do . Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key tashrif ley janey key baad unhoney phal utaar kar teen wasq khajuren us (yahudi) ko dey den aur baara wasq khajuren bach gaeen. Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) us waqiey ki khabar deney key liye Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye to dekha ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) mojud nahin . jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tashrif laye to Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) ney khidmat mein hazir ho kar ittilaa di ke unhoney us (yahudi) ko puri adaegi kar di hai, aur jo miqdaar bach gaee thi wo bhi batai, chunanche Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : umr bin Khattab ko bhi ye baat batao . Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) ney Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) key paas ja kar unhen ye baat batai to Hazrat umr (Raziallahu anhu) ney un sey farmaya : jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) us ( baagh) mein chal rahey they to mujhey usi waqt yaqin ho gaya tha ke Allah Taala us phal mein zarur barkat ata farmaeyga."
"2435","Hazrat Abdullah bin Amr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : qiyamat key din maqrooz sey qarz wasul kya jaeyga, jab wo (maqrooz ho kar) faut ho jaeyga magar jo shakhs teen kamon key liye qarz leta hai) wo us sey mustashna hai. (wo shakhs jiski Allah key raastey mein) jihad karney ki) quwat kam ho jati hai to wo Allah key dushman aur apney dushman ka muqabla karney ki taqat hasil karney key liye qarz leta hai. ( doosra) wo shakhs jis key paas koi musalman faut hota hai aur uskey paas qarz liye baghair uskey kafan dafn ki gunjaaish nahin hoti . aur (teesra) wo shakhs jisey apney be nikah rehney ki surat mein (gunah mein mulawwis honey ka khatra mehsus kar key) Allah sey khof aata hai, wo apney Deen (mein kharabi) key dar sey (qarz ley kar) nikah kar leta hai. Allah Taala qiyamat key din un (teen qism key afrad) ka qarz ada kar dega ."
"2436","Haddasana Abu Bakr bin Abi Shaibah ne kaha, humein Hafs bin Ghiyas ne bayan kiya, Al-A'mash se, Ibrahim se, mujhe Aswad ne bayan kiya, Aisha se, ki Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne ek Yahoodi se maal-e-ghiza (khana) udhaar kharida aur apni zirah (kavach) uske paas rahn rakha."
"2437","Hazrat Anas (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Madiney main eik Yahudi key paas apni zireh girwi rakh kar us sey apney ghar walon key liye jo hasil kiye ."
"2438","Hazrat Asma bint Yazeed bin Sakan (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) jab faut huye to aap ki zireh eik Yahudi key paas ghalley key iwaz girwi rakhi hui thi."
"2439","Haddasana Abdullah bin Muawiyah Al-Jumahi ne kaha, humein Sabit bin Yazid ne bayan kiya, humein Hilal bin Khabbab ne bayan kiya, Ikrimah se, Ibn Abbas se, ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ka inteqal (wafat) hua aur unki zirah ek Yahoodi ke paas rahn thi, tees sa' jaw (barley) ke liye."
"2440","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : sawari ka janwer jab rehan rakha jaey to is par sawari ki jaeygi, aur doodh deney wala janwer (gaey, bhens, bakri waghera) jab rehan rakha jaey to uska doodh piya jaeyga. aur janwer ka kharch us shakhs key zimmey hoga jo sawari karta aur doodh peeta hai."
"2441","Haddasana Muhammad bin Humaid ne kaha, humein Ibrahim bin Al-Mukhtar ne bayan kiya, Ishaq bin Rashid se, Zahri se, Saeed bin Al-Musayyab se, Abu Hurairah se, ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Rahn (girvi) band nahi hota.\"""""
"2442","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : teen shakhs aisey hain jinkey khilaf qiyamat key din mein khud muddai hunga, aur jis key khilaf mein muddai hunga mein us sey muqadma jeet jaunga (lihaza ye teen afraad zarur saza paeyngey.) (eik) wo shakhs jo Allah ka naam ley kar ehad kerey. phir ehad shikni kerey. (doosra) wo jo kisi azad insan ko (ghulam bana kar) bech daley aur uski qeemat kha ley , aur (teesra) wo shakhs jo kisi ko mazdoor rakhey , phir us sey pura kaam ley kar us ko ujrat puri na dey ."
"2443","Haddasana Al-Abbas bin Al-Walid Ad-Dimashqi ne kaha, humein Wahb bin Saeed bin Atiyyah As-Sulami ne bayan kiya, humein Abdur Rahman bin Zaid bin Aslam ne bayan kiya, apne walid se, Abdullah bin Umar se, unhone kaha Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Mazdoor ko uski mazdoori uska pasina khushk hone se pehle de do.\"""""
"2444","Hazrat Utba bin Nudr (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir they. aap ney sura Tua-Seen-Meem (Qasas) tilawat farmaai yahan tak key jab Hazrat Musa (Alaihissalam) key waqiey tak pahunchey ( aayat : 27 , 28 ( to farmaya : Musa ( alehissalam) ney aath das saal pak damani aur pet bhar roti key iwaz mazduri ki."
"2445","Hazrat Hayyan (bin bistaam Hazli (Rahimahullah)) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : mainey Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey suna, unhoney farmaya : mainey yateemi ki haalat mein parwarish pai aur muflisi ki haalat mein hijrat ki. main pet bhar khaney aur (safar key doran mein) apni baari par sawari ki shart par bint ghazawan ka naukar tha. (safar key doran mein) jab wo log (kisi manzil par) thehertey to main unkey liye endhan jama kar key laya karta tha aur jab wo sawar ho kar chaltey to main hudi-khuwani karta (taake oont tez chalen.) Allah ka shukr hai jisney Deen ko sahara (aur taraqqi ka baais) banaya, aur Abu-Hurera ko (deeni aur duniyaawi tor par) Imam (aamil aur governer) bana diya ."
"2446","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko faaqa aa gaya . Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) ko uska ilm huwa to wo kisi kaam ki talash mein nikley taake uskey zariey sey kuch (ujrat) miley jis sey wo Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko khana khilaeyn . wo eik Yahudi key baagh mein ja pahunchey aur uskey liye , eik dol par eik khajoor mazduri ki shart par , satrah dol pani nikala . Yahudi ney aap ko ikhtiyar diya ke satrah ajwa khajuren chun kar ley lein. wo un ( khajuron) ko ley kar Allah key Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho gaey ."
"2447","Hazrat Ali (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main eik khajoor key badley main eik dol pani nikalta tha aur ye shart laga leta tha ke wo umda hogi ."
"2448","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : ansaar mein sey eik sahab ney aa kar arz kya : aey Allah key Rasool ! mujhey aap ( key chehra Mubarak) ka rang badla huwa kyon mehsus ho raha hai? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : bhook ( ki wajeh sey) hai. Ansari sahabi apney ghar gaey, ghar mein unhen (khaney ki) koi chiz na mili. wo (kaam ki) talash mein nikal khadey huye . dekha ke eik Yahudi khajoor key darakhton ko pani dey raha tha. Ansari sahabi ney Yahudi sey kaha : kya main tumharey darakhton ko pani dey dun? usney kaha : haan (dey do) aur kaha : har dol ka moawza eik khajoor hogi . Ansari ney shart laga li ke wo kaali, sookhi aur kharab khajoor nahin leingey balke umda khajoor hi leingey. unhoney (baagh ko) pani dey kar uskey iwaz taqriban do saa khajuren hasil kar lin aur unhen ley kar Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir ho gaey."
"2449","Hazrat Raafey bin khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney muhaaqla aur mazaabna sey mana farmaya , aur irshad farmaya : teen tarah key afrad kaasht kar saktey hain : eik wo aadmi jiski zamin hai, wo usey kaasht karta hai, doosra wo jisey kuch zamin ( tohfey key tor par) di gaee , wo us zamin ko kaasht kar sakta hai jo usey di gaee , teesra wo jo soney ya chaandi key iwaz zamin kiraaey par leta hai."
"2450","Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum mukhaahira par amal kartey they aur is mein harj nahin samajhtey they yahan tak key hamney Hazrat Raafey bin khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) sey unka ye farman suna ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey mana farmaya hai to unki baat sun kar hamney mukhaahira tarak kar diya ."
"2451","Hazrat Jabir bin Abdullah (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum mein sey kuch afrad key paas ( zarurat sey) zayed zameenein thin, wo unhen tihai ya chothai pedawar key iwaz bataai par detey they. Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis key paas zayed zamin ho to wo usey khud kaasht karey ya apney bhai ko kaasht karney dey , agar wo aisey nahin karna chahta to apni zamin apney paas rakhey."
"2452","Hazrat Abu-Hurera (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jis key paas zamin hai to wo usey kaasht kerey. ya apney bhai ko kaasht key liye (bila moawza) dey dey , agar wo aisey nahin karna chahta to apni zamin apney paas rakhey."
"2453","Hazrat Nafey (Rahimahullah) Hazrat Abdullah bin umr (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat kartey hain ke wo apni zamin key khet kiraaey (thekey) par diya kartey they. unkey paas eik shakhs aaya aur Hazrat Raafey bin khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ki hadees bayan ki ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney kheton ko kiraaey par deney sey mana farmaya hai. Hazrat ibne-Umar (Raziallahu anhuma) (Hazrat Raafey (Raziallahu anhu) key paas) gaey aur main bhi aap key sath gaya . unhoney maqam balaat par un sey mulaqat ki aur ye masla daryaft kya to Hazrat Raafey bin khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ney bataya ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney kheton ko kiraaey par deney sey mana farmaya hai, chunanche Hazrat Abdullah (Raziallahu anhu) ney zamin kiraaey par deni tarak kar di ."
"2454","Haddasana Amr bin Usman bin Saeed bin Kathir bin Dinar Al-Himsi ne kaha, humein Zamrah bin Rabiah ne bayan kiya, Ibn Shawdhab se, Matar se, Ata se, Jabir bin Abdullah se, unhone kaha Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne humein khutba diya aur farmaya: \Jis ke paas zameen ho to woh use khud kare ya kisi ko kheti ke liye de"," lekin use kiraaye par na de.\"""""
"2455","Haddasana Muhammad bin Yahya ne kaha, humein Mutarrif bin Abdullah ne bayan kiya, humein Malik ne bayan kiya, Dawood bin Al-Husain se, Abu Sufyan (mawla Ibn Abi Ahmad) se, ki unhone use khabar di ki unhone Abu Saeed Al-Khudri ko kehte suna: Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Muhaqalah se mana kiya. Aur Muhaqalah zameen ko kiraaye par dena hai."
"2456","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney jab logon ko bataai par zamin deney key barey mein bahut baaten kartey suna (ke ye mana hai) to farmaya : subhan Allah ! Allah key Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney to ye farmaya tha : aadmi apney bhai ko zamin kyon nahin dey deta ? aap ney kiraaey par deney sey mana nahin farmaya tha."
"2457","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aadmi ka apney bhai ko (kaasht key liye bila moawza) apni zamin dey dena is baat sey behtar hai ke is par itni itni chiz, yani muqarrar miqdaar wasul kerey. Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ney farmaya : is mamley ko haql kehtey hain. aur ansaar ki boli mein yehi muhaaqla kahlaata hai."
"2458","Hazrat Hanzala bin Qais (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Raafey bin khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey masla daryaft kya to unhoney farmaya : hum is shart par zamin kiraaey par detey they ke jo kuch us tukdey mein paida ho, wo tera hai aur jo kuch is tukdey mein paida ho, wo mera hai, to hamen pedawar key iwaz (us andaz sey) zamin kiraaey par deney sey mana kar diya gaya . chaandi ( muqarrar raqam) key iwaz zamin kiraaey par deney sey mana nahin kya gaya ."
"2459","Hazrat abu-Najaashi ( ata bin Suheb Ansari (Rahimahullah)) sey riwayat hai, unhoney Hazrat Raafey bin khadeej (Raziallahu anhu) ko apney chacha Hazrat Zuher (bin Raafey bin Adi Ansari (Raziallahu anhu)) sey riwayat kartey suna ke unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney hamen eik aisey kaam sey mana farma diya jis mein hamarey liye aasani thi . mainey kaha : jo kuch Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya , wohi durust hai. unhoney kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : tum apney kheton key sath kya kartey ho? hamney kaha : hum unhen (pedawar key) teesrey hissey ya chauthey hissey key iwaz ya gehun aur jo key chand wasq (muqarrara miqdaar) key iwaz kiraaey par dey detey hain. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : aisey na kya karo, khud kaasht karo ya kisi ko kaasht key liye dey do ."
"2460","Hazrat Raafey bin khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : hum mein sey kisi ko jab apni zamin ki zarurat na hoti to wo usey tihai , chothai ya nisf pedawar key iwaz ( kisi ko kaasht key liye) dey deta aur shart laga leta ke nadi key qarib wali zamin (ki pedawar) mein sey teen chothai, aur gaahi hui gehun ki) gaahey janey sey bach rehney wali) baaliyaan, aur (pani ki chhoti) nali sey sairab honey wali zamin (ki pedawar) uski hogi . us zamaney mein guzraan bahut mushkil thi aur zamin mein lohey ( key aalaat kisi aur phaawdey waghera) sey aur jaisey Allah ko manzoor hota, sey kaam hota tha. wo us sey kuch nafa kama leta tha. phir hamarey paas Hazrat Raafey bin khadij (Raziallahu anhu) aaye aur kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney tumhen eik kaam sey mana farma diya hai jis mein (b-zahir) tumhara faeyda tha. ( lekin) Allah ki itaat aur uskey Rasool (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki itaat main tumhara ziyada faeyda hai. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) tumhen muhaaqla sey mana farmatey hain aur irshad farmatey hain : jis ko zamin ki zarurat na ho to wo apney bhai ko Atiya key tor par dey dey , ya rehney dey ."
"2461","Hazrat Urwa bin Zuber (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai ke Hazrat Zaid bin Sabit (Raziallahu anhu) ney farmaya : Allah Taala Hazrat Raafey bin khadij (Raziallahu anhu) ki ghalati maaf farmaaey. qism hai Allah ki ! ye hadees mujhey un sey ziyada malum hai. do aadmi Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ki khidmat mein hazir huye jo aapas mein lad padey they. tab aap ney farmaya : agar tum logon ka yehi haal hai to khet bataai par na diya karo . Hazrat Raafey bin khadij (Raziallahu anhu) ney itna jumla sun liya : khet bataai par na diya karo."
"2462","Hazrat Amr bin Dinar (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : mainey Hazrat Taaus (bin kaisaan) (Rahimahullah) sey kaha : aey abu-Abdur-Rehman ! kaash! aap mukhaahira ( bataai par zamin dena) chhod den kyonkey log kehtey hain ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey mana farmaya hai. unhoney farmaya : aey Amr ! main un ki madad karta hun aur unhen deta hun . aur Hazrat Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ney hamarey yahan is par amal karaya hai aur unkey badey aalim , yani Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) ney farmaya ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney us sey mana nahin farmaya lekin ye farmaya tha : koi apney bhai ko (bila moawza zameen) dey dey to ye is par muqarrar moawza leney sey behtar hai."
"2463","Hazrat Taaus (Rahimahullah) sey riwayat hai, ( unhoney farmaya) Hazrat Muaz bin Jabal (Raziallahu anhu) ney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key ehad Mubarak mein , Hazrat abu-Bakar , Hazrat umr aur Hazrat Usman Raziallahu anhum key zamana khilaafat mein tihai aur chothai ki shart par zamin kiraaey par di . aur aaj tak usi par amal hota aa raha hai."
"2464","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney yehi farmaya tha : agar koi apney bhai ko zamin bila moawza dey dey to ye kaam uskey liye muqarrar karda theka leney sey behtar hai."
"2465","Hazrat Raafey bin khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : log Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key zamaney mein muhaaqla kartey they. unhoney bayan kya ke phir unkey eik chacha (Hazrat Zuher bin Raafey (Raziallahu anhu)) ney aa kar unhen kaha : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ka irshad hai : jis key paas zamin ho to wo usey ghalley ki muqarrar miqdaar key iwaz kiraaey par na dey ."
"2466","Hazrat Raafey bin khadij (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : jisney kuch logon ki zamin mein un ki ijazat key baghair fasal kaasht kar li to usey us fasal mein sey kuch nahin milega , aur uska kharch usey wapis kar diya jaeyga."
"2467","Haddasana Muhammad bin As-Sabbah, Sahl bin Abi Sahl aur Ishaq bin Mansoor ne kaha, humein Yahya bin Saeed Al-Qattan ne bayan kiya, Ubaidullah bin Umar se, Nafi' se, Ibn Umar se, ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne Khaibar walon ke saath aadhe (phallon ya kheti) ke hisse par mu'amala kiya jo paida hota tha."
"2468","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai ke Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney khaibar key rehney walon ( yahudiyon) ko wahan key khajuron key baghaat aur zamin nisf pedawar key iwaz ( kaam karney key liye) ata farmaai ."
"2469","Hazrat Anas bin Malik (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : jab Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney khaibar Fateh kya to usey nisf ( pedawar) key iwaz (kaasht key liye) dey diya ."
"2470","Hazrat Talha bin Ubedullah (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : main Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) key sath khajuron key eik baagh mein sey guzra to aap ney dekha ke log khajuron ko pewand laga rahey hain. Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : ye log kya kar rahey hain? mainey kaha : nar darkht ( key gaabhey) sey ley kar mada darkht key ( phoolon key khoshay key) andar rakh rahey hain. aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : merey khayal main to iska koi faeyda nahin . Sahaba kiram Raziallahu anhum ko ye irshad malum huwa to ye kaam chhod kar darakhton sey utar aaye . Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko iski ittilaa hui to farmaya : ye to ( mera) khayal tha. agar us sey faeyda hota hai to kar liya karo. main to tum jaisa insan hi hun aur (insan ka) khayal ghalat bhi ho sakta hai aur sahih bhi ho sakta hai. lekin main jis masley main tumhen yun kahun : Allah ney farmaya to main Allah par kabhi jhoot nahin bolunga ."
"2471","Hazrat Aaisha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai ke Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ko kuch (logon ki) aawazen sunai den to aap ney farmaya : ye aawaz kaisi hai? arz kya gaya : log khajuron ko pewand laga rahey hain. aap ney farmaya : agar wo aisey na karen to bhi durust hai. chunanche Sahaba kiram Raziallahu anhum ney us saal pewand na lagaey to phal bahut kharab aaya . unhoney Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) sey ye soorate-haal arz ki to aap (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : agar tumhari duniya ka koi maamla ho to usey khud (apney tajribat aur raey ki roshni mein) anjam dey liya karo. agar tumharey Deen ka maamla ho to meri taraf ruju kya karo."
"2472","Hazrat Abdullah bin Abbas (Raziallahu anhuma) sey riwayat hai, Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : musalman teen chizon mein shareek hain : pani, ghaas aur aag mein . aur un ki qeemat lena haram hai.' (Imam Ibne-Maja (Rahimahullah) key ustaad) Hazrat abu-Saeed (Abdullah bin Saeed bin Husain) (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : pani sey murad jari pani (darya , nehar , nadi waghera) hai."
"2473","Haddasana Muhammad bin Abdullah bin Yazid ne kaha, humein Sufyan ne bayan kiya, Abu Az-Zinad se, A'raj se, Abu Hurairah se, ki Rasool Allah (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ne farmaya: \Teen cheezein hain jo rokni nahi chahiye: paani"," ghaas aur aag.\"""""
"2474","Hazrat Aaysha (Raziallahu anha) sey riwayat hai, unhoney kaha : aey Allah key Rasool! kon si chiz ko rok rakhna halal nahin? Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : pani, namak aur aag ko. ummul-mominin (Raziallahu anha) farmati hain : mainey arz kya : ye pani jo hai us ( ki ahmiyat) ko hamney jaan liya. namak aur aag ka kya maamla hai? aap ney farmaya : aey Humera jisney (kisi ko) aag di, usney goya wo sara khana sadqa kya jo us aag sey tayyar huwa. aur jisney namak diya, usney goya wo sab kuch sadqa kar diya jo us namak sey durust huwa. aur jisney kisi musalman ko us jagah pani ka ghoont pilaya jahan pani paya jata hai to usney goya eik ghulam azad kya. aur jisney musalman ko wahan pani ka ghoont pilaya jahan pani nahin paya jata to usney isey zinda kar diya ."
"2475","Hazrat Abyaz bin Hammal (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai ke unhoney namak ki kaan talab ki jisey, saddey-Maarib ka namak kaha jata hai to Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney wo unhen ata farma di. uskey baad Hazrat Aqraa bin Habis Tamimi (Raziallahu anhu) ney hazir ho kar arz kya : aey Allah key Rasool! mainey zamana jahiliyat mein namak ka wo zakhira dekha hai, wo aisey ilaqey mein hai jahan (peeney ka) pani nahin paya jata. jo shakhs wahan jata hai (hasbe-zarurat) namak ley leta hai. wo musalsal hasil honey waley pani ki tarah hai, chunanche Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney Hazrat Abyaz bin Hammal (Raziallahu anhu) sey namak ki wo jaagir wapis talab farma li. unhoney kaha : main is shart par wapis karta hun ke aap usey meri taraf sey sadqa qarar den . Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney farmaya : wo teri taraf sey sadqa hai. wo musalsal hasil honey waley pani ki tarah hai. jo wahan jaeyga, is mein sey ley lega . Hazrat farj bin Saeed (Rahimahullah) ney farmaya : wo aaj tak isi tarah hai. jo koi wahan jata hai (hasbe-zarurat namak) ley leta hai. Raavi kehta hai : Nabi (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney jab un sey namak ka zakhira wapis liya to uskey badley mein unhen jurf murad key maqam par zamin ka tukda aur khajuron ka baagh ata farmaya."
"2476","Haddasana Ali bin Muhammad ne kaha, humein Waki' ne bayan kiya, Usamah bin Zaid se, Qasim bin Muhammad se, Aisha se, unhone kaha Barera ke maamle mein teen sunnatein (ahkaam) saabit hue: jab woh azaad kiya gaya to use ikhtiyar diya gaya (shadi ke silsile mein) aur uska shohar ghulam tha, aur log us par sadqa karte aur woh Nabi (sallallahu alaihi wasallam) ko tohfa deti to aap farmate: \Yeh uske liye sadqa hai aur humare liye tohfa hai.\"" Aur aap ne farmaya: \""Wala (ghulam ki wilayat) usi ko hai jo azaad kare.\"""""
"2477","Hazrat Jabir (Raziallahu anhu) sey riwayat hai, unhoney farmaya : Rasoolullah (Sallallahu Alehi w Aalehi Wasallam) ney ( zarurat puri karney key baad) bacha huwa pani farokht karney sey mana farmaya."
